('affonso', 'Affonso', 'marketing', 'Manage your affiliate program: affiliates, referrals, commissions and payouts.', '/services/affonso.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Affonso","slug":"affonso","skills":[{"body":"# Affonso\n\nAffonso runs the affiliate program: affiliates, the referrals they bring, the commissions those referrals earn, and the payouts that settle them.\n\n## Tools\n\n- Affiliates: `affonso_list_affiliates`, `affonso_get_affiliate`, `affonso_create_affiliate`, `affonso_update_affiliate`, `affonso_delete_affiliate`\n- Referrals (clicks, leads, conversions): `affonso_list_referrals`, `affonso_get_referral`, `affonso_create_referral`, `affonso_update_referral`, `affonso_delete_referral`\n- Commissions: `affonso_list_commissions`, `affonso_get_commission`, `affonso_create_commission`, `affonso_update_commission`, `affonso_delete_commission`\n- Payouts: `affonso_list_payouts`, `affonso_get_payout`, `affonso_update_payout`\n- Affiliate Finder: `affonso_start_finder_search`, `affonso_list_finder_searches`, `affonso_list_finder_results`, `affonso_list_finder_shortlist`, `affonso_add_finder_result_to_shortlist`, `affonso_update_finder_shortlist_item`, `affonso_delete_finder_shortlist_item`\n\nEvery tool takes a `responseFormat` parameter: Markdown by default, `json` when you need to parse the result.\n\n## Working rules\n\nCommissions and payouts are money owed to real people. Read the current state with the `list`/`get` tools and state what you found before you change anything, and never approve a payout or write a commission the user did not ask for.\n\nRecruiting is a two-step move: `affonso_start_finder_search` opens a search, then `affonso_list_finder_results` reads what it turned up. Shortlist the candidates worth a look rather than creating affiliates straight from search results.","name":"affonso-usage","description":"How to use Affonso tools"}],"summary":"Manage your affiliate program: affiliates, referrals, commissions and payouts.","category":"marketin