('agentkey', 'AgentKey', 'seo', 'One key for live web data — search, scraping, social, finance, crypto and e-commerce tools.', '/services/agentkey.png?tone=light', '{"name":"AgentKey","slug":"agentkey","skills":[{"body":"# AgentKey\n\nAgentKey is a gateway to live external data: web search, page scraping, social platforms, finance, crypto, e-commerce and company data. It does not expose one tool per provider. Instead it exposes a small set of meta tools, and you discover the real capability at runtime.\n\n## The three-step flow\n\n1. `find_tools` — describe the data you need in plain language and get back the matching tools. The catalog changes over time, so ALWAYS start here. Never guess or hardcode a tool name.\n2. `describe_tool` — read the input schema of the tool you picked before calling it.\n3. `execute_tool` — run it with arguments that match that schema.\n\nUse `account` to check the remaining credit balance or provider health when a call fails.\n\n## Rules\n\n- One targeted call beats several broad ones: every execution burns credits from a shared monthly balance.\n- Pick the narrowest tool that answers the question rather than scraping a whole site.\n- If a call fails because a provider is down, retry once: AgentKey routes to a backup provider automatically.\n- Prefer AgentKey for sources that normally block agents (X, LinkedIn, Reddit, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube transcripts) and for on-chain or market data.\n","name":"agentkey-usage","description":"How to use AgentKey tools"}],"summary":"One key for live web data — search, scraping, social, finance, crypto and e-commerce tools.","category":"seo","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with AgentKey","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.agentkey.app/v1/mcp","args":[],"name":"agentkey","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"pat","kind":"key","label":"AgentKey API key","inputs":[{"key":"AGENTKEY_KEY","help":"Create a free account at console.agentkey.app and copy your master key.","type":"password","label":"AgentKey API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"ak_live_…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.agentkey.app/v1/mcp","args":[],"name":"agentkey","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.AGENTKEY_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}]}],"description":"AgentKey is a unified data layer that exposes around 1,800 tools from many providers (Brave, Tavily, Exa, Firecrawl, X, Reddit, LinkedIn, YouTube, Yahoo Finance, Crunchbase and more) behind a single hosted MCP server. One subscription with a shared credit balance replaces per-provider API keys, and requests are auto-routed to a backup provider when one is down."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.013839722,-0.0037555695,0.021606445,0.03225708,0.016586304,-0.013053894,-0.022338867,0.057647705,0.027770996,-0.02748108,0.040283203,-0.06161499,-0.05871582,-0.012191772,0.020370483,0.013793945,-0.036254883,-0.008392334,-0.04168701,-0.003528595,0.018722534,-0.01424408,0.013793945,0.047454834,-0.0044174194,-0.002073288,-0.03363037,-0.030380249,0.0049362183,-0.021057129,0.05026245,-0.022857666,0.023483276,0.051818848,-0.0022583008,-0.003993988,0.016723633,-0.012901306,0.031433105,-0.0074920654,-0.012718201,-0.02355957,0.032073975,0.046783447,-0.016403198,-0.007522583,-0.08099365,-0.04397583,-0.0056762695,0.022003174,-0.013793945,-0.011306763,0.0009698868,0.025421143,-0.02218628,-0.0039138794,-0.009407043,0.007457733,-0.006450653,0.023849487,-0.014968872,-0.01914978,0.010231018,0.059020996,-0.031341553,-0.035247803,-0.03778076,0.03463745,-0.031280518,-0.016921997,-0.016815186,0.000259161,0.0016412735,-0.007068634,-0.042510986,0.02470398,-0.017333984,0.05886841,-0.012550354,-0.042388916,-0.005054474,0.020828247,-0.045837402,-0.029327393,-0.011833191,-0.061920166,-0.014137268,-0.035491943,-0.05718994,0.02986145,-0.046020508,-0.02330017,-0.03074646,0.025299072,0.05783081,0.10479736,-0.05041504,0.0022907257,-0.0013875961,0.08215332