('agentmail', 'AgentMail', 'productivity', 'Give your agent its own email inboxes to send, receive and reply to email.', '/services/agentmail.png?tone=light', '{"name":"AgentMail","slug":"agentmail","skills":[{"body":"# AgentMail\n\nAgentMail gives you real email inboxes of your own (addresses like `name@agentmail.to`).\n\n- List your inboxes first and reuse an existing one before creating a new inbox.\n- To answer an email, reply in its thread instead of sending a new message, so the conversation stays grouped.\n- When a message needs a human check first, create a draft and send it only once confirmed.\n- Search threads and messages before asking the user for context you can find in the inbox.\n- Never delete an inbox or a thread unless the user explicitly asks.","name":"agentmail-usage","description":"How to use AgentMail tools"}],"summary":"Give your agent its own email inboxes to send, receive and reply to email.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with AgentMail","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.agentmail.to/mcp","args":[],"name":"agentmail","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"API key","inputs":[{"key":"AGENTMAIL_API_KEY","help":"Starts with `am_`. Create one in the [AgentMail console](https://console.agentmail.to).","type":"password","guide":"1. Open the [AgentMail console](https://console.agentmail.to) and sign in.\n2. Go to **API Keys** in the dashboard.\n3. Click **Create API key** and give it a name.\n4. Copy the value starting with `am_`.","label":"AgentMail API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"am_…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.agentmail.to/mcp","args":[],"name":"agentmail","headers":{"x-api-key":"${input.AGENTMAIL_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects AgentMail''s hosted MCP server. Your agent can create dedicated inb