('ahrefs', 'Ahrefs', 'seo', 'Pull SEO insights, keyword research, backlink data, and competitor analysis from Ahrefs in plain English.', '/services/ahrefs.png', '{"name":"Ahrefs","slug":"ahrefs","inputs":[{"key":"MCP_KEY","help":"Generate in Ahrefs: Account Settings > API Keys > Generate MCP key. Requires a Lite or higher plan. Note the MCP key is separate from a regular API key.","type":"password","label":"Ahrefs MCP Key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"your-ahrefs-mcp-key"}],"skills":[{"body":"# Ahrefs\n\nUse the ahrefs_* tools to pull SEO and marketing intelligence from your Ahrefs account.\n\n## What you can do\n- Keyword research: search volume, difficulty, and keyword ideas for a term or domain.\n- Backlink analysis: referring domains, backlinks, and anchor data for a URL or domain.\n- Competitor analysis: compare domains, find content gaps, and analyze organic/paid traffic.\n- Rank tracking and batch analysis across multiple targets.\n\n## Tips\n- Always pass a clear target (a domain or full URL) and a country/market where the tool supports it.\n- Calls consume the Integration API units included in the connected Ahrefs plan, so batch requests and avoid redundant queries.\n- If a call returns an auth error, the MCP key may be missing the MCP scope or the plan may not include MCP access (Lite or higher required).","name":"ahrefs-usage","description":"How to use the ahrefs_* tools for SEO research and competitor analysis."}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Pull SEO insights, keyword research, backlink data, and competitor analysis from Ahrefs in plain English.","category":"seo","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.ahrefs.com/mcp/mcp","args":[],"name":"ahrefs","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.MCP_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects the hosted Ahrefs MCP server so agents can query Ahrefs'' SEO and marketing data - rank tracking, keyword research, backlink and batch analysis, and search volume. Authenticates with an MCP-scoped A