('airtable', 'Airtable', 'productivity', 'Read and write Airtable bases, tables and records.', '/services/airtable.svg', '{"name":"Airtable","slug":"airtable","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Airtable\n\nUse the Airtable tools to work with the user''s bases. Start with list_bases and list_tables to discover structure, and describe_table before writing. Use list_records / search_records to read, and create_record / update_records / delete_records to modify data. Always confirm the target base and table before any write, and never delete records without the user''s explicit go-ahead.","name":"airtable-usage","description":"How to use Airtable tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Read and write Airtable bases, tables and records.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[],"authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Airtable","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.airtable.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"airtable","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"pat","kind":"key","label":"Personal access token","inputs":[{"key":"AIRTABLE_API_KEY","help":"Create one at airtable.com/create/tokens/new with scopes schema.bases:read and data.records:read (add data.records:write and schema.bases:write to let the agent modify data).","type":"password","label":"Airtable personal access token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"pat…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.airtable.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"airtable","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.AIRTABLE_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects Airtable''s official hosted MCP server (mcp.airtable.com/mcp). Sign in with OAuth, or paste an Airtable personal access token sent as a Bearer header. Lets the agent list bases and tables, inspect schemas, query/search records, and create or update records, tables, fields and comments.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, true, '[-0.018844604,0.