('algolia', 'Algolia', 'dev', 'Connect AI agents to Algolia''s search and analytics through Algolia''s hosted, OAuth-secured MCP server.', '/services/algolia.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Algolia","slug":"algolia","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Algolia\n\nThe Algolia hosted Productivity MCP connects at `https://mcp.algolia.com/mcp` over HTTP and authenticates via browser OAuth (sign in when prompted; no client id or secret needed). Access is user-scoped and read-only, inheriting your Algolia account permissions.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- List the indices in applications you have access to.\n- Search across accessible applications and indices.\n- Pull search analytics helpers: top searches, no-result queries, click positions, no-click rate, top filters, top countries, user counts, and search counts.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Ask for a specific index or application when your account spans several, to scope results.\n- The Productivity MCP is read-only; it does not modify index data or configuration.","name":"algolia-usage","description":"How to use the Algolia Productivity MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Connect AI agents to Algolia''s search and analytics through Algolia''s hosted, OAuth-secured MCP server.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.algolia.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"algolia","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Algolia is a hosted search and discovery platform for developers. Its hosted Productivity MCP lets AI agents list indices, run searches across accessible applications, and pull search analytics such as top searches, no-result queries, and click metrics. Access is user-scoped and read-only, inheriting the signed-in user''s Algolia permissions."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.022094727,0.013641357,0.046691895,0.016815186,0.023895264,-0.0050964355,-0.027908325,0.037322998,-0.015930176,-0.0010528564,0.031219482,-0.035003662,-0.022140503,-0.04876709,-0.0012025833,0.053375244,-0.034240723,-0.04058838,0.0009646416,0.06