('amplitude', 'Amplitude', 'analytics', 'Query product analytics, charts, cohorts and experiments via Amplitude.', '/services/amplitude.png', '{"name":"Amplitude","slug":"amplitude","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Amplitude\n\nUse the amplitude_* tools to query product analytics: explore events and user behavior, build and read charts and dashboards, inspect cohorts, and run experiment queries. Access is scoped to the user''s Amplitude permissions. Confirm the target project before creating or modifying any Amplitude content.","name":"amplitude-usage","description":"How to use Amplitude tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Query product analytics, charts, cohorts and experiments via Amplitude.","category":"analytics","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.amplitude.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"amplitude","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects Amplitude''s official hosted MCP server over OAuth. The agent can explore product data, build and read charts and dashboards, inspect cohorts and run experiment queries, scoped to your existing Amplitude permissions. No API key is stored; you authenticate through Amplitude''s OAuth flow on first connect.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, true, '[-0.00029110909,0.00932312,0.055358887,0.018753052,0.0044898987,0.031311035,-0.035827637,0.0032749176,0.014305115,-0.034454346,0.032440186,-0.04940796,-0.02520752,0.0057678223,0.02848816,0.06088257,-0.051483154,-0.01411438,-0.06149292,0.029937744,0.021377563,0.030975342,-0.006099701,0.012611389,0.013061523,-0.005241394,-0.043823242,0.029678345,0.0340271,-0.021987915,-0.00737381,-0.04244995,-0.04925537,0.03942871,0.017303467,0.014450073,-0.028305054,0.01184082,0.012168884,-0.0026683807,-0.03955078,-0.012924194,0.02003479,0.08477783,0.0036907196,-0.0076522827,-0.070739746,-0.019577026,0.01272583,0.022842407,0.00013029575,0.015808105,-0.0018625259,0.06274414,-0.001335144,0.039123535,0.052215576,0.021026611,0.007774353,-0.0051345825,-0.026260376,-0.053894043,