('arcads', 'Arcads', 'marketing', 'Generate UGC-style video ads with AI actors from a script.', '/services/arcads.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Arcads","slug":"arcads","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Arcads\n\nUse the arcads tools to turn ad scripts into UGC-style videos performed by AI actors.\n\nList the available tools first: the server exposes them for products, folders, actors/templates, scripts and video generation.\n\nTypical flow: create or pick a product, write the script variations, pick the AI actors, launch the generation, then poll until the videos are ready and return their URLs.\n\nEach generation consumes Arcads credits, so confirm the script, the actor selection and the number of variations with the user before launching. Never re-run a generation to \"retry\" without asking.","name":"arcads-usage","description":"How to use Arcads tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Generate UGC-style video ads with AI actors from a script.","category":"marketing","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.arcads.ai","args":[],"name":"arcads","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects Arcads'' hosted MCP server. You sign in with your Arcads account, no key to paste. Turn scripts into UGC video ads performed by AI actors, then fetch the rendered videos. Requires an active Arcads subscription with remaining credits."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.026412964,0.020233154,0.0026741028,-0.004333496,0.025238037,-0.038146973,-0.008476257,0.008255005,0.030532837,0.02355957,0.0137786865,-0.0574646,0.014282227,-0.027526855,-0.00046801567,-0.014091492,-0.04901123,-0.049316406,-0.020263672,0.010887146,0.009750366,0.02558899,0.030136108,0.032409668,-0.015975952,0.009239197,-0.04537964,0.025253296,0.00076675415,-0.00038814545,0.018722534,-0.02381897,-0.027862549,0.0137786865,-0.03741455,-0.0011348724,-0.014892578,-0.003145218,-0.006881714,-0.009124756,0.022354126,-0.012481689,0.015853882,0.015853882,-0.00055503845,0.015510559,-0.02911377,-0.008033752,0.008872986,