('autodesk', 'Autodesk', 'productivity', 'Search Autodesk product help and support documentation across AutoCAD, Revit, Fusion, and the full Autodesk catalog.', '/services/autodesk.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Autodesk","slug":"autodesk","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Autodesk Knowledge MCP\n\nThis is Autodesk''s public help/documentation MCP server. No sign-in or API key is required.\n\n## Tools\n\n- `get_available_products` — returns the canonical Autodesk product catalog (each item has product_name, product_code, release_codes). Use it to discover or validate the exact product value before filtering a search.\n- `search_help_content` — searches Autodesk help articles and product documentation. Required args: `query` (keyword-rich text, include exact error codes/messages when relevant) and `locale` (e.g. `en_US`, `fr_FR`, `de_DE`). Optional: `product_code` (preferred) or `product_name`, `release_code`, `sources` (`sfdc_articles` and/or `product_documentation`), and `max_results` (default 5).\n\n## Tips\n\n- Pass `locale` explicitly; do not guess it.\n- When filtering by product, use the exact `product_code`/`product_name` from `get_available_products` rather than guessing. Prefer `product_code`.\n- For error troubleshooting, put the exact error text/code in `query`.\n- Results include a `url` you can cite back to the user.\n","name":"autodesk-usage","description":"How to search Autodesk help content and the product catalog"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Search Autodesk product help and support documentation across AutoCAD, Revit, Fusion, and the full Autodesk catalog.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://developer.api.autodesk.com/knowledge/public/v1/mcp","args":[],"name":"autodesk","headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects to Autodesk''s public Knowledge MCP server, a hosted endpoint that requires no credentials. It provides tools to browse the canonical Autodesk product catalog and search official Autodesk help articles an