('brandsearch', 'Brandsearch', 'marketing', 'Research ecommerce brands, winning Meta, TikTok and Instagram ads, emails and products from a 14M-store index.', '/services/brandsearch.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Brandsearch","slug":"brandsearch","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Brandsearch\n\nBrandsearch indexes 14M+ ecommerce stores and 400M+ ads, organic posts and emails.\n\n- Start from a brand: look it up by domain, then pull its summary, Meta ads aggregates, TikTok/Instagram posts, emails and products.\n- Find winning creatives across all brands with the Meta ad, TikTok and Instagram search and discover tools; filter by vertical, date and performance.\n- To show a creative, use `download_ad` (it returns the image inline) instead of fetching a media URL: those URLs expire after 3 days and are often blocked.\n- `analyze_ad` and `transcribe_ad` spend AI credits: check `get_ai_credits` before running them in bulk.\n- Save findings with the folder tools (`list_folders`, `create_folder`, `add_to_folder`).\n- Every record ends with a `Full data on Brandsearch` link: pass it on when you report a brand, ad or post.","name":"brandsearch-usage","description":"How to research brands, ads and emails with Brandsearch"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Research ecommerce brands, winning Meta, TikTok and Instagram ads, emails and products from a 14M-store index.","category":"marketing","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.brandsearch.co/v1/mcp","args":[],"name":"brandsearch","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects Brandsearch''s hosted MCP server. You sign in with Brandsearch; no key to paste. Your agent can find brands by revenue and ad spend, pull their top ads, emails and product catalogs, analyze creatives and save them to your swipe folders."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.011558533,0.014640808,0.008422852,-0.00016665459,-0.01687622,-0.0390625,-0.031173706,0.037750244,-0.020477295,0.014167786,0.013824463,-0.018630981,-0.0155181885,-0.025405884,0.03283691