('brex', 'Brex', 'payments', 'Connect AI agents to your Brex account to manage expenses, budgets, spend limits, cards, and transactions.', '/services/brex.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Brex","slug":"brex","skills":[{"body":"# Brex\n\nBrex connects AI agents to your Brex financial platform via the hosted MCP server at `https://api.brex.com/mcp`.\n\n## Auth\nEither a browser-based OAuth flow (Dynamic Client Registration) was completed, or the connection uses a Brex API token (Settings → Developer in the Brex Dashboard) sent as a Bearer token. Sessions and tokens can be revoked from the Brex Dashboard.\n\n## What you can do\n- Retrieve account and expense data\n- Manage budgets and spend limits\n- Review card statements and banking transactions\n- Track bills and manage receipts\n- Look up users, cards, and team information\n\nTools support pagination, filtering, and field projection for controlled data retrieval. The assistant operates under the permissions of the authenticated user or service account.\n","name":"brex-usage","description":"How to use Brex MCP tools"}],"summary":"Connect AI agents to your Brex account to manage expenses, budgets, spend limits, cards, and transactions.","category":"payments","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Brex","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.brex.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"brex","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-token","kind":"key","label":"API token","inputs":[{"key":"BREX_API_TOKEN","help":"In the Brex Dashboard: Settings → Developer → create an API token (account or card admin required). It is sent as a Bearer token.","type":"password","label":"Brex API token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"your Brex API token"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.brex.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"brex","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.BREX_API_TOKEN}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Brex is a corporate spend platform offering business cards, expense management, and banking. Its official hosted MCP server lets AI assistants retrieve account and expense data, manage budgets and spend limits, review card and banking transactions, and view team information. Authenticate with browser OAuth (Dynamic Client Registration, recommended) or a Brex API token."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.021194458,0.02949524,0.04699707,0.008369446,-0.0077667236,-0.01889038,0.0029087067,0.066345215,0.02658081,0.00920105,0.015090942,-0.0692749,-0.015342712,-0.011054993,0.019561768,0.036193848,-0.04638672,0.027648926,-0.037353516,0.04107666,-0.021530151,0.08087158,-0.01423645,0.02809143,-0.040405273,0.01902771,-0.03439331,-0.048217773,0.006210327,-0.03869629,0.053222656,-0.018814087,0.016616821,0.024902344,-0.0017843246,0.0042495728,-0.04525757,0.04107666,0.039093018,0.025421143,-0.029464722,-0.00258255,-0.010414124,0.054260254,-0.04232788,-0.011192322,-0.012817383,-0.033050537,0.012573242,0.032104492,-0.03692627,-0.024963379,-0.019943237,0.049041748,-0.031555176,-0.009750366,-0.017578125,-0.023010254,0.004837036,0.024765015,-0.015731812,-0.038635254,0.008117676,0.02116394,-0.010063171,-0.025039673,-0.009109497,0.057769775,0.0039711,-0.008995056,-0.0004925728,0.005455017,-0.004016876,0.011764526,0.027832031,-0.066589355,0.015731812,0.043670654,0.0070495605,-0.013191223,-0.004020691,-0.048187256,-0.06100464,-0.033691406,0.0015106201,-0.035858154,-0.01586914,0.015808105,-0.016082764,-0.026504517,-0.011604309,-0.03543091,0.0013237,-0.024291992,0.05215454,0.03869629,-0.07312012,-0.022018433,-0.007663727,0.059906006,-0.013847351,-0.047729492,-0.020339966,0.018112183,0.015304565,-0.005760193,0.04724121,-0.009803772,0.0037956238,0.02444458,-0.1005249,0.0032463074,-0.0021591187,0.012565613,0.014846802,-0.003929138,0.00055933,-0.0010318756,-0.008934021,-0.058624268,-0.032165527,0.07043457,0.055389404,-0.01234436,0.023925781,-0.009887695,-0.040283203,-0.021713257,-0.01953125