('brightdata', 'Bright Data', 'dev', 'Give AI agents real-time, unblocked access to public web data through Bright Data''s hosted Web MCP server.', '/services/brightdata.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Bright Data","slug":"brightdata","inputs":[{"key":"BRIGHTDATA_API_TOKEN","help":"Find or create it in the Bright Data control panel under Account settings (https://brightdata.com/cp/setting). New accounts also receive a default API key by welcome email.","type":"password","label":"Bright Data API token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"brd_..."}],"skills":[{"body":"# Bright Data Web MCP\n\nBright Data''s hosted MCP server gives agents live, unblocked access to public web data.\n\n## Capabilities\n- Web search across engines\n- Scrape any page to clean markdown/HTML\n- Structured web-data extraction (ecommerce, social, finance, travel, developer sources)\n- Browser automation for interactive sites\n\n## Auth\nAuthentication uses your Bright Data API token, passed in the MCP URL query string (`?token=...`). Find it in the Bright Data control panel under Account settings. Treat the token like a password: it represents full-account credentials.\n\n## Tips\n- Start with the search and scrape tools for most research tasks.\n- Use structured web-data tools when you need clean fields instead of raw HTML.\n- The free tier includes 5,000 requests/month.","name":"brightdata-usage","description":"How to use Bright Data Web MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Give AI agents real-time, unblocked access to public web data through Bright Data''s hosted Web MCP server.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.brightdata.com/mcp?token=${input.BRIGHTDATA_API_TOKEN}","args":[],"name":"brightdata","headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Bright Data''s Web MCP server provides AI agents with an all-in-one solution for public web access, including web search, page scraping, structured web-data extraction, and browser automation. It connects over a fully m