('cal-com', 'Cal.com', 'productivity', 'Manage Cal.com bookings, event types, schedules, and availability through natural language.', '/services/cal-com.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Cal.com","slug":"cal-com","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Cal.com\n\nThe Cal.com MCP server wraps the Cal.com API v2, letting you manage scheduling in natural language.\n\n## Auth\nThe server runs locally over stdio with a Cal.com API key (CAL_API_KEY, format cal_live_…). Create the key in Cal.com -> Settings -> Developer -> API keys.\n\n## Common tasks\n- List and manage event types\n- Create, reschedule, and cancel bookings\n- View available time slots for an event type\n- Manage schedules and availability\n\nAsk for exactly what you want, e.g. ''book a 30-minute intro call next Tuesday afternoon'' or ''show my upcoming bookings''.","name":"cal-com-usage","description":"How to use Cal.com MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Manage Cal.com bookings, event types, schedules, and availability through natural language.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[],"authMethods":[{"id":"api-key","kind":"stdio","label":"API key","inputs":[{"key":"CAL_API_KEY","help":"Create it in Cal.com -> Settings -> Developer -> API keys (format cal_live_…).","type":"password","label":"Cal.com API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"cal_live_…"}],"envKeys":[{"key":"CAL_API_KEY","fromInput":"CAL_API_KEY"}],"mcpServers":[{"env":{"CAL_API_KEY":"${input.CAL_API_KEY}"},"args":["-y","@calcom/cal-mcp@latest"],"name":"cal-com","command":"npx","headers":{},"transport":"stdio"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Cal.com is an open-source scheduling platform for booking meetings and managing availability. Its official MCP server wraps the Cal.com API v2, exposing tools to create and manage bookings, event types, schedules, and available slots. Connect it with a Cal.com API key."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.010620117,0.008880615,0.050994873,0.006000519,-0.022125244,-0.05996704,-0.0020828247,0.016464233,0.0