('canva', 'Canva', 'productivity', 'Create, edit, search, and export Canva designs and manage brand assets through natural language.', '/services/canva.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Canva","slug":"canva","skills":[{"body":"# Canva\n\nFind existing work with CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS, which takes a search query, or browse with CANVA_LIST_FOLDER_ITEMS_BY_TYPE_WITH_SORTING (folder id \"root\" is the top-level Projects folder). Inspect one design with CANVA_FETCH_DESIGN_METADATA_AND_ACCESS_INFORMATION and hand the edit URL back to the user so they can finish it in Canva.\n\nCreate with CANVA_POST_DESIGNS, either from a preset type or with custom pixel dimensions. To place an image, first import it with CANVA_CREATE_URL_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB (public URL in, asset id out). To turn an existing PDF, Word or PowerPoint file into a design, use CANVA_POST_URL_IMPORTS. Export with CANVA_POST_EXPORTS, after checking CANVA_GET_DESIGNS_DESIGNID_EXPORT_FORMATS; the download URLs it returns expire after 24 hours, so pass them on immediately.\n\nEvery job-based tool returns a job id you then poll until it finishes: CANVA_POST_EXPORTS with CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT, CANVA_CREATE_URL_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB with CANVA_GET_URL_ASSET_UPLOADS_JOBID, CANVA_POST_URL_IMPORTS with CANVA_GET_URL_IMPORTS_JOBID, CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB with CANVA_RETRIEVE_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB_STATUS, and CANVA_CREATE_DESIGN_RESIZE_JOB with CANVA_RETRIEVE_DESIGN_RESIZE_JOB_STATUS.\n\nFor repeatable branded output, list templates with CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST, read their fields with CANVA_RETRIEVE_BRAND_TEMPLATE_DATASET_DEFINITION, then fill them with CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB. Brand templates need a Canva Enterprise plan and resizing needs Canva Pro, so tell the user plainly when a call comes back refused for that reason.\n\nOrganize with CANVA_POST_FOLDERS and CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER. CANVA_RETRIEVE_USER_PROFILE_DATA gives the connected account display name.\n\nThe API cannot rewrite the contents of an existing design. To produce a variation, create a new design, resize an existing one, or autofill a brand template.","name":"canva-usage","description":"How to use Canva tools"}],"summary":"Create, export and organize Canva designs, and autofill brand templates, straight from your agent.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Canva","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"canva","allowedTools":["CANVA_LIST_USER_DESIGNS","CANVA_FETCH_DESIGN_METADATA_AND_ACCESS_INFORMATION","CANVA_POST_DESIGNS","CANVA_GET_DESIGNS_DESIGNID_EXPORT_FORMATS","CANVA_POST_EXPORTS","CANVA_GET_DESIGN_EXPORT_JOB_RESULT","CANVA_CREATE_URL_ASSET_UPLOAD_JOB","CANVA_GET_URL_ASSET_UPLOADS_JOBID","CANVA_POST_URL_IMPORTS","CANVA_GET_URL_IMPORTS_JOBID","CANVA_LIST_FOLDER_ITEMS_BY_TYPE_WITH_SORTING","CANVA_POST_FOLDERS","CANVA_MOVE_ITEM_TO_SPECIFIED_FOLDER","CANVA_ACCESS_USER_SPECIFIC_BRAND_TEMPLATES_LIST","CANVA_RETRIEVE_BRAND_TEMPLATE_DATASET_DEFINITION","CANVA_INITIATE_CANVA_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB","CANVA_RETRIEVE_DESIGN_AUTOFILL_JOB_STATUS","CANVA_CREATE_DESIGN_RESIZE_JOB","CANVA_RETRIEVE_DESIGN_RESIZE_JOB_STATUS","CANVA_RETRIEVE_USER_PROFILE_DATA"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/canva","args":[],"name":"canva","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Canva in one click: sign in with Canva and your agent can search your designs, create new ones, import a file from a URL, export to PDF, PNG, JPG or PPTX, upload image assets, organize folders, resize designs and autofill brand templates. The connection is brokered by Composio, which holds the token and runs the Canva Connect calls, so there is no developer console to set up and no token to paste.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.009162903,0.020507812,0.019439697,-0.00