('cloudflare', 'Cloudflare', 'dev', 'Manage Cloudflare DNS, Workers, security, analytics, and thousands of API operations across your Cloudflare account using natural language.', '/services/cloudflare.svg', '{"name":"Cloudflare","slug":"cloudflare","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Cloudflare\n\nAfter connecting, you authorize via Cloudflare OAuth and select which account and permissions to grant. The MCP server exposes Cloudflare''s API surface (DNS records, Workers, zones, security, analytics, and more). Be specific about the account/zone you want to operate on, and confirm destructive changes before applying them.","name":"cloudflare-usage","description":"How to use Cloudflare tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Manage Cloudflare DNS, Workers, security, analytics, and thousands of API operations across your Cloudflare account using natural language.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.cloudflare.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"cloudflare","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects to Cloudflare''s official remote MCP server, a gateway to 2,500+ Cloudflare API endpoints. Lets an agent manage DNS, Workers, zones, security settings, and analytics after OAuth sign-in."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.023727417,0.026977539,0.04837036,-0.009490967,0.036010742,-0.014129639,-0.009063721,0.012870789,-0.003522873,0.026504517,0.0038414001,0.032470703,-0.024658203,0.011833191,0.01876831,0.0006170273,-0.029647827,0.013954163,0.012619019,0.022079468,0.019973755,0.070373535,0.00083065033,0.021347046,-0.03250122,0.019622803,-0.031433105,0.006160736,-0.044952393,-0.051086426,-0.009010315,-0.041870117,-0.057617188,0.030303955,0.053741455,-0.011962891,0.020858765,0.018035889,-0.013137817,0.030578613,-0.051086426,-0.0021762848,-0.0048675537,0.02029419,-0.030136108,-0.004096985,-0.03677368,0.018478394,0.033721924,-0.032440186,0.008850098,0.046539307,-0.033843994,0.03036499,-0.03894043,0.06365967,0.0013284683,0.023925781,-0.04107666,-0.00440979,-0.