('cloudinary', 'Cloudinary', 'dev', 'Manage, upload, and transform images and videos in Cloudinary through natural language.', '/services/cloudinary.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Cloudinary","slug":"cloudinary","skills":[{"body":"# Cloudinary\n\nThe Cloudinary Asset Management MCP server connects to your Cloudinary account. You can either sign in through the browser via OAuth (no key to paste) or authenticate with your Cloudinary API credentials (CLOUDINARY_URL, format cloudinary://api_key:api_secret@cloud_name).\n\n## What you can do\n- Upload images and videos to your Cloudinary account\n- Search and browse existing media assets\n- Apply transformations (resize, crop, format, quality) and get delivery URLs\n- Organize assets with folders and tags\n\n## Tips\n- Reference assets by their public ID when transforming\n- Ask for optimized delivery URLs (auto format/quality) for web use","name":"cloudinary-usage","description":"How to use Cloudinary asset management tools"}],"summary":"Manage, upload, and transform images and videos in Cloudinary through natural language.","category":"dev","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with OAuth","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://asset-management.mcp.cloudinary.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"cloudinary-asset-management","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"Cloudinary API credentials","inputs":[{"key":"CLOUDINARY_URL","help":"In the Cloudinary Console open Settings > API Keys. Your CLOUDINARY_URL has the format cloudinary://<api_key>:<api_secret>@<cloud_name>.","type":"password","label":"Cloudinary URL","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"cloudinary://<api_key>:<api_secret>@<cloud_name>"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://asset-management.mcp.cloudinary.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"cloudinary-asset-management","headers":{"cloudinary-url":"${input.CLOUDINARY_URL}"},"transport":"http"}]}],"descri