('contentful', 'Contentful', 'productivity', 'Manage Contentful headless CMS content, entries, and content models through the official remote MCP server.', '/services/contentful.svg', '{"name":"Contentful","slug":"contentful","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Contentful\n\nContentful''s remote MCP server connects to your Contentful account via OAuth. On first connection your browser opens an OAuth consent flow where you sign in and select which spaces and environments are in scope for the session.\n\n## What you can do\n- Browse and query entries and their fields\n- Create, update, publish, and unpublish entries\n- Inspect and manage content types (content models)\n- Work with assets and spaces/environments you have access to\n\n## Notes\n- Access is scoped to the spaces/environments you approve during the OAuth flow and respects your underlying Contentful permissions.\n- MCP tool calls are JSON over HTTP, so binary uploads (images, PDFs) cannot be sent directly through a tool call.\n- EU-region accounts use a different endpoint (https://mcp.eu.contentful.com/mcp).","name":"contentful-usage","description":"How to use the Contentful MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Manage Contentful headless CMS content, entries, and content models through the official remote MCP server.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.contentful.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"contentful","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Contentful is a headless, API-first content management platform for structuring and delivering content across websites and apps. This connector uses Contentful''s official hosted remote MCP server so agents can read and manage entries, content types, assets, and spaces. Authentication is handled entirely through browser-based OAuth, so no API key needs to be pasted."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.0049362183,0.003364563,0.039489746,0.011146545,0.0034694672,-0.016723633,0.012084961,0.06072998,0.027389526,0.017120361,0.0315551