('crypto-com', 'Crypto.com', 'analytics', 'Access real-time Crypto.com public cryptocurrency market data such as prices, market trends, and trading data directly from your AI assistant.', '/services/crypto-com.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Crypto.com","slug":"crypto-com","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Crypto.com Market Data\n\nThe Crypto.com Market Data MCP server exposes public cryptocurrency market information. No authentication, account, or API key is required.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- Look up the current price of a cryptocurrency (e.g. \"What''s the current price of Bitcoin?\").\n- Check market trends and recent price movement.\n- Retrieve public trading data for supported markets.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Only public market data is available. The server does not access your account, wallet, personal information, or conversation data.\n- Endpoint: https://mcp.crypto.com/market-data/mcp (HTTP transport, no auth).","name":"crypto-com-usage","description":"How to use the Crypto.com Market Data MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Access real-time Crypto.com public cryptocurrency market data such as prices, market trends, and trading data directly from your AI assistant.","category":"analytics","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.crypto.com/market-data/mcp","args":[],"name":"crypto-market-data","headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"The Crypto.com Market Data MCP server provides public cryptocurrency market information including live prices, market trends, and trading data. It requires no account, no API key, and no payment, and only serves public market data with no access to personal or account information."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.037231445,0.010032654,0.033569336,0.012359619,0.0057754517,-0.026870728,0.01638794,0.035461426,0.061645508,0.009498596,0.0033683777,-0.017211914,-0.0016422272,-0.056610107,0.011856079,-0.0127334595,-0.05029297,0.003955841,-0.00630188,0.05206299,0.02067566,0.06896973,-0.039520264,-0.00869751,0.022338867,-0.017608643,-0.03500