('dataforseo', 'DataForSEO', 'seo', 'Fetch SERP, keyword, backlink and on-page SEO data via the DataForSEO API.', '/services/dataforseo.png', '{"name":"DataForSEO","slug":"dataforseo","inputs":[{"key":"DATAFORSEO_USERNAME","help":"Your API login from DataForSEO Dashboard -> API Access (app.dataforseo.com/api-access). Usually your account email.","type":"text","label":"DataForSEO API login","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"you@example.com"},{"key":"DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD","help":"The API password (not your account password) from DataForSEO Dashboard -> API Access (app.dataforseo.com/api-access).","type":"password","label":"DataForSEO API password","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"API password"}],"skills":[{"body":"# DataForSEO\n\nUse the dataforseo_* tools to pull live SEO data.\n\n- SERP: fetch organic + paid results for a keyword on Google/Bing (specify location and language).\n- Keywords: search volume, CPC, keyword difficulty, and related/suggested keywords.\n- Labs: competitor research, ranked keywords for a domain, keyword ideas.\n- Backlinks: referring domains, backlink profiles, and anchor data for a target.\n- On-Page: crawl a page or site to surface technical SEO issues.\n\nAlways pass explicit location_name (or location_code) and language for SERP and keyword calls. Costs are per request, so batch keywords where the endpoint allows it and avoid redundant calls.","name":"dataforseo-usage","description":"How to use DataForSEO tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Fetch SERP, keyword, backlink and on-page SEO data via the DataForSEO API.","category":"seo","mcpServers":[{"env":{"DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD":"${input.DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD}","DATAFORSEO_USERNAME":"${input.DATAFORSEO_USERNAME}"},"args":["-y","dataforseo-mcp-server@latest"],"name":"dataforseo","command":"npx","headers":{},"transport":"stdio"}],"description":"Connects the official DataForSEO MCP server (stdio) using your API login and password. Gives agents access to SERP results, keyword dat