('deel', 'Deel', 'productivity', 'Connect AI agents to Deel to manage global contracts, payroll, contractors, EOR employees, and time off.', '/services/deel.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Deel","slug":"deel","skills":[{"body":"# Deel\n\nDeel is a global HR, payroll, and Employer of Record (EOR) platform. Its MCP server lets you query and act on your Deel organization''s data on behalf of the signed-in user.\n\n## Auth\n\nConnecting the server triggers Deel''s browser-based OAuth2 sign-in (approve access in the popup; no key to paste). Alternatively, if your client does not support OAuth2, authenticate with a Deel personal access token passed as an Authorization: Bearer header. Tools run with the permissions of the authenticated Deel user.\n\n## Common tasks\n\n- List people in your organization (e.g. `org_person_list`).\n- List and inspect contracts (e.g. `contract_list`).\n- Create time-off requests (e.g. `timeoff_request_create`).\n- Estimate the cost of hiring via EOR (e.g. `eor_employment_cost_calculate`).\n\nStart by discovering the available tools, then invoke the one that matches the task. Prefer read/list tools to confirm IDs (people, contracts) before performing write actions such as creating a time-off request.","name":"deel-usage","description":"How to use the Deel MCP tools"}],"summary":"Connect AI agents to Deel to manage global contracts, payroll, contractors, EOR employees, and time off.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with OAuth","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.letsdeel.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"deel","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-token","kind":"key","label":"Personal access token","inputs":[{"key":"DEEL_API_TOKEN","help":"Create a personal access token in Deel: open Settings > Developer Center (or Deel API) and generate a token. See developer.deel.com.","type":"password","label":"Deel personal access token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"your Deel personal access token"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.letsdeel.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"deel","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.DEEL_API_TOKEN}"},"transport":"http"}]}],"description":"Deel is a global HR platform for hiring, paying, and managing contractors and employees across countries via contracts, payroll, and Employer of Record (EOR) services. Its official hosted MCP server exposes Deel operations as tools an AI agent can call on your behalf, such as listing contracts and people, creating time-off requests, and calculating EOR employment costs. Authenticate with browser-based OAuth2 or a Deel personal access token."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.0013885498,-0.0046577454,0.039093018,0.03817749,0.011474609,0.004924774,-0.012619019,0.07397461,-0.016082764,0.0017137527,0.037475586,-0.0513916,0.013168335,-0.051696777,0.012893677,0.015274048,-0.043670654,-0.027175903,-0.006702423,0.04852295,0.032287598,0.059631348,0.008415222,0.04095459,0.028686523,0.03564453,-0.023376465,0.025009155,-0.0026416779,-0.04446411,0.035308838,-0.029647827,-0.001203537,0.022476196,0.020217896,0.0021381378,0.008399963,0.07128906,0.0115737915,0.020065308,-0.019927979,0.015609741,0.016693115,0.02217102,-0.01927185,0.0059318542,-0.032806396,-0.0020313263,0.06933594,0.002954483,-0.0140686035,0.03942871,0.006587982,0.025283813,-0.04849243,0.020889282,0.0128479,0.021575928,-0.0071029663,-0.0016527176,-0.036590576,-0.024658203,0.019943237,0.055847168,-0.03237915,-0.015960693,-0.06060791,0.034423828,-0.020324707,0.003709793,-0.018829346,0.07318115,-0.011116028,-0.0107803345,-0.011444092,-0.031219482,-0.026977539,0.016738892,-0.0011558533,-0.023468018,-0.011062622,-0.008239746,-0.046142578,-0.010902405,0.0046539307,-0.052093506,-0.05621338,-0.004989624,-0.04525757,0.00027656555,-0.03302002,0.016067505,-0.014976501,0.014892578,0.030380249,0.016784668,-0.03515625,0.017288208,-0.010757446,0.056884766,0.010269165,-0.05355