('descript', 'Descript', 'productivity', 'Import, transcribe, and AI-edit video and audio projects in Descript directly from an AI assistant.', '/services/descript.png', '{"name":"Descript","slug":"descript","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Descript\n\nDescript''s hosted MCP server lets you drive video and audio projects from your AI assistant. Authentication is browser OAuth against your Descript account (no API token); the connection is scoped to a Descript Drive you select at sign-in.\n\n## What you can do\n- Import media from a URL or upload a local file (transcription runs automatically)\n- Edit with Underlord: add captions, remove filler words, apply Studio Sound\n- Generate scenes and create highlight reels\n- Create a project from a prompt as part of an automated workflow\n- Retrieve and manage projects and compositions\n\n## Tips\n- Ask in plain language; the assistant maps requests to the underlying Descript API calls.\n- Actions respect the projects and folders your Descript account already has access to within the connected Drive.\n","name":"descript-usage","description":"How to use Descript MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Import, transcribe, and AI-edit video and audio projects in Descript directly from an AI assistant.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.descript.com/v2/mcp","args":[],"name":"descript","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Descript is an all-in-one video and audio editor with AI-powered transcription and its Underlord editing toolkit. Its official hosted MCP server lets an AI assistant import media, transcribe, add captions, remove filler words, apply Studio Sound, generate scenes, and create highlight reels. Connect via browser sign-in to your Descript account, no API token required."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.013847351,0.016647339,-0.014839172,-0.017608643,-0.0015230179,-0.049560547,0.034240723,0.101135254,-0.017486572,-0.005130768,0.011207581,0.00027680397,-0.0061035156,