('docusign', 'Docusign', 'productivity', 'Lets an agent create, send, and track e-signature envelopes and read agreement data and templates in Docusign using natural language.', '/services/docusign.png?tone=dark', '{"name":"Docusign","slug":"docusign","inputs":[],"skills":[],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Lets an agent create, send, and track e-signature envelopes and read agreement data and templates in Docusign using natural language.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"url":"https://mcp.docusign.com/mcp","name":"docusign","oauth":{},"transport":"http"}],"authMethods":[],"description":"Official Docusign MCP server (Open Beta). Exposes Docusign IAM agreement capabilities (envelopes, templates, agreement data, workflow actions) such as list_envelopes, get_template, and create_envelope to AI agents over a hosted Streamable HTTP MCP endpoint. Authentication uses Docusign OAuth: the server initiates a browser sign-in flow on connect, and all existing Docusign permissions, access controls, and audit policies are enforced. Production endpoint: https://mcp.docusign.com/mcp (developer/demo: https://mcp-d.docusign.com/mcp)."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.035247803,0.05126953,0.032226562,0.015853882,-0.009361267,0.023635864,0.0038909912,0.05645752,0.018051147,-0.039367676,0.005847931,-0.036834717,-0.017562866,-0.0066566467,-0.023849487,0.03616333,-0.022888184,-0.053894043,0.013923645,0.011657715,0.032165527,0.06689453,0.030258179,0.024169922,0.012374878,0.010253906,-0.08203125,0.002960205,0.035583496,-0.031555176,0.046539307,-0.024673462,0.008979797,0.013664246,0.0046081543,0.05206299,0.020645142,0.057556152,-0.02508545,-0.01713562,-0.021606445,0.02973938,0.004184723,-0.022232056,-0.01675415,0.011116028,-0.01739502,-0.042755127,0.03945923,0.0026931763,-0.015930176,0.028656006,0.024520874,0.044311523,-0.019256592,-0.018035889,0.019622803,0.017120361,-0.028289795,0.031829834,-0.017349243,-0.06414795,0.002696991,0.04562378,-0.013832092,-0.028259277,-0.09887695,0.036621094,0.002075