('dropbox', 'Dropbox', 'productivity', 'Access and manage your Dropbox files and folders directly from AI assistants.', '/services/dropbox.svg', '{"name":"Dropbox","slug":"dropbox","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Dropbox\n\nUse the Dropbox MCP tools to work with files and folders in the connected Dropbox account.\n\n## Connecting\n\nOn first use you will be prompted to sign in to Dropbox in your browser and authorize access. No API key is required.\n\n## Common tasks\n\n- Browse and list the contents of folders.\n- Search for files and folders by name or content.\n- Read file contents and metadata.\n- Create, move, copy, or delete files and folders.\n- Share files and manage links.\n\nAlways confirm the target path before performing destructive actions like delete or move.","name":"dropbox-usage","description":"How to use Dropbox tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Access and manage your Dropbox files and folders directly from AI assistants.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.dropbox.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"dropbox","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Dropbox is a cloud storage and file-sharing service. This connector uses Dropbox''s official hosted MCP server to let AI assistants securely browse, search, read, and manage your Dropbox files and folders. Authentication is handled through browser-based OAuth sign-in with no API key to paste.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.0037059784,-0.015350342,0.027359009,-0.034301758,-0.0004377365,-0.022521973,0.029159546,0.087890625,0.008354187,0.016601562,-0.02949524,-0.024002075,0.0137786865,-0.04373169,-0.03555298,0.031097412,-0.007843018,0.003900528,-0.03149414,0.008216858,-0.024246216,0.058135986,0.0017633438,0.050445557,0.009819031,-0.0001348257,-0.0046195984,-0.010238647,0.004436493,-0.03253174,-0.016098022,-0.024642944,-0.02255249,-0.002840042,0.029510498,0.024398804,0.018600464,0.039245605,-0.0011520386,-0.021224976,-0.047210693,0.021636963,0.0