('dynamics-365', 'Dynamics 365', 'crm', 'Create and update leads, accounts, contacts, opportunities, cases and invoices in Dynamics 365.', '/services/dynamics-365.png', '{"name":"Dynamics 365","slug":"dynamics-365","skills":[{"body":"# Dynamics 365\n\nThe connection points at one Dynamics environment (the `myorg` in myorg.crm.dynamics.com). Calls go through the Dataverse Web API, so filters and sorts are OData on logical attribute names (`statuscode eq 1`, `createdon desc`).\n\nLeads are the only records you can list and search: DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_GET_ALL_LEADS with `filter`, `select` and `top`, then DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_GET_A_LEAD for one. Create and qualify with DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_LEAD and DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_LEAD. Always look for an existing lead with the same email or company before creating one.\n\nAccounts, contacts, opportunities and cases are write-only here: DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_ACCOUNT, DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_CONTACT, DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_OPPORTUNITY and DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_CASE return the new record id; keep it, it is the only way to update the record later with DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_OPPORTUNITY or DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_CASE. Some environments require extra fields (an estimated close date on opportunities, a customer on cases); read the error and ask the user for the missing value rather than guessing.\n\nOrders and invoices: DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_SALES_ORDER and DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_SALES_ORDER, DYNAMICS365_GET_ALL_INVOICES_ACTION, DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_GET_A_INVOICE, DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_INVOICE and DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_INVOICE. Confirm amounts and the customer with the user before creating or changing an invoice.","name":"dynamics-365-usage","description":"How to use Dynamics 365 tools"}],"summary":"Create and update leads, accounts, contacts, opportunities, cases and invoices in Dynamics 365.","category":"crm","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Microsoft","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"dynamics365","allowedTools":["DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_GET_ALL_LEADS","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_GET_A_LEAD","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_LEAD","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_LEAD","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_ACCOUNT","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_CONTACT","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_OPPORTUNITY","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_OPPORTUNITY","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_CASE","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_CASE","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_SALES_ORDER","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_SALES_ORDER","DYNAMICS365_GET_ALL_INVOICES_ACTION","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_GET_A_INVOICE","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_CREATE_INVOICE","DYNAMICS365_DYNAMICSCRM_UPDATE_INVOICE"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/dynamics-365","args":[],"name":"dynamics-365","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Dynamics 365 Sales and Customer Service in one click: sign in with Microsoft, enter your organization name, and your agent can log leads, accounts and contacts, move opportunities forward, open and update cases, and raise orders and invoices. The connection is brokered by Composio, so there is no Azure app registration and no token to paste."}'::jsonb, false, false, '[-0.019638062,-0.012168884,0.017791748,0.022567749,0.023345947,-0.026275635,0.028656006,0.041290283,-0.0015153885,0.03062439,0.017303467,-0.048858643,-0.010597229,0.013465881,0.009094238,0.05328369,-0.012748718,-0.00072288513,0.009681702,0.010116577,0.024017334,0.04147339,0.014122009,0.039642334,-0.021850586,0.0028800964,-0.02909851,0.01739502,-0.0033245087,-0.04611206,0.054779053,-0.02381897,-0.012374878,0.024215698,-0.0073051453,0.031402588,-0.0055885315,0.052215576,0.020004272,0.028244019,-0.012390137,0.014022827,0.021621704,0.027069092,0.003255844