('email-imap-smtp', 'Email (IMAP/SMTP)', 'productivity', 'Read, search, send and reply to email from any mailbox over IMAP and SMTP.', '/services/email-imap-smtp.svg', '{"name":"Email (IMAP/SMTP)","slug":"email-imap-smtp","inputs":[{"key":"EMAIL_USER","help":"Your full email address. It is the login and the sender of every email.","type":"text","label":"Email address","secret":false,"required":true,"placeholder":"you@yourcompany.com"},{"key":"EMAIL_PASS","help":"An **app password** from your provider''s security settings, or your mailbox password if your provider has none.","type":"password","guide":"1. Open the security settings of your email provider (iCloud, Zoho, Fastmail call it **App passwords**).\n2. Create an app password named `Lumvika`.\n3. Copy it and paste it here.\n4. OVH, Infomaniak and Ionos have no app passwords: use your mailbox password.","label":"App password","secret":true,"required":true},{"key":"IMAP_HOST","help":"For example `ssl0.ovh.net`, `mail.infomaniak.com`, `imap.ionos.fr`, `imap.mail.me.com`. Must accept SSL on port 993.","type":"text","label":"IMAP server","secret":false,"required":true,"placeholder":"imap.yourprovider.com"},{"key":"SMTP_HOST","help":"For example `ssl0.ovh.net`, `mail.infomaniak.com`, `smtp.ionos.fr`, `smtp.mail.me.com`.","type":"text","label":"SMTP server","secret":false,"required":true,"placeholder":"smtp.yourprovider.com"},{"key":"SMTP_PORT","help":"`465` for most providers, `587` for iCloud and Outlook-style servers.","type":"select","label":"SMTP port","secret":false,"options":["465","587"],"required":true},{"key":"SMTP_SECURE","help":"Match the port above.","type":"select","label":"SMTP encryption","secret":false,"options":[{"label":"SSL/TLS (port 465)","value":"true"},{"label":"STARTTLS (port 587)","value":"false"}],"required":true}],"skills":[{"body":"# Email (IMAP/SMTP)\n\nCall check_connection first when a mail call fails, it tests IMAP and SMTP and says which one is wrong.\n\nFind mail with search_messages (from, to, subject, body, unread, since, before). Results are summaries: open one with get_message, several with get_messages. find_unreplied_messages lists the messages from a sender still waiting for an answer. Call list_mailboxes before touching any folder other than INBOX and reuse the names exactly as returned.\n\nEvery message is identified by sourceMailbox + uid + uidValidity: pass the three back unchanged, never guess a uid.\n\nAnswer inside a conversation with reply_to_email or continue_email_thread, never send_email with a new subject: the thread carries it. Unless the user asked you to send on your own, show the draft and wait for a yes before anything leaves.\n\nmove_message, move_messages, delete_message and delete_messages only on an explicit request. To get the file of an attachment, call save_attachment with savePath set to the absolute path of the mail-attachments folder inside your workspace, then read or upload the saved file with shell_exec. Never set returnBase64.","name":"email-imap-smtp-usage","description":"How to read and send email over IMAP/SMTP"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Read, search, send and reply to email from any mailbox over IMAP and SMTP.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{"IMAP_HOST":"${input.IMAP_HOST}","IMAP_PORT":"993","SMTP_HOST":"${input.SMTP_HOST}","SMTP_PORT":"${input.SMTP_PORT}","EMAIL_PASS":"${input.EMAIL_PASS}","EMAIL_USER":"${input.EMAIL_USER}","IMAP_SECURE":"true","SMTP_SECURE":"${input.SMTP_SECURE}","MAIL_ALLOWED_ROOTS":"${LUMVIKA_WORKSPACE}"},"args":["-y","mcp-mail-server@2.1.2"],"name":"email","command":"npx","headers":{},"transport":"stdio"}],"description":"Connects any email account that speaks IMAP and SMTP (OVH, Infomaniak, Ionos, Zoho, iCloud, Fastmail, your own server) with its server addresses and an app password. Use Gmail or Outlook for those two providers: they sign in with one click."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.015396118,0.038879395,0.002008438,-0.01234436,0.040374756,-0.07342529,0.024230957,