('expedia', 'Expedia', 'ecommerce', 'Query Expedia travel recommendations for hotels, flights, activities, and car rentals through an AI agent.', '/services/expedia.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Expedia","slug":"expedia","inputs":[{"key":"EXPEDIA_API_KEY","help":"Get it from the Expedia Group Developer Hub (developers.expediagroup.com) / Expedia Partner Solutions after registering for API access; find it under your account''s API keys / access keys tab.","type":"password","label":"Expedia API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"your_expedia_api_key"}],"skills":[{"body":"# Expedia Travel Recommendations\n\nThis MCP server recommends travel options from Expedia''s inventory.\n\n## Capabilities\n- Recommend hotels by destination, dates, property type, amenities, guest ratings, and sort order.\n- Suggest flights matching traveler-specified criteria.\n- Curate activity and tour recommendations at a destination.\n- Provide car rental options with customizable parameters.\n\n## Tips\n- Always provide a destination and travel dates for best results.\n- Requires a valid EXPEDIA_API_KEY from the Expedia Group Developer Hub.","name":"expedia-usage","description":"How to use the Expedia Travel Recommendations MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Query Expedia travel recommendations for hotels, flights, activities, and car rentals through an AI agent.","category":"ecommerce","mcpServers":[{"env":{"EXPEDIA_API_KEY":"${input.EXPEDIA_API_KEY}"},"args":["expedia_travel_recommendations_mcp","--protocol","stdio"],"name":"expedia","command":"uvx","headers":{},"transport":"stdio"}],"description":"Expedia''s official Travel Recommendations MCP server exposes the Expedia Travel Recommendation Service API to AI agents. It recommends hotels, flights, activities, and car rentals based on destination, dates, and traveler preferences. Runs locally over stdio via the official uvx package."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.028457642,-0.013298035,0.029754639,-0.0030269623,-0.011024475,-0.001