('facebook', 'Facebook', 'marketing', 'Publish, schedule and analyze posts, answer and moderate comments, and keep your Facebook Pages details and access up to date.', '/services/facebook.svg', '{"name":"Facebook","slug":"facebook","skills":[{"body":"# Facebook Pages\n\nYou act as a Page the user shared with Lumvika, never as their personal profile. Start with facebook_list_pages: every other tool needs a `pageId` from it. If it comes back empty, tell the user no Page was shared when they connected Facebook, and that reconnecting lets them pick one.\n\n## Publishing\n\n- Text or link post: facebook_create_post.\n- Photos: facebook_create_photo_post for one image, facebook_create_multi_photo_post for 2 to 10. Images come from public URLs. To put photos in an existing album, facebook_list_albums then facebook_add_photos_to_album (apps cannot create albums).\n- Video: facebook_create_video_post, from a public video URL.\n- Scheduling: pass `scheduledAt` (10 minutes to 30 days ahead) to any create tool. List pending posts with facebook_list_scheduled_posts, move one with facebook_reschedule_post, or push it live now with facebook_publish_scheduled_post.\n- Edit with facebook_update_post, remove with facebook_delete_post.\n\nAlways show the user the exact draft and wait for approval before publishing. Deleting a post is irreversible: never do it without an explicit confirmation.\n\n## Reading and analytics\n\nfacebook_list_posts lists the feed, facebook_get_post reads one post. facebook_get_page_insights and facebook_get_post_insights return views and engagement (Meta replaced impressions with media views); very recent posts can return empty metrics for a few hours. facebook_list_tagged_posts finds posts that mention the Page, facebook_list_photos and facebook_list_videos list the Page media.\n\n## Comments\n\nRead with facebook_list_comments (pass a comment id to read its replies), reply as the Page with facebook_create_comment. Moderate with facebook_hide_comment, which works on other people''s comments only, and use facebook_delete_comment only when the user asks for a deletion. Draft replies for the user''s approval unless they asked you to answer on your own.\n\n## Page details and access\n\nfacebook_get_page reads the public details; facebook_update_page changes the About text, description, general info, phone, emails or website. Show the new values and wait for approval first.\n\nfacebook_list_page_people shows who has access to the Page and their tasks. facebook_assign_page_tasks gives a business user access or changes their tasks, facebook_remove_page_access removes it. MANAGE means full control: always confirm the person and the tasks with the user before any change.\n\n## Not available\n\nMessenger conversations, personal profiles, groups, Meta ads and Instagram are out of reach from this connection. Ads live in the separate Meta Ads app.","name":"facebook-pages-usage","description":"How to use Facebook Pages tools"}],"summary":"Publish, schedule and analyze posts, answer and moderate comments, and keep your Facebook Pages details and access up to date.","category":"marketing","authMethods":[{"id":"managed","kind":"managed","label":"Connect with Facebook","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"managed":{"provider":"facebook"},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/managed/facebook","args":[],"name":"facebook","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Connect Facebook in one click and your agent works on the Pages you share: publish text, photo, multi-photo and video posts, schedule and reschedule them, add photos to albums, read Page and post insights, reply to, hide and delete comments, update the Page details, and manage who has access to the Page. Lumvika runs the connection through its own Meta app, so there is no developer app to set up and no token to paste. Personal profiles, Messenger and ads are not covered