('factset', 'FactSet', 'analytics', 'Query FactSet''s permissioned financial datasets (fundamentals, estimates, ownership, M&A, pricing, people, events, supply chain, geographic revenue) in real time so agents can reason over trusted market intelligence.', '/services/factset.png', '{"name":"FactSet","slug":"factset","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# FactSet\n\nFactSet''s MCP server provides real-time access to permissioned financial datasets: Fundamentals, Consensus Estimates, Ownership, Global M&A, Global Pricing, People profiles, Events, Supply Chain, and Geographic Revenue Exposure.\n\n## Auth\n\nOn first connection your client opens a browser to sign in and authorize via FactSet OAuth. Access requires a valid FactSet subscription with the relevant content entitlements; results are scoped to your permissions.\n\n## Usage\n\nAsk for specific companies, tickers, or entities and the datasets you need (e.g. latest fundamentals, consensus estimates, ownership, recent M&A activity). Data returned is entitlement-filtered and auditable.","name":"factset-usage","description":"How to use FactSet tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Query FactSet''s permissioned financial datasets (fundamentals, estimates, ownership, M&A, pricing, people, events, supply chain, geographic revenue) in real time so agents can reason over trusted market intelligence.","category":"analytics","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.factset.com/content/v1","args":[],"name":"factset","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"FactSet''s production-grade Model Context Protocol server exposes real-time, fully entitled financial intelligence to AI agents. It connects via browser OAuth sign-in and lets tools query FactSet content APIs without custom integrations."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.038726807,-0.02810669,0.014717102,0.007118225,0.00422287,-0.010620117,-0.06774902,0.0289917,0.027450562,-0.032562256,0.045837402,-0.038208008,-0.030441284,-0.0446167,0.060180664,0.030929565,-0.000839