('fal', 'fal.ai', 'dev', 'Search, run, and chain 1,000+ generative AI models for images, video, audio, and more directly from your AI assistant.', '/services/fal.png', '{"name":"fal.ai","slug":"fal","inputs":[{"key":"FAL_KEY","help":"Create and copy it from your fal dashboard at https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys","type":"password","label":"fal API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"key_id:key_secret"}],"skills":[{"body":"# fal.ai\n\nThe fal MCP server gives your AI assistant access to 1,000+ generative models on the fal platform.\n\n## Common workflow\n1. Search for a model by capability (e.g. text-to-image, image-to-video, text-to-speech).\n2. Inspect the model''s input schema.\n3. Run inference with the required parameters.\n4. Upload local files when a model needs an input image, audio, or video.\n5. Retrieve the generated output URLs.\n\n## Notes\n- The MCP server itself is free; you pay standard fal pricing for the model runs you trigger.\n- Your API key is sent per request in the Authorization header and is never stored by the server.\n- Get or manage keys at https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys.","name":"fal-usage","description":"How to use the fal.ai MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Search, run, and chain 1,000+ generative AI models for images, video, audio, and more directly from your AI assistant.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.fal.ai/mcp","args":[],"name":"fal","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.FAL_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"fal.ai is a generative media platform that hosts a hosted MCP server exposing its full inference API. Connect to search models, inspect schemas, run inference, upload files, and browse docs. The API key is sent per request and never stored by the server."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.019058228,-0.016784668,0.06518555,-0.006706238,-0.00082683563,-0.070617676,-0.02255249,0.020980835,-0.005340576,0.029251099,0.024368286,-0.07159424,-0.023498535,-0.04107666,-0.048187256,0.02571