('fathom', 'Fathom', 'productivity', 'Read your meeting recordings, transcripts, summaries and action items from Fathom.', '/services/fathom.svg', '{"name":"Fathom","slug":"fathom","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Fathom\n\nFathom records, transcribes and summarizes meetings. Access it via its REST API.\n\nBase URL: `https://api.fathom.ai/external/v1`\nAuth: header `X-Api-Key: $FATHOM_API_KEY` (already in the environment).\n\n## List meetings\n`GET /meetings` returns meetings newest-first, paginated via `cursor` / `next_cursor`.\n\nOptional query params:\n- `include_transcript=true` — full transcript\n- `include_summary=true` — AI summary\n- `include_action_items=true` — action items\n- `include_highlights=true` — highlights\n- `include_crm_matches=true`\n- `created_after` / `created_before` — ISO 8601 filters\n- `recorded_by[]=email`, `teams[]=name`, `meeting_type=...`\n- `calendar_invitees_domains[]=domain`, `calendar_invitees_domains_type=all|only_internal|one_or_more_external`\n\nExample:\n```\ncurl -s -H \"X-Api-Key: $FATHOM_API_KEY\" \\\n  \"https://api.fathom.ai/external/v1/meetings?include_summary=true&include_action_items=true\"\n```\n\nEach item has: title, url, share_url, recording_id, start/end times, calendar_invitees, transcript_language, and (when requested) transcript/summary/action_items/highlights. There is no separate transcript endpoint — request `include_transcript=true` on `/meetings`.\n\nTranscripts are sensitive: never share or publish meeting content externally without the user''s explicit go-ahead.","name":"fathom-usage","description":"How to read Fathom meetings via the REST API"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Read your meeting recordings, transcripts, summaries and action items from Fathom.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[],"authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Fathom","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.fathom.ai/mcp","args":[],"name":"fathom","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"Fathom API key","inputs":[{"key":"FATHOM_API_KEY","help":"Create it in Fathom → Settings → Integrations → API (developers.fathom.ai).","type":"password","label":"Fathom API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"xxx.yyy"}],"envKeys":[{"key":"FATHOM_API_KEY","fromInput":"FATHOM_API_KEY"}],"mcpServers":[],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects Fathom so agents can list past meetings and pull transcripts, AI summaries, action items and highlights. Connect via browser OAuth sign-in to the official hosted MCP server, or paste a Fathom API key to use the REST API directly. Read-only."}'::jsonb, true, true, '[-0.029449463,0.034454346,0.041656494,0.009780884,0.00029206276,-0.0016222,-0.027404785,0.011306763,0.05203247,-0.016204834,0.0385437,-0.020965576,-0.05029297,-0.02230835,0.005619049,0.03845215,0.003189087,-0.043121338,-0.026977539,0.045715332,0.022064209,0.0046539307,-0.011764526,0.033294678,-0.03201294,-0.011512756,-0.08312988,0.031555176,0.011657715,-0.033966064,0.012718201,-0.025054932,-0.010467529,0.021530151,0.045440674,0.03010559,-0.035949707,0.033172607,-0.01966858,-0.027267456,-0.033355713,0.036102295,-0.010673523,-0.019088745,0.025009155,-0.005256653,-0.028442383,-0.0013074875,0.026153564,0.027328491,-0.038879395,-0.01272583,-0.033294678,0.046081543,-0.01423645,0.017684937,0.015083313,0.00055742264,-0.0031852722,0.010505676,-0.052886963,-0.04006958,0.013542175,0.027755737,-0.04434204,0.05404663,-0.02355957,0.04309082,-0.01537323,0.050964355,-0.0073547363,0.008590698,-0.027191162,0.010726929,0.020431519,-0.05404663,-0.015449524,0.015106201,-0.03768921,-0.020080566,0.038513184,0.04925537,-0.034210205,-0.053894043,0.031219482,-0.010276794,-0.025558472,-0.012550354,-0.070129395,-0.011558533,0.023422241,-0.006511688,-0.04748535,0.024551392,0.032592773,0.0095825195,-0.012908936,0.001376152,-0.03604126,0.0625,0.023239136,-0.04046631,-0.025924683,-0.041229248,0.024475098,0.03005