('frameio', 'Frame.io', 'productivity', 'Manage Frame.io projects, assets and review comments via the V4 API.', '/services/frameio.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Frame.io","slug":"frameio","inputs":[{"key":"FRAMEIO_TOKEN","help":"Use a V4 OAuth access token, or a Legacy Developer Token from the Frame.io developer site (developer.frame.io). Legacy tokens also require the x-frameio-legacy-token-auth header (handled by the skill).","type":"password","label":"Frame.io API token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"fio-u-…"}],"skills":[{"body":"# Frame.io (V4 API)\n\nNo MCP server is available. Call the REST API directly.\n\n- Base URL: `https://api.frame.io/v4`\n- Auth: send `Authorization: Bearer $FRAMEIO_TOKEN` on every request.\n- If the token is a Legacy Developer Token (from developer.frame.io, not an Adobe IMS OAuth token), ALSO send the header `x-frameio-legacy-token-auth: true`.\n\n## Common calls\n- List accounts: `GET /accounts`\n- List workspaces: `GET /accounts/{account_id}/workspaces`\n- List projects: `GET /accounts/{account_id}/workspaces/{workspace_id}/projects`\n- Browse a folder''s children: `GET /accounts/{account_id}/folders/{folder_id}/children`\n- Get a file (asset) and its version stack: `GET /accounts/{account_id}/files/{file_id}`\n- List comments on a file: `GET /accounts/{account_id}/files/{file_id}/comments`\n- Post a (timecoded) comment: `POST /accounts/{account_id}/files/{file_id}/comments` with `{ \"data\": { \"text\": \"…\", \"timestamp\": <frame> } }`\n\nResolve `account_id` first via `GET /accounts`, then drill down workspace -> project -> folder -> file. Confirm IDs before mutating (posting comments).","name":"frameio-usage","description":"How to call the Frame.io V4 API"}],"envKeys":[{"key":"FRAMEIO_TOKEN","fromInput":"FRAMEIO_TOKEN"}],"summary":"Manage Frame.io projects, assets and review comments via the V4 API.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[],"description":"Adobe Frame.io is a video review and collaboration platform.