('fullenrich', 'FullEnrich', 'crm', 'Find B2B prospects and enrich them with verified emails and phone numbers.', '/services/fullenrich.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"FullEnrich","slug":"fullenrich","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# FullEnrich\n\nB2B contact search and waterfall enrichment. 13 tools, and **enrichment spends the user''s credits** — the whole point of this skill is the spending discipline below.\n\n## Never spend before confirming\n\n1. Preview with a search (free within the preview limit).\n2. Call `get_credits` and state the balance.\n3. State how many records will be enriched and ask the user to confirm.\n4. Only then enrich.\n5. Report what came back and what it cost.\n\nSearch previews and `get_credits` are free. Exports cost credits. Enrichment is the main paid action: roughly 1 credit per verified email, ~10 per phone number. Never batch-enrich a list the user has not seen.\n\n## Filters must use real codes\n\nBefore filtering by industry, seniority or job function, call `list_industries`, `list_seniorities` or `list_functions_subfunctions` and use the codes they return. Do not guess a label.\n\n## Tools\n\n- `get_credits` — current balance, free, call before any paid action\n- `list_industries`, `list_seniorities`, `list_functions_subfunctions` — valid filter codes\n- `search_people`, `search_companies` — find records by role, company, industry, location, size\n- `search_contact_by_email` — reverse lookup from an email address\n- `enrich_search_contact` — enrich the contacts matching search filters (paid)\n- `enrich_bulk` — batch-enrich known contacts (paid)\n- `get_enrichment_results` — poll status and fetch results of an async or bulk job\n- `export_contacts`, `export_companies`, `export_enrichment_results` — CSV/JSON export (paid)\n\nEnrichment is asynchronous: `enrich_bulk` returns a job, then poll `get_enrichment_results` until it completes. Do not re-launch a job you have not polled.","name":"fullenrich-usage","description":"How to use FullEnrich search and enrichment tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Find B2B prospects and enrich them with verified emails and phone numbers.","category":"crm","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.fullenrich.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"fullenrich","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects FullEnrich''s hosted MCP server. Search people and companies, then waterfall-enrich them across 20+ data providers to get verified professional emails and phones. You sign in with your FullEnrich account; no key to paste."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.010673523,-0.0087890625,0.0635376,0.03765869,0.029586792,-0.048553467,-0.025344849,0.06359863,-0.01574707,0.057922363,0.017059326,-0.0023441315,-0.018035889,-0.01889038,0.03451538,0.060760498,-0.0050697327,0.014884949,-0.005355835,0.029846191,0.02949524,0.01939392,0.02810669,0.0047454834,-0.02268982,0.010971069,-0.05606079,0.055664062,0.03491211,-0.03164673,0.05142212,-0.014221191,-0.041503906,0.01676941,-0.013465881,0.020233154,0.003370285,0.04812622,0.01335144,0.010055542,0.029129028,0.007736206,0.015258789,0.004798889,0.038360596,-0.056518555,-0.03781128,-0.0038490295,0.10058594,0.018188477,-0.0063591003,0.0053901672,-0.03704834,-0.0024585724,-0.033355713,0.00016224384,0.018997192,-0.016815186,-0.060516357,0.045288086,0.004886627,-0.04095459,-0.0006914139,0.02949524,-0.018508911,0.008758545,-0.040039062,0.024139404,0.030517578,0.026992798,-0.04397583,-0.00046682358,0.016021729,-0.006252289,0.039093018,-0.010894775,0.045654297,0.0055351257,-0.040649414,-0.05355835,0.00831604,-0.006729126,-0.07385254,-0.020553589,-0.03656006,-0.03942871,-0.00075912476,0.029968262,-0.05279541,0.0055122375,-0.016433716,-0.022583008,-0.018295288,0.041778564,0.03149414,0.00043654442,-0.01121521,-0.020446777,-0.01876831,0.10601807,0.003873825,-0.013534546,-0.018218994,-0.057800293,0.0259552,-0.031173706,0.010009766,-0.039733887,0.0013399124,0.019592285,-0.09210205,-0.02218628,-0.022628784,0.016021729,0.057861328,-0.03829956,-0.00848