('gamma', 'Gamma', 'productivity', 'Generate and manage Gamma presentations, documents, and social posts, then browse, read, and export them to PDF, PPTX, or PNG.', '/services/gamma.png', '{"name":"Gamma","slug":"gamma","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Gamma\n\nUse the Gamma MCP to create and manage presentations and documents.\n\n- `generate`: create a new gamma from a prompt.\n- `generate_from_template`: create a new gamma from an existing template.\n- `get_generation_status`: poll until a generation finishes.\n- `get_gammas`: browse existing gammas and templates.\n- `read_gamma`: read the contents of an existing gamma.\n- `get_themes` / `get_folders`: list available themes and folders.\n- `export_gamma` / `get_export_status`: export a gamma to PDF, PPTX, or PNG and retrieve the link.\n\nAuthentication is via OAuth sign-in with your Gamma account; approve access to create/read gammas and list folders and themes when prompted.","name":"gamma-usage","description":"How to use Gamma tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Generate and manage Gamma presentations, documents, and social posts, then browse, read, and export them to PDF, PPTX, or PNG.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.gamma.app/mcp","args":[],"name":"gamma","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects agents to Gamma''s hosted MCP server to create gammas from prompts or templates, check generation status, browse themes and folders, read existing gammas, and export them. Authentication is handled via browser-based OAuth sign-in with Gamma."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.003211975,0.054534912,0.04446411,0.0076904297,-0.029190063,-0.045074463,0.04663086,0.028457642,0.031463623,-0.017318726,-0.0012369156,0.02368164,-0.028182983,-0.013244629,0.021499634,0.026748657,-0.055877686,-0.041290283,-0.022216797,0.06414795,-0.0051994324,0.03656006,0.0050354004,0.051483154,-0.02861023,0.032470703,-0.07635498,0.02746582,0.0043296814,-0.050567627,0.003955841,-0.0129852295,