('gocardless', 'GoCardless', 'payments', 'Query your GoCardless bank payments, customers, mandates, subscriptions and payouts, and get guided help building GoCardless API integrations.', '/services/gocardless.png?tone=dark', '{"name":"GoCardless","slug":"gocardless","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# GoCardless\n\nThe GoCardless MCP server connects your assistant to the GoCardless bank payments platform.\n\n## Connect\n\nWhen you connect, a GoCardless sign-in opens in your browser. Choose your environment (sandbox or live) and sign in to authorize access. No API key needs to be pasted.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- **Integration guidance**: Ask about GoCardless API endpoints, integration patterns, webhooks, and code samples across supported languages.\n- **Account data (read-only)**: Query your live account, e.g. list and fetch customers, payments, mandates, subscriptions, and payouts, and check payment statuses.\n\n## Example prompts\n\n- \"How many payments are overdue today?\"\n- \"List my most recent payouts.\"\n- \"Show mandates for customer X.\"\n- \"Give me a code sample for creating a payment in Node.\"\n","name":"gocardless-usage","description":"How to use the GoCardless MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Query your GoCardless bank payments, customers, mandates, subscriptions and payouts, and get guided help building GoCardless API integrations.","category":"payments","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.gocardless.com","args":[],"name":"gocardless","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"GoCardless is a bank payment platform for collecting recurring and one-off payments via direct debit. Its official MCP server gives your LLM structured knowledge of the GoCardless API plus read-only lookups against your live account (payment status, customers, mandates, subscriptions, payouts). Connect via a GoCardless browser sign-in where you pick sandbox or live and authorize access."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.0061416626,0.006790161,0.047027588,-