('gohighlevel', 'GoHighLevel', 'crm', 'Manage contacts, conversations, calendars and opportunities in your GoHighLevel CRM.', '/services/gohighlevel.png', '{"name":"GoHighLevel","slug":"gohighlevel","skills":[{"body":"# GoHighLevel\n\nUse the HighLevel MCP tools to work inside the connected CRM location.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- **Contacts**: search a contact by name, email or phone before creating one; create or update a contact; add or remove tags; read and write custom field values.\n- **Conversations**: search threads for a contact, read the messages, and send a reply on the same channel the lead used (SMS, email, chat).\n- **Calendars**: list calendars, read events and appointment notes to answer scheduling questions.\n- **Opportunities**: search pipelines, find an opportunity, move it to another stage or update its value and status.\n- **Payments**: read orders and transactions to answer billing questions.\n- **Content**: publish or update blog posts, email templates and social planner posts when asked.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Always search before you create, so you never duplicate a contact or an opportunity.\n- Never invent a location id, pipeline id, stage id or contact id. Look it up with a search or list tool first.\n- The available tools depend on the scopes granted at connect time. If a tool is missing or returns a permission error, say which scope is missing instead of trying another route.\n- Writes are visible to real customers. Confirm the exact recipient and message before sending anything outbound.","name":"gohighlevel-usage","description":"How to use GoHighLevel CRM tools"}],"summary":"Manage contacts, conversations, calendars and opportunities in your GoHighLevel CRM.","category":"crm","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with HighLevel","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://services.leadconnectorhq.com/mcp/","args":[],"name":"gohighlevel","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"pit","kind":"key","label":"Private Integration Token","inputs":[{"key":"GHL_PIT","help":"Settings → Private Integrations → Create New Integration, then select the scopes you need.","type":"password","label":"HighLevel Private Integration Token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"pit-…"},{"key":"GHL_LOCATION_ID","help":"Settings → Business Profile, or the location/<id> segment of your HighLevel URL.","type":"text","label":"Location ID","required":true,"placeholder":"ve9EPM428h8vShlRW1KT"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://services.leadconnectorhq.com/mcp/","args":[],"name":"gohighlevel","headers":{"locationId":"${input.GHL_LOCATION_ID}","Authorization":"Bearer ${input.GHL_PIT}"},"transport":"http"}]}],"description":"Connects HighLevel''s hosted MCP server. Sign in with your HighLevel account, or paste a Private Integration Token scoped to one location."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.032440186,0.020187378,0.09063721,1.847744e-06,0.0076789856,-0.071777344,-0.03756714,0.030593872,0.010398865,-0.008621216,0.037719727,0.006965637,-0.018630981,0.0019836426,0.007896423,0.017303467,-0.042663574,0.013458252,0.0038280487,0.080200195,0.022735596,0.058441162,-0.016586304,0.041900635,-0.0513916,0.02128601,-0.01890564,0.0597229,-0.003545761,-0.030715942,0.07244873,-0.019378662,-0.00068616867,0.008781433,-0.026977539,-0.022949219,0.024536133,0.05606079,0.038909912,0.01826477,-0.00844574,0.02330017,-0.009803772,0.035247803,0.020111084,-0.011116028,-0.0025577545,-0.037261963,-0.0046806335,-0.00868988,-0.017974854,-0.02192688,-0.022872925,0.038635254,-0.0413208,0.0045661926,0.018157959,-0.003030777,-0.028671265,0.030288696,-0.03967285,-0.043670654,0.022354126,0.008049011,-0.017059326,0.028366089,-0.019714355,-0.025115967,0.01663208,0.021514893,-0.02583313,0.0289917,0.025680542,-0.015090942,-0.010253906,0.012992859,0.002822876,0.037841797,0.014564514,-0.030822754,0.0024166107,-0.003627777,-0.047851562,-0.016036987,-0.004749298,-0.03277588,-0.0207977