('google-docs', 'Google Docs', 'productivity', 'Write, read and edit documents in Google Docs.', '/services/google-docs.svg', '{"name":"Google Docs","slug":"google-docs","skills":[{"body":"# Google Docs\n\nFind a document with GOOGLEDOCS_SEARCH_DOCUMENTS. To read one, prefer GOOGLEDOCS_GET_DOCUMENT_PLAINTEXT, which returns readable text. GOOGLEDOCS_GET_DOCUMENT_BY_ID returns the full structured document, useful only when you need element indexes.\n\nWriting is easiest in Markdown: GOOGLEDOCS_CREATE_DOCUMENT_MARKDOWN creates a formatted document in one call, GOOGLEDOCS_UPDATE_DOCUMENT_MARKDOWN replaces the whole body and GOOGLEDOCS_UPDATE_DOCUMENT_SECTION_MARKDOWN rewrites just one section. GOOGLEDOCS_CREATE_DOCUMENT makes a document from a title and plain text.\n\nFor surgical edits, positions are character indexes: read them with GOOGLEDOCS_GET_DOCUMENT_END_INDEX, then use GOOGLEDOCS_INSERT_TEXT_ACTION, GOOGLEDOCS_DELETE_CONTENT_RANGE or GOOGLEDOCS_UPDATE_EXISTING_DOCUMENT for batched requests. Indexes shift after every edit, so re-read them between two operations. GOOGLEDOCS_REPLACE_ALL_TEXT is the safe way to swap a string everywhere without touching indexes.\n\nTables come from GOOGLEDOCS_INSERT_TABLE_ACTION or GOOGLEDOCS_CREATE_AND_POPULATE_TABLE, images from GOOGLEDOCS_INSERT_INLINE_IMAGE, bullets from GOOGLEDOCS_CREATE_PARAGRAPH_BULLETS. GOOGLEDOCS_COPY_DOCUMENT duplicates a template and GOOGLEDOCS_EXPORT_DOCUMENT_AS_PDF produces a PDF.\n\nReplacing a document''s body is destructive. Confirm with the user before rewriting a document they did not ask you to rewrite.","name":"google-docs-usage","description":"How to use Google Docs tools"}],"summary":"Write, read and edit documents in Google Docs.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Google","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"googledocs","allowedTools":["GOOGLEDOCS_SEARCH_DOCUMENTS","GOOGLEDOCS_GET_DOCUMENT_BY_ID","GOOGLEDOCS_GET_DOCUMENT_PLAINTEXT","GOOGLEDOCS_GET_DOCUMENT_END_INDEX","GOOGLEDOCS_CREATE_DOCUMENT","GOOGLEDOCS_CREATE_DOCUMENT_MARKDOWN","GOOGLEDOCS_UPDATE_DOCUMENT_MARKDOWN","GOOGLEDOCS_UPDATE_DOCUMENT_SECTION_MARKDOWN","GOOGLEDOCS_INSERT_TEXT_ACTION","GOOGLEDOCS_DELETE_CONTENT_RANGE","GOOGLEDOCS_REPLACE_ALL_TEXT","GOOGLEDOCS_UPDATE_EXISTING_DOCUMENT","GOOGLEDOCS_COPY_DOCUMENT","GOOGLEDOCS_EXPORT_DOCUMENT_AS_PDF","GOOGLEDOCS_INSERT_TABLE_ACTION","GOOGLEDOCS_CREATE_AND_POPULATE_TABLE","GOOGLEDOCS_INSERT_INLINE_IMAGE","GOOGLEDOCS_CREATE_PARAGRAPH_BULLETS"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/google-docs","args":[],"name":"google-docs","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Google Docs in one click: sign in with Google and your agent can search documents, read them as plain text, create them from Markdown and edit them in place. The connection is brokered by Composio, whose Google app is verified, so the agent reaches the documents the account already owns.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.008331299,0.04119873,0.006790161,0.012306213,0.008148193,-0.055633545,0.00491333,0.037872314,0.0015859604,-0.04144287,0.007297516,0.0040779114,0.0003798008,-0.0059547424,0.008094788,0.02507019,-0.009254456,-0.010444641,0.045928955,0.03100586,-0.0016860962,0.048461914,-0.008911133,0.04019165,-0.010848999,0.021148682,-0.064575195,0.0038890839,0.011795044,-0.07678223,-0.025634766,-0.015701294,0.022033691,0.0138168335,0.026733398,0.0010566711,-0.004257202,0.022521973,-0.0016708374,0.017654419,-0.011505127,0.0680542,0.023620605,0.012161255,0.0013198853,0.01939392,0.0071144104,-0.0022888184,0.0037250519,-0.011932373,-0.00667572,0.011878967,-0.010856628,-0.03793335,-0.024261475,-0.015670776,-0.0021820068,0.0064201355,-0.018615723,0.0029640198,-0.028427124,-0.03186035,-0.0546875,0.060180664,-0.0435791,-0.013175964,-0.04852295,0.012809753,-0.04