('google-meet', 'Google Meet', 'productivity', 'Create Meet links and pull transcripts and recordings from past calls.', '/services/google-meet.svg', '{"name":"Google Meet","slug":"google-meet","skills":[{"body":"# Google Meet\n\nGOOGLEMEET_CREATE_MEET opens a new meeting space and returns its join URL. It is not attached to any calendar event, so put the URL in a Google Calendar event yourself if the meeting needs to be scheduled. GOOGLEMEET_GET_MEET reads a space back, GOOGLEMEET_UPDATE_SPACE changes its access settings and GOOGLEMEET_END_ACTIVE_CONFERENCE hangs up a call in progress.\n\nEverything about a past call hangs off a conference record. List them with GOOGLEMEET_LIST_CONFERENCE_RECORDS or fetch one with GOOGLEMEET_GET_CONFERENCE_RECORD_BY_NAME, then use its id with GOOGLEMEET_LIST_PARTICIPANTS, GOOGLEMEET_GET_TRANSCRIPTS_BY_CONFERENCE_RECORD_ID and GOOGLEMEET_GET_RECORDINGS_BY_CONFERENCE_RECORD_ID.\n\nA transcript resource is only metadata. The actual words come from GOOGLEMEET_LIST_TRANSCRIPT_ENTRIES, which returns speaker, timestamp and text segment by segment; that is what you summarize. GOOGLEMEET_GET_TRANSCRIPT and GOOGLEMEET_LIST_RECORDINGS give you their status when nothing is available yet.\n\nTranscripts and recordings only exist if they were turned on during the call, and they take a few minutes to appear afterwards. Say so plainly instead of retrying.","name":"google-meet-usage","description":"How to use Google Meet tools"}],"summary":"Create Meet links and pull transcripts and recordings from past calls.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Google","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"googlemeet","allowedTools":["GOOGLEMEET_CREATE_MEET","GOOGLEMEET_GET_MEET","GOOGLEMEET_UPDATE_SPACE","GOOGLEMEET_END_ACTIVE_CONFERENCE","GOOGLEMEET_LIST_CONFERENCE_RECORDS","GOOGLEMEET_GET_CONFERENCE_RECORD_BY_NAME","GOOGLEMEET_LIST_PARTICIPANTS","GOOGLEMEET_GET_TRANSCRIPTS_BY_CONFERENCE_RECORD_ID","GOOGLEMEET_GET_TRANSCRIPT","GOOGLEMEET_LIST_TRANSCRIPT_ENTRIES","GOOGLEMEET_LIST_RECORDINGS","GOOGLEMEET_GET_RECORDINGS_BY_CONFERENCE_RECORD_ID"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/google-meet","args":[],"name":"google-meet","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Google Meet in one click: sign in with Google and your agent can open a meeting space, then go back over past conferences to read who attended, fetch the transcript and find the recording. The connection is brokered by Composio, whose Google app is verified, so no Google Cloud setup is needed.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.042419434,0.021316528,0.038970947,-0.005256653,-0.030349731,-0.06384277,0.027145386,0.011405945,0.016052246,-0.03765869,0.031951904,-0.025970459,0.005378723,-0.021972656,-0.014640808,-0.04675293,-0.044006348,-0.018615723,0.015350342,0.037231445,-0.026031494,0.04449463,-0.0032367706,0.04345703,-0.001115799,0.010421753,-0.06738281,0.04751587,0.02293396,-0.04522705,-0.013977051,-0.0067596436,-0.012413025,-0.013847351,0.013549805,0.0024852753,0.0024204254,-0.0013542175,-0.02217102,0.029586792,0.027389526,0.07574463,0.035858154,-0.0072250366,0.027618408,-0.0141067505,-0.005378723,-0.011199951,0.037719727,-0.0116119385,-0.013244629,0.00052547455,-0.0054626465,-0.033569336,-0.0435791,-0.0039711,0.03111267,-0.003419876,-0.02619934,0.005001068,-0.00034499168,-0.058746338,0.0037670135,0.03741455,-0.032562256,0.00017774105,-0.020828247,0.0048675537,-0.032196045,0.012191772,-0.01625061,0.013183594,-0.029693604,0.00856781,-0.034606934,0.0181427,0.0043258667,0.039031982,0.0016851425,-0.03289795,0.020477295,-0.006378174,-0.06317139,-0.0024471283,-0.01651001,-0.0004720688,-0.011833191,-0.02760315,-0.05230713,0.049560547,-0.030960083,-0.027526855,-0.002916336,0.036743164,0.06323242,0.03387451,0.031158447,0.042144775,-0.0011