('google-photos', 'Google Photos', 'productivity', 'Upload photos, build albums and browse the media the agent added.', '/services/google-photos.svg', '{"name":"Google Photos","slug":"google-photos","skills":[{"body":"# Google Photos\n\nSince March 2025 the Photos Library API only returns media that this connection uploaded. GOOGLEPHOTOS_LIST_MEDIA_ITEMS and GOOGLEPHOTOS_SEARCH_MEDIA_ITEMS therefore see the agent''s own uploads, not the user''s full library. Say so rather than reporting an empty library as a problem.\n\nUpload with GOOGLEPHOTOS_UPLOAD_MEDIA, or GOOGLEPHOTOS_BATCH_CREATE_MEDIA_ITEMS to bring several in at once, optionally straight into an album. GOOGLEPHOTOS_GET_MEDIA_ITEM_DOWNLOAD fetches one back and GOOGLEPHOTOS_BATCH_GET_MEDIA_ITEMS reads several by id.\n\nAlbums: GOOGLEPHOTOS_LIST_ALBUMS, GOOGLEPHOTOS_GET_ALBUM, GOOGLEPHOTOS_CREATE_ALBUM, GOOGLEPHOTOS_UPDATE_ALBUM for the title or cover, and GOOGLEPHOTOS_BATCH_ADD_MEDIA_ITEMS to file media into one. GOOGLEPHOTOS_UPDATE_MEDIA_ITEM sets a description and GOOGLEPHOTOS_ADD_ENRICHMENT inserts a text, location or map block between photos.","name":"google-photos-usage","description":"How to use Google Photos tools"}],"summary":"Upload photos, build albums and browse the media the agent added.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Google","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"googlephotos","allowedTools":["GOOGLEPHOTOS_LIST_ALBUMS","GOOGLEPHOTOS_GET_ALBUM","GOOGLEPHOTOS_CREATE_ALBUM","GOOGLEPHOTOS_UPDATE_ALBUM","GOOGLEPHOTOS_SEARCH_MEDIA_ITEMS","GOOGLEPHOTOS_LIST_MEDIA_ITEMS","GOOGLEPHOTOS_BATCH_GET_MEDIA_ITEMS","GOOGLEPHOTOS_GET_MEDIA_ITEM_DOWNLOAD","GOOGLEPHOTOS_UPLOAD_MEDIA","GOOGLEPHOTOS_BATCH_CREATE_MEDIA_ITEMS","GOOGLEPHOTOS_BATCH_ADD_MEDIA_ITEMS","GOOGLEPHOTOS_UPDATE_MEDIA_ITEM","GOOGLEPHOTOS_ADD_ENRICHMENT"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/google-photos","args":[],"na