('google-search-console', 'Google Search Console', 'seo', 'Query your site''s Google Search performance, queries, pages and indexing.', '/services/google-search-console.svg', '{"name":"Google Search Console","slug":"google-search-console","skills":[{"body":"# Google Search ConsoleStart with GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_LIST_SITES and iterate its siteEntry array: every other tool needs a site_url written exactly as the property is registered, either a domain property (sc-domain:example.com) or a URL-prefix property with protocol and trailing slash (https://www.example.com/). When the account has several properties and the user did not name one, ask which to use. GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_GET_SITE returns the permission level on a property.GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_SEARCH_ANALYTICS_QUERY is the workhorse: clicks, impressions, CTR and average position between start_date and end_date (YYYY-MM-DD), grouped by dimensions (query, page, country, device, date, searchAppearance). Results are sorted by clicks, or by date when grouping by date. row_limit defaults to 1000; paginate with start_row and stop when fewer rows than row_limit come back. Narrow with dimension_filter_groups, e.g. [{\"filters\": [{\"dimension\": \"page\", \"operator\": \"contains\", \"expression\": \"/blog/\"}]}]. search_type switches between web, image, video, news and discover.Data lags 2 to 3 days and the last 1 to 2 days are incomplete: end the range 3 days before today unless the user asks for fresh numbers, in which case pass data_state \"all\" and say the figures are provisional. History goes back about 16 months. When comparing periods, use ranges of the same length.GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_INSPECT_URL tells whether a page is indexed, its canonical, last crawl and coverage issues; the inspection_url must sit under site_url. GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_LIST_SITEMAPS and GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_GET_SITEMAP show submitted and indexed counts and errors. GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_SUBMIT_SITEMAP submits or resubmits a sitemap given its full URL in feedpath; it is the only tool that changes anything, so use it when the user asked for it or right after publishing new pages.Always state the property and the date range alongside any figure you give.","name":"google-search-console-usage","description":"How to use Google Search Console tools"}],"summary":"Query your site''s Google Search performance, queries, pages and indexing.","category":"seo","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Google","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"google_search_console","allowedTools":["GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_LIST_SITES","GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_GET_SITE","GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_SEARCH_ANALYTICS_QUERY","GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_INSPECT_URL","GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_LIST_SITEMAPS","GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_GET_SITEMAP","GOOGLE_SEARCH_CONSOLE_SUBMIT_SITEMAP"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/google-search-console","args":[],"name":"google-search-console","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Google Search Console in one click: sign in with Google and your agent can list the properties the account can see, pull clicks, impressions, CTR and position by query, page, country, device or date, inspect how a URL is indexed and submit sitemaps. The connection is brokered by Composio, whose Google app is verified, so no Google Cloud setup is needed.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.005027771,0.03564453,0.026504517,0.0073394775,-0.0032176971,-0.036621094,-0.036743164,-0.025985718,-0.021347046,-0.0154800415,0.012863159,-0.02168274,0.0050582886,-0.038635254,0.019088745,-0.011756897,-0.060546875,0.018325806,0.04647827,0.032989502,0.021575928,0.009925842,-0.01638794,0.014373779,-0.03137207,-0.0050354004,-0.013175964,0.017425537,0.009162903,-0.03543091,-0.0047340393,-0.022888184,-0.028518677,-0.0036888123,0.014511108,0.0010757446,-0