('google-slides', 'Google Slides', 'productivity', 'Build and edit Google Slides presentations.', '/services/google-slides.svg', '{"name":"Google Slides","slug":"google-slides","skills":[{"body":"# Google Slides\n\nGOOGLESLIDES_CREATE_SLIDES_MARKDOWN is the fastest way to a real deck: it turns Markdown into slides, splitting on headings. Use GOOGLESLIDES_CREATE_PRESENTATION only when you want an empty deck to fill call by call.\n\nWhen the user has a house template, GOOGLESLIDES_PRESENTATIONS_COPY_FROM_TEMPLATE duplicates it and you edit the copy, which keeps their fonts and colors.\n\nRead a deck with GOOGLESLIDES_PRESENTATIONS_GET, which returns every slide and the object ids you need to target, and one slide with GOOGLESLIDES_PRESENTATIONS_PAGES_GET. GOOGLESLIDES_PRESENTATIONS_BATCH_UPDATE applies edits, accepting either Markdown content or raw Slides API requests; batch related changes into a single call. GOOGLESLIDES_GET_PAGE_THUMBNAIL2 renders a slide as an image so you can check the result.\n\nEdits target object ids that only exist in the current version of the deck, so re-read the presentation after a batch update rather than reusing stale ids.","name":"google-slides-usage","description":"How to use Google Slides tools"}],"summary":"Build and edit Google Slides presentations.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Google","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"googleslides","allowedTools":["GOOGLESLIDES_CREATE_PRESENTATION","GOOGLESLIDES_CREATE_SLIDES_MARKDOWN","GOOGLESLIDES_PRESENTATIONS_GET","GOOGLESLIDES_PRESENTATIONS_PAGES_GET","GOOGLESLIDES_PRESENTATIONS_BATCH_UPDATE","GOOGLESLIDES_PRESENTATIONS_COPY_FROM_TEMPLATE","GOOGLESLIDES_GET_PAGE_THUMBNAIL2"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/google-slides","args":[],"name":"google-slides","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Google Slides in one click: sign in with Google and your agent can build a deck from Markdown, duplicate a template and edit existing slides. The connection is brokered by Composio, whose Google app is verified, so no Google Cloud setup is needed.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.026062012,0.018920898,-0.011672974,-0.0038890839,0.0005402565,-0.043273926,-0.013977051,0.03729248,-0.018859863,-0.023452759,0.0056266785,-0.012779236,0.0036182404,-0.0048561096,0.0019493103,0.0048179626,-0.019729614,-0.042266846,0.0021839142,0.044128418,0.0058937073,0.017608643,0.01586914,0.0368042,-0.022277832,0.036621094,-0.05230713,-0.0023956299,0.0044937134,-0.05130005,-0.031677246,-0.022003174,0.0181427,0.03186035,0.041931152,-0.020553589,-0.029052734,0.019638062,-0.0053520203,0.013702393,0.012870789,0.045074463,0.038238525,0.02255249,0.03074646,0.028762817,0.013336182,-0.02897644,-0.0020542145,0.009063721,-0.005592346,0.025039673,-0.004005432,-0.022262573,-0.028945923,0.0071907043,0.015411377,-0.022979736,-0.014755249,-0.008125305,0.0021800995,-0.020339966,-0.025741577,0.06530762,-0.053100586,-0.014030457,-0.05480957,0.0032253265,-0.024627686,0.02545166,-0.022827148,-0.0095825195,-0.036315918,0.020370483,0.0059165955,0.015960693,-0.01171875,0.025604248,-0.0038070679,-0.023254395,0.00089120865,-0.0046806335,-0.063964844,-0.018569946,-0.064819336,-0.00945282,-0.00038599968,-0.0027179718,-0.05368042,0.015388489,-0.03543091,-0.02053833,-0.039794922,0.013031006,0.057495117,0.08392334,0.017852783,0.058654785,-0.008964539,0.051757812,0.057037354,0.004196167,-0.052612305,-0.04901123,-0.0043029785,-0.0017318726,0.03729248,0.012077332,-0.008995056,-0.013511658,-0.055908203,-0.026229858,-0.048828125,0.021759033,-0.04537964,-0.030319214,0.067993164,-0.021774292,-0.008323669,-0.03857422,-0.090148926,-0.04486084,-0.033477783,0.015960693,0.017288208,-0.008102417,-0.073913574,-0.0064811707,-0.030227661,-0.015945435,-0.02168274,-0.04714966,0.066