('google-tasks', 'Google Tasks', 'productivity', 'Manage the user''s Google Tasks lists and to-dos.', '/services/google-tasks.svg', '{"name":"Google Tasks","slug":"google-tasks","skills":[{"body":"# Google Tasks\n\nEverything hangs off a task list id, so call GOOGLETASKS_LIST_TASK_LISTS first. GOOGLETASKS_GET_TASK_LIST reads one, GOOGLETASKS_CREATE_TASK_LIST adds one, GOOGLETASKS_PATCH_TASK_LIST renames it and GOOGLETASKS_DELETE_TASK_LIST removes it with all its tasks, permanently.\n\nGOOGLETASKS_LIST_TASKS returns the tasks of one list; pass showCompleted when the user asks what is already done. GOOGLETASKS_LIST_ALL_TASKS sweeps every list at once, which is the right call for \"what do I have to do\". GOOGLETASKS_GET_TASK needs both the list id and the task id.\n\nAdd with GOOGLETASKS_INSERT_TASK. Update with GOOGLETASKS_PATCH_TASK: set `status` to `completed` to tick a task off, or change its title, notes or due date. Due dates are RFC3339 UTC and Google only keeps the date part. GOOGLETASKS_MOVE_TASK reorders a task or moves it to another list, GOOGLETASKS_DELETE_TASK removes one and GOOGLETASKS_CLEAR_TASKS wipes every completed task of a list.\n\nDeletion is permanent. Confirm with the user before clearing or deleting anything.","name":"google-tasks-usage","description":"How to use Google Tasks tools"}],"summary":"Manage the user''s Google Tasks lists and to-dos.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Google","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"googletasks","allowedTools":["GOOGLETASKS_LIST_TASK_LISTS","GOOGLETASKS_GET_TASK_LIST","GOOGLETASKS_CREATE_TASK_LIST","GOOGLETASKS_PATCH_TASK_LIST","GOOGLETASKS_DELETE_TASK_LIST","GOOGLETASKS_LIST_TASKS","GOOGLETASKS_LIST_ALL_TASKS","GOOGLETASKS_GET_TASK","GOOGLETASKS_INSERT_TASK","GOOGLETASKS_PATCH_TASK","GOOGLETASKS_MOVE_TASK","GOOGLETASKS_DELETE_TASK","GOOGLETASKS_CLEAR_TASKS"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_UR