('granola', 'Granola', 'productivity', 'Let the agent search and read your Granola meeting notes, transcripts, and insights via natural language.', '/services/granola.png?tone=dark', '{"name":"Granola","slug":"granola","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Granola\n\nGranola exposes your meeting notes over MCP. Use it to search meetings, read notes and full transcripts (with speaker identification), inspect meeting metadata and folders, and analyze patterns across your meeting history.\n\nConnect via browser-based OAuth (sign in to your Granola account) the first time. Some tools such as transcript access and folder listing require a paid Granola plan.\n\nStart from a search or list to find the relevant meeting, then fetch its notes or transcript before summarizing or extracting action items.","name":"granola-usage","description":"How to use Granola tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Let the agent search and read your Granola meeting notes, transcripts, and insights via natural language.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.granola.ai/mcp","args":[],"name":"granola","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Granola is an AI notepad for meetings. Its MCP server lets AI tools access your meeting notes, transcripts, metadata, and folders so you can query and analyze your meeting history conversationally."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.012229919,0.023712158,0.03060913,-0.012893677,-0.02305603,-0.01763916,0.022659302,0.033599854,0.018249512,-0.03744507,0.030014038,-0.01474762,-0.014190674,-0.011581421,-0.0211792,0.028778076,-0.037261963,-0.037200928,0.0001655817,0.028884888,0.025863647,0.053894043,-0.045410156,0.047424316,-0.0014820099,-0.0022087097,-0.026977539,0.05819702,0.02357483,0.0010852814,0.006832123,-0.0178833,-0.022781372,0.0037269592,0.030975342,-0.03152466,0.01927185,0.019699097,-0.0064926147,0.055236816,-0.008468628,0.015541077,0.0028934479,-0.0039787292,0.06100464,0.026107788,-0.005683899,-0.008720398,0.015266418,-0