('heygen', 'HeyGen', 'marketing', 'Generate AI avatar videos from text using your HeyGen account directly from an AI agent.', '/services/heygen.png?tone=light', '{"name":"HeyGen","slug":"heygen","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# HeyGen\n\nHeyGen generates AI avatar videos from text using your connected HeyGen account (draws from your plan credits).\n\n## Typical flow\n1. Check remaining credits before generating.\n2. List available voices and avatar groups, then list avatars within a chosen group.\n3. Generate an avatar video by providing the script text, a voice, and an avatar.\n4. Poll the video status until it is completed to get the final video URL.\n\n## Tips\n- Video generation is asynchronous: always retrieve video status until it reports completed or failed.\n- Keep an eye on credits, since each generation consumes them from your current HeyGen plan.","name":"heygen-usage","description":"How to use HeyGen MCP tools to generate avatar videos"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Generate AI avatar videos from text using your HeyGen account directly from an AI agent.","category":"marketing","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.heygen.com/mcp/v1/","args":[],"name":"heygen","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"HeyGen''s remote MCP server lets agents create avatar videos, list voices and avatars, check video status, and read remaining credits using your existing HeyGen plan. It runs on HeyGen''s hosted infrastructure with nothing to install locally. You connect once through a browser OAuth sign-in tied to your HeyGen account."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.00053215027,0.0076293945,0.057281494,0.03186035,-0.027328491,-0.07336426,0.041534424,0.024612427,0.024978638,0.003742218,0.021896362,-0.03353882,-0.0211792,-0.0234375,-0.039031982,-0.0075645447,-0.04055786,-0.027130127,-0.017028809,0.012237549,-0.010368347,0.054504395,0.009567261,0.04763794,-0.015151978,0.003540039,-0.041290283,0.03894043,0.013221741,-0.018798828,0.04019165,-0.023651123,-0.010437