('huggingface', 'Hugging Face', 'dev', 'Search and explore Hugging Face models, datasets, Spaces, papers, and docs, and run community tools from your agent.', '/services/huggingface.svg', '{"name":"Hugging Face","slug":"huggingface","skills":[{"body":"# Hugging Face\n\nUse the huggingface_* tools to explore the Hugging Face Hub and run community tools.\n\n## What you can do\n- Search models with filters for task, library, and more.\n- Search datasets with filters for author, tags, and more.\n- Semantic search over Spaces (AI apps), research papers, and Hugging Face documentation.\n- Get detailed info about a specific model, dataset, or Space (optionally including its README).\n- Run and manage Jobs on Hugging Face infrastructure.\n- Call MCP-compatible Gradio Spaces the user has enabled in their MCP settings.\n\n## Tips\n- For ''how do I...'' questions about Hugging Face libraries (transformers, PEFT, diffusers, etc.), use the Documentation Semantic Search tool.\n- When looking for an app to do a task (e.g. transcribe audio, generate an image), use Spaces Semantic Search.\n- Available tools and community Spaces depend on what the user has enabled at https://huggingface.co/settings/mcp; if a tool is missing, ask them to enable it there and reload.\n\n## Example prompts\n- \"Search Hugging Face models for Qwen 3 quantizations.\"\n- \"Find a Space that can transcribe audio files.\"\n- \"Show datasets about weather time-series.\"\n- \"How do I use LoRA adapters with PEFT?\"\n- \"Find papers about vision-language models.\"","name":"huggingface-usage","description":"How to use the huggingface_* tools to search the Hugging Face Hub and docs."}],"summary":"Search and explore Hugging Face models, datasets, Spaces, papers, and docs, and run community tools from your agent.","category":"dev","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Hugging Face","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://huggingface.co/mcp?login","args":[],"name":"huggingface","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"access-token","kind":"key","label":"Access token","inputs":[{"key":"API_KEY","help":"Create a token with at least Read access at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens, then manage MCP tools/Spaces at https://huggingface.co/settings/mcp","type":"password","label":"Hugging Face Access Token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"hf_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://huggingface.co/mcp","args":[],"name":"huggingface","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects the official hosted Hugging Face MCP server so the agent can search the Hub (models, datasets, Spaces, papers), query the documentation semantically, and invoke MCP-compatible community Spaces. Authenticate by signing in with Hugging Face (OAuth) or with a read access token."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.026260376,-0.012184143,0.047821045,0.038482666,-0.01473999,-0.007381439,-0.01109314,0.057739258,0.028945923,-0.0033607483,-0.0077781677,-0.030853271,-0.0017156601,-0.016540527,-0.026184082,0.045288086,-0.018447876,0.030059814,0.0032520294,0.018814087,0.003206253,0.023010254,-0.018539429,0.01802063,-0.013244629,0.01159668,-0.040771484,0.013420105,0.040802002,-0.037017822,-0.024765015,-0.03378296,-0.027679443,0.018600464,0.0044517517,0.061920166,-0.06994629,0.066711426,-0.036376953,0.029663086,-0.027130127,-0.002998352,0.012619019,0.024993896,-0.008308411,-0.043304443,-0.0088272095,-0.041870117,0.008239746,0.007965088,-0.02545166,-0.015083313,-0.020950317,0.026916504,-0.038757324,-0.012359619,0.0115737915,-0.015991211,-0.019317627,0.03164673,-0.033172607,-0.005657196,-0.034423828,0.0309906,-0.016937256,0.012893677,-0.03829956,-0.007461548,-0.050048828,0.013549805,0.023117065,0.018234253,-0.001200676,0.009605408,-0.036865234,-0.022842407,-0.007926941,0.0871582,-0.027999878,-0.0418396,0.012374878,-0.003572464,