('indeed', 'Indeed', 'productivity', 'Search jobs, read job and company details, and access the signed-in job seeker''s Indeed profile.', '/services/indeed.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Indeed","slug":"indeed","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Indeed\n\nConnect by signing in with your Indeed account when prompted (OAuth). Once connected, the agent can search job listings, read job and company details, and access the signed-in job seeker''s profile.\n\nGuidance:\n- Ask the user for role, location, and any filters before searching so results are relevant.\n- Available scopes cover job search, company details, and job-seeker profile reads; this is a job-seeker (not employer) integration.\n- The server is in beta and provided by Indeed.","name":"indeed-usage","description":"How to use Indeed tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Search jobs, read job and company details, and access the signed-in job seeker''s Indeed profile.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.indeed.com/claude/mcp","args":[],"name":"indeed","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Official Indeed remote MCP server (beta) that lets an agent search Indeed job listings, retrieve company details, and read the connected user''s job-seeker profile. Authentication is handled through Indeed account sign-in via standard OAuth."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.006778717,-0.0056381226,0.048339844,0.016860962,0.030075073,-0.01966858,0.030181885,0.07727051,-0.009841919,0.01133728,0.044006348,-0.007232666,0.0069084167,-0.0051727295,0.010612488,0.03353882,-0.023880005,0.0038070679,-0.02305603,0.04989624,0.056732178,0.03475952,-0.010612488,0.034240723,-0.012557983,-0.0030212402,-0.06768799,0.018310547,0.037322998,-0.045684814,0.0039253235,-0.027130127,-0.022628784,0.022094727,0.052612305,-0.011306763,0.019958496,0.034698486,0.0040512085,-0.032165527,-0.011886597,0.020751953,-0.009086609,-0.013504028,-0.024215698,-0.0002746582,-0.026306152,0.013786316,0.03488159,0.013641357,-0.0205