('instacart', 'Instacart', 'ecommerce', 'Connect AI agents to Instacart to create shoppable recipe pages, generate grocery shopping lists, and discover nearby retailers.', '/services/instacart.svg', '{"name":"Instacart","slug":"instacart","inputs":[{"key":"INSTACART_API_KEY","help":"Create one in the Instacart Developer Dashboard under API Keys (see https://docs.instacart.com/developer_platform_api/get_started/api-keys). Copy it immediately, as the full key is shown only once.","type":"password","label":"Instacart API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"keys.xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"}],"skills":[{"body":"# Instacart\n\nThe Instacart MCP server connects agents to the Instacart Developer Platform.\n\n## Tools\n\n- **create-recipe** — Generate a shoppable recipe page from ingredients, instructions, and measurements. Returns an Instacart URL where the user can shop all ingredients.\n- **create-shopping-list** — Build a grocery shopping list page from a set of items. Returns an Instacart URL.\n- **Retailer discovery** — Find available Instacart retailers near a given postal code and country code.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Provide clear item names and quantities; the server handles Instacart-specific formatting.\n- The returned URLs open on Instacart Marketplace so the user can review and check out.\n- Requires a valid Instacart Developer Platform API key with appropriate (read-write) permissions.","name":"instacart-usage","description":"How to use Instacart MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Connect AI agents to Instacart to create shoppable recipe pages, generate grocery shopping lists, and discover nearby retailers.","category":"ecommerce","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.instacart.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"instacart","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.INSTACART_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Instacart''s official Developer Platform MCP server lets agents turn natural language into shoppable Instacart pages. It exposes tools to 