('jina', 'Jina AI', 'dev', 'Read web pages, search the web, and compute embeddings and reranking through Jina AI''s official remote MCP server.', '/services/jina.png', '{"name":"Jina AI","slug":"jina","inputs":[{"key":"JINA_API_KEY","help":"Get a free key from the Jina AI API dashboard at https://jina.ai (Log in, then API dashboard). Keys start with ''jina_''.","type":"password","label":"Jina API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"jina_..."}],"skills":[{"body":"# Jina AI\n\nOfficial remote MCP server at https://mcp.jina.ai/v1 (streamable HTTP). Authenticated with a Bearer Jina API key.\n\n## Tools\n- read_url: fetch a URL and return clean markdown (Jina Reader).\n- capture_screenshot_url: screenshot a web page.\n- web search and image search: find pages and images.\n- arXiv search: find research papers.\n- embeddings: compute vector embeddings for text.\n- rerank: reorder documents by relevance to a query.\n\n## Notes\n- read_url and screenshot work without a key but are rate-limited; search, embeddings, and rerank need the API key.\n- Get a free key at https://jina.ai (API dashboard).","name":"jina-usage","description":"How to use Jina AI MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Read web pages, search the web, and compute embeddings and reranking through Jina AI''s official remote MCP server.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.jina.ai/v1","args":[],"name":"jina","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.JINA_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Jina AI exposes an official hosted MCP server giving agents URL-to-markdown reading, web and image search, arXiv search, screenshot capture, embeddings, and reranking. Tools are backed by Jina''s Reader, Embeddings, and Reranker APIs. A Jina API key raises rate limits and unlocks search, embeddings, and reranking tools."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.017745972,0.0023021698,0.038085938,0.010559082,0.014228821,-0.04522705,0.00969696,0.050323486,-0.028961182,0.0014133453,0.021194458