('jotform', 'Jotform', 'productivity', 'Manage Jotform forms and submissions through AI using natural language.', '/services/jotform.png', '{"name":"Jotform","slug":"jotform","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Jotform MCP\n\nThe Jotform MCP server connects to your Jotform account over OAuth. On first use, an authorization window opens in the browser to grant access to your forms and submissions.\n\n## Common tasks\n\n- List your forms (form_list) to find a form ID.\n- Create a new form (create_form) or edit an existing one (edit_form).\n- Read a form''s submissions (get_submissions) using its form ID.\n- Add a submission programmatically (create_submission).\n\n## Tips\n\n- Always resolve a form''s ID via form_list before reading or writing submissions.\n- Scopes are readOnly or full; write operations require the full scope granted during OAuth consent.\n- Your existing Jotform plan limits and quotas still apply.","name":"jotform-usage","description":"How to use Jotform tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Manage Jotform forms and submissions through AI using natural language.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.jotform.com","args":[],"name":"jotform","oauth":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Jotform''s official hosted MCP server exposes your forms and submissions to any MCP-compatible client. It lets an AI list, create, and edit forms as well as create and read submissions. Authentication is a browser-based OAuth flow scoped to your Jotform account permissions."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.010948181,0.032440186,0.023986816,-0.004749298,-0.014961243,-0.061279297,0.032989502,0.07373047,0.0038490295,0.020690918,0.016189575,-0.01689148,-0.008125305,0.02720642,-0.026382446,0.025970459,-0.02330017,-0.008491516,0.0030937195,0.028442383,0.027709961,0.059753418,0.01335144,0.004180908,0.009468079,0.004611969,-0.053741455,-0.0011205673,-0.02911377,-0.018356323,0.022262573,-0.011741638,-0.043060303,0.051208496,0.018997192,0.004585266,0.031311035