('klaviyo', 'Klaviyo', 'marketing', 'Manage Klaviyo email/SMS marketing, lists, profiles and campaigns.', '/services/klaviyo.png', '{"name":"Klaviyo","slug":"klaviyo","skills":[{"body":"# Klaviyo\n\nUse the klaviyo_* tools to read profiles, lists, segments, metrics and events, and to draft campaigns and flows. Always confirm the target audience (list/segment) and the message content with the user before sending, and never send a campaign or SMS without the user''s explicit go-ahead.","name":"klaviyo-usage","description":"How to use Klaviyo tools"}],"summary":"Manage Klaviyo email/SMS marketing, lists, profiles and campaigns.","category":"marketing","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Klaviyo","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.klaviyo.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"klaviyo","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"stdio","label":"Klaviyo private API key","inputs":[{"key":"KLAVIYO_API_KEY","help":"Klaviyo → Settings → API Keys → Private API Keys → Create Private API Key. Copy it immediately (it can''t be viewed again).","type":"password","label":"Klaviyo private API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"pk_…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{"READ_ONLY":"false","PRIVATE_API_KEY":"${input.KLAVIYO_API_KEY}","ALLOW_USER_GENERATED_CONTENT":"false"},"args":["klaviyo-mcp-server@latest"],"name":"klaviyo","command":"uvx","headers":{},"transport":"stdio"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects Klaviyo for email/SMS marketing. Use the hosted MCP server by signing in with Klaviyo in your browser (OAuth), or run Klaviyo''s local MCP server (uvx klaviyo-mcp-server) with your private API key. Lets the agent read profiles, lists, segments and metrics, and draft campaigns and flows. For the local server the key is passed to the engine as the PRIVATE_API_KEY env var at install time, never stored in Supabase.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, true, '[-