('legalzoom', 'LegalZoom', 'productivity', 'Connect AI assistants to LegalZoom for attorney consultations, business formation, and legal document review.', '/services/legalzoom.png?tone=light', '{"name":"LegalZoom","slug":"legalzoom","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# LegalZoom MCP\n\nOfficial LegalZoom MCP server for attorney consultation, business formation, and legal document handling. Connects AI conversations to LegalZoom''s Experts Collaboration Platform.\n\n## Auth\n\nSign in with your LegalZoom account via OAuth when prompted. No API key. Available features depend on your LegalZoom subscription tier and entitlements, which are verified in real time.\n\n## Typical flow\n\n1. Call `check_attorney_consultation_entitlements` to confirm the user has attorney consultation access.\n2. Use `get_consultation_topics` and `get_valid_locations` to gather valid inputs (topic + US state/territory).\n3. Call `get_attorney_availability` to find open times by topic and location.\n4. Call `request_attorney_review` to connect the user with a LegalZoom attorney for professional legal review.\n5. Use `attach_document_to_attorney_review` to attach supporting documents (.pdf, .doc, .docx) to an existing review.\n6. If the user lacks an active plan, use `add_bap_to_cart` to add an attorney consultation plan to their cart and guide them through checkout.\n\n## Notes\n\n- The server focuses on entitlement checks, attorney routing, scheduling, and document handoff rather than giving general legal advice.\n- If a call fails on entitlements or jurisdiction, report the reason instead of fabricating a result.","name":"legalzoom-usage","description":"How to use LegalZoom tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Connect AI assistants to LegalZoom for attorney consultations, business formation, and legal document review.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://www.legalzoom.com/mcp/claude/v1","args":[],"name":"legalzoom","oauth":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"LegalZoom''s official MCP server bridges AI conversations with LegalZoom''s legal services and its Experts Collaboration Platform. It checks a signed-in user''s plan entitlements, lists consultation topics and valid US locations, browses attorney availability, schedules attorney reviews, and attaches documents so full context reaches the attorney. Authentication is standard OAuth against the user''s LegalZoom account."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.0069274902,0.055358887,0.02418518,0.034179688,-0.01637268,-0.034057617,-0.0047912598,0.0904541,0.00920105,0.007972717,0.022720337,-0.011459351,0.020050049,0.009651184,-0.037231445,0.058441162,-0.030288696,0.005935669,-0.015220642,0.011314392,0.018112183,0.05441284,0.018707275,-0.003030777,-0.033569336,0.010047913,-0.03314209,0.0034503937,0.012718201,-0.027526855,0.04159546,-0.03277588,-0.0014324188,0.019577026,-0.033843994,0.03262329,0.0004892349,0.04711914,0.009223938,0.011444092,-0.023025513,0.027130127,0.028152466,0.018035889,0.015274048,0.004634857,0.017822266,-0.0020751953,0.0012693405,-0.016738892,-0.021972656,0.013031006,0.0022468567,0.024932861,-0.07043457,0.008834839,0.028930664,-0.00054597855,-0.012870789,0.06402588,-0.00056505203,-0.026947021,0.034179688,0.036346436,-0.03036499,-0.032592773,-0.040008545,0.015159607,0.0067367554,-0.004558563,-0.014038086,0.009460449,-0.014350891,-0.008018494,0.0016088486,0.021575928,0.017532349,0.080078125,-0.002248764,-0.015327454,0.023849487,0.048461914,-0.02609253,-0.03286743,-0.030410767,0.021606445,-0.01776123,0.006286621,-0.06286621,0.0030460358,-0.020111084,-0.030471802,-0.020736694,-0.0029792786,0.08288574,0.038208008,0.026412964,0.017837524,0.035308838,0.062805176,-0.015068054,-0.03274536,-0.029876709,-0.026855469,0.013298035,0.028900146,0.046936035,-0.031036377,0.0048828125,-0.005050659,-0.08770752,-0.0057373047,-0.057037354,0.00051641464,0.030471802,-0.048217773,0.014465332,-0.01966858,-0.0107421875,-0.026138306,-0.05328369,0.02128601,0.028640747,-0.007904053,0.021011353,-0.0207