('lemlist', 'lemlist', 'crm', 'Run cold email outreach: manage campaigns, sequences and leads via lemlist.', '/services/lemlist.png?tone=light', '{"name":"lemlist","slug":"lemlist","skills":[{"body":"# lemlist\n\nUse the lemlist tools to run outbound sales outreach. You can create, edit, pause or delete campaigns; build multi-step email sequences with variables and follow-up timing; pull campaign stats (open, reply, conversion rates) for a time window; and source or enrich leads by ICP (role, industry, company size, location). Ask which campaign or ICP to target before making changes.","name":"lemlist-usage","description":"How to use lemlist tools"}],"summary":"Run cold email outreach: manage campaigns, sequences and leads via lemlist.","category":"crm","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with lemlist","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://app.lemlist.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"lemlist","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"lemlist API key","inputs":[{"key":"LEMLIST_API_KEY","help":"Create one in lemlist → Settings → Team → Integrations → Generate. Save it somewhere safe.","type":"password","label":"lemlist API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"Your lemlist API key"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://app.lemlist.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"lemlist","headers":{"X-API-Key":"${input.LEMLIST_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects lemlist''s hosted MCP server. Sign in with lemlist in your browser (OAuth, no key to paste) or authenticate with a lemlist API key via the X-API-Key header. Create and edit campaigns, pull open/reply stats, source leads by ICP and draft multi-step email sequences."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.038238525,0.0031089783,0.030075073,-0.020690918,0.00033855438,-0.029296875,-0.0014925003,0.026260376,0.016113281,0.03149414,0.02722168,-0.042877197,-0.008491516,0.011512