,0.024169922,0.0057678223,-0.0011196136,0.03894043,0.011940002,0.014122009,-0.027893066,-0.016845703,-0.004749298,-0.021987915,-0.001115799,-0.0056610107,0.04269409,0.00014901161,-0.002445221,0.023880005,-0.027069092,0.007873535,-0.0090408325,-0.028778076,0.0037174225,0.033111572,0.009162903,-0.013198853,0.009048462,-0.02305603,0.02748108,0.011161804,0.021438599,0.034057617,0.010765076,-0.012619019,0.0008831024,0.010070801,0.010643005,-0.020645142,0.018600464,-0.019622803,-0.025344849,0.025253296,0.0036563873,0.012794495,-0.019607544,0.022781372,0.007835388,0.0031700134,-0.013885498,0.0010528564,0.019424438,0.010108948,0.025115967,0.013679504,-0.0065689087,0.0024490356,0.029953003,-0.017593384,-0.004005432,0.016113281,-0.011550903,-0.005203247,0.0043296814,0.04360962,0.0007138252,-0.023208618,-0.0044174194,-0.0034313202,0.0231781,0.02230835,-0.0119018555,0.010932922,0.0053710938,-0.031219482,0.0018625259,0.048309326,-0.012550354,0.06311035,-0.004463196,-0.0104904175,0.019851685,-0.048095703,0.023269653,0.0036010742,0.0017662048,-0.0030117035,-0.017974854,-0.018630981,-0.016586304]'),
('lightreel', 'Lightreel', 'marketing', 'Research TikTok and Instagram UGC: winning hooks, creators, trends and video feedback.', '/services/lightreel.png', '{"name":"Lightreel","slug":"lightreel","inputs":[{"key":"LIGHTREEL_API_KEY","help":"Create it in Lightreel → API tab → Create API key (lightreel.ai/api-keys).","type":"password","label":"Lightreel API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"lr_live_…"}],"skills":[{"body":"# Lightreel\n\nLightreel answers marketing research questions over a database of 150,000+ TikTok\nand Instagram UGC videos. There is no MCP server; call its REST API with curl.\n\n- Base URL: `https://api.lightreel.ai`\n- Auth header: `Authorization: Bearer $LIGHTREEL_API_KEY`\n- The key is available in the environment as `LIGHTREEL_API_KEY`. Never print it.\n\n## Ask a question\n```bash\ncurl -sS --max-time 600 -X POST https://api.lightreel.ai/v1/chat \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $LIGHTREEL_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -d ''{\"question\":\"find me the top fitness hooks this week\"}''\n```\nReturns `{ \"conversationId\": \"...\", \"answer\": \"...\" }`. Pass `conversation_id` to\ncontinue an existing thread.\n\n## Structured output\nAdd `response_fields` (max 5 fields, types `\"string\"` or `\"array\"` only) to get JSON\ninside `answer` instead of prose. Put the expected content AND the supporting evidence\nyou want in each description. For several attributes about the same items, use several\narrays and say in the descriptions that they are index-aligned.\n```bash\n-d ''{\n  \"question\": \"Find fitness creators who post workout vlogs and are open to brand deals\",\n  \"response_fields\": {\n    \"handles\":      { \"type\": \"array\", \"description\": \"One creator handle per entry\" },\n    \"descriptions\": { \"type\": \"array\", \"description\": \"What the creator posts, index-aligned with handles\" },\n    \"top_videos\":   { \"type\": \"array\", \"description\": \"Best performing video from the last 2 weeks, index-aligned with handles\" }\n  }\n}''\n```\n\n## Transcripts\n- `GET /v1/chat/:id` - one past conversation.\n- `GET /v1/chats` - the latest 50 API chats.\n\n## Rules\n- Requests can take **several minutes**. Always set a generous timeout (`--max-time 600`);\n  a timeout is not a failure of the query.\n- The more context in the question (product, audience, platform, timeframe), the better\n  the answer. Be specific rather than terse.\n- Errors return a non-2xx with `{\"error\":{\"message\":…,\"type\":…}}`; `authentication_error`\n  means the key is missing or invalid.\n- API calls draw from the account''s normal usage quota, so avoid redundant repeat queries.","name":"lightreel-usage","description":"How to query the Lightreel UGC research API"}],"envKeys":[{"key":"LIGHTREEL_API_KEY","fromInput":"LIGHTREEL_API_KEY"}],"summary":"Research TikTok and Instagram UGC: winning hooks, creators, trends and video feedback.","category":"marketing","mcpServers":[],"description":"Lightreel is an AI research engine on top of a database of 150,000+ TikTok and Instagram UGC videos, refreshed daily. It has no MCP server, so the agent queries its REST API directly to find creators, analyse hooks, spot trends, critique accounts and draft UGC briefs."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.00084257126,0.0009160042,-0.012886047,0.013877869,0.0107803345,-0.033813477,-0.010437012,0.0340271,0.011528015,0.024917603,-0.008178711,-0.019104004,-0.021636963,-0.017089844,0.005428314,0.025772095,-0.031982422,-0.042236328,-0.021438599,0.058135986,0.040405273,0.0065956116,-0.007232666,0.032043457,0.03918457,-0.021057129,-0.030319214,0.010292053,-0.0132751465,0.011428833,0.030639648,-0.023269653,-0.0034751892,0.011062622,0.005859375,-0.011642456,0.01096344,-0.020095825,0.030319214,0.005924225,-0.0065841675,-0.0059432983,0.03390503,0.021087646,0.006668091,-0.0030841827,0.0066986084,0.010734558,0.0012540817,-0.009819031,-0.015686035,0.045898438,-0.054840088,-0.0007481575,-0.024246216,0.003789901