('linkedin', 'LinkedIn', 'marketing', 'Publish posts, share links and comment on LinkedIn as yourself.', '/services/linkedin.svg', '{"name":"LinkedIn","slug":"linkedin","skills":[{"body":"# LinkedIn\n\nYou post as the signed-in member. Call `linkedin_LINKEDIN_GET_MY_INFO` first: every write tool needs the person URN it returns (`urn:li:person:<id>`) as `author`.\n\n## Publishing\n\n- Plain text or image post: `linkedin_LINKEDIN_CREATE_LINKED_IN_POST` with `author` and `commentary`.\n- Link or article share: `linkedin_LINKEDIN_CREATE_ARTICLE_OR_URL_SHARE`.\n- Comment or reply: `linkedin_LINKEDIN_CREATE_COMMENT_ON_POST`.\n- Delete: `linkedin_LINKEDIN_DELETE_POST` with the post URN.\n\nAlways show the user the exact draft and wait for approval before publishing. Never delete a post without an explicit confirmation.\n\n## Posting an image\n\n1. `linkedin_LINKEDIN_INITIALIZE_IMAGE_UPLOAD` with `owner` set to your person URN. It returns a presigned `uploadUrl` and an image URN.\n2. PUT the image bytes to that `uploadUrl` yourself (plain HTTP request, no tool for this step).\n3. Optionally poll `linkedin_LINKEDIN_GET_IMAGE` until the image is available.\n4. Create the post with `linkedin_LINKEDIN_CREATE_LINKED_IN_POST`, passing the image URN in `images`.\n\n## Not available\n\nThe connection is scoped to the member (`w_member_social`, `profile`, `email`). Company page data, organization or share analytics, follower counts, reactions and other members profiles are not reachable: do not promise them, and do not retry those calls.","name":"linkedin-usage","description":"How to use LinkedIn tools"}],"summary":"Publish posts, share links and comment on LinkedIn as yourself.","category":"marketing","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with LinkedIn","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"linkedin","allowedTools":["LINKEDIN_GET_MY_INFO","LINKEDIN_CREATE_LINKED_IN_POST","LINKEDIN_CREATE_ARTICLE_OR_URL_SHARE","LINKEDIN_CREATE_COMMENT_ON_POST","LINKEDIN_DELETE_POST","LINKEDIN_INITIALIZE_IMAGE_UPLOAD","LINKEDIN_GET_IMAGE"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/linkedin","args":[],"name":"linkedin","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Connect LinkedIn in one click. Lumvika brokers the connection through Composio and runs the LinkedIn calls for you: no developer app, no token to paste. Publish text and image posts, share articles and links, and comment on posts as the signed-in member.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, false, false, '[-0.04446411,-0.024597168,-0.0028495789,-0.0031356812,0.034088135,-0.058288574,-0.0070762634,0.042022705,-0.011558533,0.009300232,0.017547607,0.017944336,0.0065994263,0.008544922,-0.020553589,-0.010101318,-0.023834229,-0.017364502,0.04397583,0.055480957,-0.0034675598,0.01361084,0.0011339188,0.059783936,0.008140564,0.034454346,-0.05444336,-0.024108887,-0.013313293,-0.02684021,0.015487671,-0.028625488,0.00070619583,0.038208008,0.02229309,0.009498596,0.025863647,-0.0049209595,0.0178833,0.035888672,-0.0062026978,0.013076782,0.007232666,-0.013015747,-0.004714966,0.0030899048,-0.032226562,-0.038208008,0.059936523,0.05303955,-0.028335571,0.0151901245,0.012336731,0.007896423,-0.04269409,-0.012535095,0.019592285,0.0006995201,-0.014770508,0.026992798,-0.03552246,-0.045898438,0.008613586,0.017089844,-0.059387207,-0.0013589859,-0.038360596,-0.0075531006,-0.03744507,0.0107040405,0.008453369,-0.0345459,-0.0005040169,0.022476196,-0.038238525,-0.010406494,0.0046653748,0.054840088,0.012565613,-0.06298828,-0.0025863647,-0.008911133,-0.046173096,-0.0019798279,-0.05117798,-0.039916992,-0.009017944,-0.032287598,-0.040740967,0.011932373,0.00023508072,0.008422852,0.0010433197,0.010070801,0.057739258,-0.0016078949,-0.016540527,0.0065574646,-0.019836426,0.08905029,0.062316895,0.0003247261,-0.018569946,-0.020446777,0.0013570786,0.009735107,0.022903442,-0.