('lovable', 'Lovable', 'dev', 'Build, edit, and deploy Lovable AI-generated web apps from any AI agent via Lovable''s official hosted MCP server.', '/services/lovable.png', '{"name":"Lovable","slug":"lovable","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Lovable MCP\n\nLovable''s hosted MCP server lets an agent build and manage Lovable apps.\n\n## Connect\n- Transport: streamable HTTP at `https://mcp.lovable.dev`.\n- Auth: browser OAuth sign-in with your Lovable account (no API key). On first connection the client opens a browser window to authorize. Standard clients (Claude, Claude Code, ChatGPT, Cursor, VS Code) need only the URL; other clients also pass the public OAuth client id.\n- A paid Lovable plan (Pro/Business) is required to expose the MCP server.\n\n## What you can do\n- Projects: list, create, and inspect Lovable projects.\n- Agent/chat: send prompts to build or edit an app.\n- Code inspection: read generated files and project structure.\n- Cloud database: query and manage the app''s database.\n- Connectors: manage connected MCP servers and integrations.\n- Analytics and file uploads.\n\nStart by listing your projects, then open a project to inspect its files or send a build/edit prompt through the agent tools.","name":"lovable-usage","description":"How to use the Lovable MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Build, edit, and deploy Lovable AI-generated web apps from any AI agent via Lovable''s official hosted MCP server.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.lovable.dev","args":[],"name":"lovable","oauth":{"clientId":"6d465f583e1e4ce5801b1616f735670c"},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Lovable is an AI app builder that turns natural-language prompts into full-stack web apps. Its official hosted MCP server exposes Lovable projects, chat, code files, cloud database, connectors, analytics, and deploys as tools any MCP client can call. Authentication is a browser-based OAuth sign-in with your Lovable account, so no API key is stored