('mailchimp', 'Mailchimp', 'marketing', 'Send and manage transactional email through Mailchimp''s official Transactional Messaging (Mandrill) MCP server.', '/services/mailchimp.svg', '{"name":"Mailchimp","slug":"mailchimp","inputs":[{"key":"MAILCHIMP_TRANSACTIONAL_API_KEY","help":"In your Mailchimp Transactional (Mandrill) account, go to Settings > API keys (mandrillapp.com/settings) and create a key. Make sure the key''s permissions have the ''AI Agents'' group enabled.","type":"password","label":"Mailchimp Transactional (Mandrill) API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"md-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"}],"skills":[{"body":"# Mailchimp Transactional (Mandrill) MCP\n\nThis MCP connects to Mailchimp''s official Transactional Messaging server at https://mandrillapp.com/mcp.\n\n## Scope\n- Covers **transactional email** (Mandrill), not Mailchimp Marketing audiences/campaigns.\n- Typical actions: send transactional emails, run connection/health checks, get onboarding help, and submit feedback.\n\n## Auth\n- Uses an `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>` header.\n- The API key is a Mailchimp Transactional (Mandrill) key from Settings > API keys.\n- The key must have the **AI Agents** permission group enabled if it uses restricted permissions.\n\n## Tips\n- Verify connectivity first with a connection check before sending real email.\n- Send a test email to yourself before automating production sends.","name":"mailchimp-usage","description":"How to use the Mailchimp Transactional (Mandrill) MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Send and manage transactional email through Mailchimp''s official Transactional Messaging (Mandrill) MCP server.","category":"marketing","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mandrillapp.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"mailchimp-transactional","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.MAILCHIMP_TRANSACTIONAL_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects AI agents to Mailchimp''s Transactional Messaging API (Mandrill) via the official hosted