('malwarebytes', 'Malwarebytes ScamGuard', 'productivity', 'Check links, phone numbers, and email addresses for scams and threats using Malwarebytes ScamGuard threat intelligence.', '/services/malwarebytes.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Malwarebytes ScamGuard","slug":"malwarebytes","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Malwarebytes ScamGuard\n\nUse these tools to screen suspicious indicators against Malwarebytes threat intelligence. Verdicts are one of: malicious, suspicious, safe, unknown.\n\n## Tools\n\n- `reputation-check_link` — check a single URL/link.\n- `reputation-check_phone` — check a phone number. Always convert to E.164 format first (e.g. `+14155551234`).\n- `reputation-check_email` — check an email address for phishing/scam association.\n- `reputation-whois` — look up domain registration (registrar, age, abuse contact); useful for unknown/suspicious verdicts.\n- `reputation-report` — report a suspicious indicator. Only use when the user explicitly asks to report.\n- `reputation-scan_all` — scan multiple indicators at once (max 10). Prefer this when 3 or more indicators are present.\n\n## Guidance\n\n- Use proactively when a user shares links, phone numbers, or emails that seem suspicious, or asks \"is this safe / a scam?\".\n- Check every indicator in a message, not just the first.\n- Explain each verdict clearly and recommend caution for suspicious and strong warnings for malicious results.\n- Do not report content automatically without user consent.\n","name":"malwarebytes-usage","description":"How to use Malwarebytes ScamGuard reputation tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Check links, phone numbers, and email addresses for scams and threats using Malwarebytes ScamGuard threat intelligence.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://scamguard.malwarebytes.com/claude/mcp","args":[],"name":"malwarebytes","headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Malwarebytes ScamGuard is a hosted MCP server that lets an AI assistant screen suspicious URLs, phone numbers, and email addresses against Malwarebytes threat intelligence. It returns reputation verdicts (malicious, suspicious, safe, unknown), performs WHOIS/RDAP lookups, and can report or batch-scan multiple indicators at once. The connector is free and requires no Malwarebytes account, so no key or sign-in is stored."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.0056266785,0.027954102,0.023498535,0.0357666,-0.042114258,-0.0501709,-0.01637268,0.052459717,-0.0072631836,0.0055122375,0.03527832,-0.02293396,0.00036644936,0.01411438,-0.0048332214,0.018218994,-0.07354736,-0.036010742,-0.013084412,0.0023345947,0.016479492,0.06555176,0.011634827,0.032806396,-0.029281616,0.027404785,-0.036010742,-0.029220581,0.034454346,0.02368164,0.039733887,-0.026382446,0.0033054352,0.028930664,0.028701782,-0.009529114,-0.017501831,0.0020008087,0.033569336,0.025619507,-0.029556274,0.023468018,0.0023975372,0.025115967,-0.02796936,0.0076179504,-0.00086021423,-0.05734253,0.016021729,0.00299263,-0.02218628,-0.0051002502,-0.01676941,0.035186768,-0.04486084,0.014839172,-0.012741089,0.008544922,-0.011856079,-0.0058135986,-0.0055618286,-0.02331543,-0.0031585693,0.026229858,-0.04788208,-0.0018987656,-0.03173828,0.020187378,-0.0129470825,-0.041748047,-0.009414673,-0.0051460266,0.030731201,-0.037231445,-0.034362793,0.058013916,0.06958008,0.04727173,0.010215759,0.031173706,0.023422241,-0.024032593,-0.044036865,-0.020614624,-0.034454346,0.038085938,-0.054534912,-0.010215759,-0.055755615,-0.0018577576,-0.01979065,0.029205322,-0.016494751,0.017913818,0.006160736,-0.015487671,-0.016403198,0.015312195,0.014640808,0.06713867,0.023910522,-0.03265381,0.005748749,-0.043548584,0.05441284,-0.023132324,0.05105591,-0.021469116,0.029830933,0.024276733,-0.04626465,-0.027801514,-0.06903076,0.026992798,0.013191223,0.0027618408,0.012641907,0.0072746277,-0.009712219,0.022232056,-0.057403564,0.037231445,0.005367279,-0.053009033,0.030227661,-0.01739502,-0.009803772,0.016464233,-0.020553589,-0.007801056,0.009864807,0.011703491,0