('mercury', 'Mercury', 'payments', 'Query your Mercury business banking balances, transactions, cards, and statements in natural language via Mercury''s official hosted MCP server.', '/services/mercury.png?tone=dark', '{"name":"Mercury","slug":"mercury","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Mercury\n\nMercury''s hosted MCP server provides read-only access to your business banking data. After connecting, sign in through the browser OAuth prompt (no API key needed).\n\n## What you can ask\n- \"What''s my current balance?\"\n- \"Show my transactions from last month over $1,000.\"\n- \"Graph my last 6 months of spending.\"\n- \"List my cards and recipients.\"\n- \"Download my latest account statement as a PDF.\"\n\n## Notes\n- Access is read-only: the MCP can analyze data but cannot move money.\n- The MCP is in Beta; double-check any figures against your Mercury account before making decisions.\n- OAuth sessions remain active for about 3 days per chat thread.","name":"mercury-usage","description":"How to use Mercury MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Query your Mercury business banking balances, transactions, cards, and statements in natural language via Mercury''s official hosted MCP server.","category":"payments","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.mercury.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"mercury","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Mercury is a business banking platform for startups and companies. Its official hosted MCP server gives AI assistants secure, read-only access to accounts, balances, transactions, statements, cards, recipients, and treasury data. Connection is via browser OAuth with no API key to paste."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.016815186,0.007232666,0.03668213,0.02720642,-0.009567261,-0.014060974,0.00039315224,0.08465576,0.022262573,0.010093689,0.020050049,-0.035980225,-0.007347107,-0.03225708,0.030014038,0.055603027,-0.021636963,0.011894226,-0.031707764,0.04824829,0.047851562,0.06756592,0.0072288513,0.026794434,-0.017654419,0.014