('mermaid', 'Mermaid Chart', 'dev', 'Generate, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams and sync them to your Mermaid Chart account.', '/services/mermaid.svg', '{"name":"Mermaid Chart","slug":"mermaid","inputs":[{"key":"API_KEY","help":"Generate an API token in your Mermaid Chart account settings (API Keys / Tokens) at https://www.mermaidchart.com. Required for Mermaid Chart integration tools; core render/validate tools work without it.","type":"password","label":"Mermaid Chart API Token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"mc_..."}],"skills":[{"body":"# Mermaid Chart\n\nUse the `mermaid_*` tools to work with Mermaid diagrams.\n\n- Write or refine Mermaid diagram code (flowcharts, sequence diagrams, class diagrams, architecture, ER, gantt) and validate its syntax before rendering.\n- Render diagrams to images or interactive playground links.\n- With a valid API token, save and sync diagrams to your Mermaid Chart account projects.\n\nWorkflow: draft the diagram in Mermaid syntax, validate it, then render or save. If validation fails, fix the reported syntax error and retry.\n\nAuth note: the token is sent in the `Authorization` header as the raw token (no `Bearer` prefix). Core validate/render tools work without a token; account integration tools require it.","name":"mermaid-usage","description":"How to generate and render Mermaid diagrams with the mermaid_* tools."}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Generate, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams and sync them to your Mermaid Chart account.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.mermaid.ai/mcp","args":[],"name":"mermaid","headers":{"Authorization":"${input.API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects the official hosted Mermaid Chart MCP server (https://mcp.mermaid.ai/mcp) so the agent can create, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams (flowcharts, sequence, architecture) and integrate with your Mermaid Chart projects."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.0069007874,0.029663086,0.052612305,-0.002