('monid', 'Monid', 'dev', 'Give your agent one connection to 1,300+ tools and APIs, auto-discovered and metered.', '/services/monid.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Monid","slug":"monid","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Monid\n\nMonid routes tool calls to 1,300+ APIs across many providers under one balance.\n\n- Use the discover tool to find candidate endpoints for a task (ranked by fit and cost).\n- Inspect a candidate to see its input schema before calling.\n- Run the chosen endpoint; responses are JSON-typed and normalized across providers.\n- Check runs and wallet balance when you need usage or spend context.\n\nDescribe the task in natural language and let Monid pick the tool rather than hardcoding a provider.","name":"monid-usage","description":"How to use Monid to find and call tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Give your agent one connection to 1,300+ tools and APIs, auto-discovered and metered.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.monid.ai/v1","args":[],"name":"monid","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Monid is an agent-native router for tool calls: describe the task and Monid discovers the right endpoint across 30+ providers, runs it, and meters everything under a single balance. Connects via Monid''s hosted MCP server — you sign in with Monid, no key to paste."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.025238037,-0.0029792786,0.025878906,-0.0131073,0.0018510818,-0.024734497,0.018707275,0.049468994,0.03765869,-0.015586853,0.03881836,-0.046142578,-0.023086548,0.016082764,0.033447266,-0.006942749,-0.031188965,-0.004890442,-0.027267456,0.07019043,0.030883789,0.033447266,0.004673004,0.010391235,0.028396606,0.037322998,-0.053344727,0.029693604,0.025283813,-0.03677368,0.03967285,-0.022003174,-0.039764404,0.035949707,0.024398804,0.033843994,-0.021575928,0.015304565,-0.012924194,0.0287323,-0.03994751,-6.055832e-05,0.0602417,0.028015137,-0.01751709,-0.02760315,-0.04309082,0.014160156,0.0368042,-0.008453369,-0.026992798,0.012611389,-0.0169