('moonbundle', 'Moon Bundles', 'ecommerce', 'Draft Shopify bundles, cart drawer settings, upsell offers and A/B tests with Moon Bundles.', '/services/moonbundle.png', '{"name":"Moon Bundles","slug":"moonbundle","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Moon Bundles\n\nUse the Moon Bundles tools to work on the Shopify store''s average order value.\n\n- Start by reading the catalog and the Moon Bundles analytics before proposing anything.\n- Draft bundles (fixed, tiered, mix-and-match), progressive gifts, cart drawer settings and post-purchase upsell offers, and prepare A/B tests.\n- Everything you create is a draft: nothing goes live on the storefront until the user approves it in the Moon Bundles dashboard. Say so, and tell the user what is waiting for their approval.\n- Back each proposal with the numbers you read (best sellers, attach rates, current AOV).","name":"moonbundle-usage","description":"How to use the Moon Bundles tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Draft Shopify bundles, cart drawer settings, upsell offers and A/B tests with Moon Bundles.","category":"ecommerce","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://app.moonappz.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"moonbundle","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects the hosted Moon Bundles MCP server for your Shopify store. You sign in with your Moon Bundles account; no key to paste. Your agent reads your catalog and analytics and prepares bundles, cart drawer settings, upsells and A/B tests. Nothing goes live until you approve it in the Moon Bundles dashboard."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.005832672,0.008468628,0.012664795,0.015571594,-0.009719849,0.015701294,0.01828003,0.035491943,-0.013847351,-0.00033688545,0.007545471,-0.043426514,-0.01210022,-0.008308411,0.009643555,0.047729492,-0.022125244,0.013961792,-0.01171875,0.060791016,0.03479004,0.038360596,0.025726318,0.05029297,-0.0140686035,0.020721436,-0.026931763,-0.009536743,0.0021457672,-0.029006958,0.026916504,-0.024368286,0.016555786,0.012649536,-0.009918213