('morningstar', 'Morningstar', 'analytics', 'Query Morningstar''s independent investment research, ratings, and datapoints for stocks and funds from your AI assistant.', '/services/morningstar.png', '{"name":"Morningstar","slug":"morningstar","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Morningstar MCP\n\nMorningstar''s remote MCP server provides independent investment research and data. On first connection your MCP client opens a browser window to sign in and authorize via OAuth; a valid Morningstar license is required.\n\n## Tools\n\n- **Datapoint tool** — fetches the latest values for Morningstar datapoints on a stock or fund: market capitalization, Morningstar Rating, fair value estimate and fair value ratio, last closing price, total return, economic moat, EPS, NAV, fund size, sector, domicile, and primary share. Use it for quick factual lookups.\n- **Articles tool** — retrieves editorial answers and research on finance, investing, sustainable investing, strategies, portfolio management, and retirement. It returns opinions, methodologies, and thematic research, not price or metric data.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Identify securities clearly (ticker, exchange, or fund name) when asking for datapoints.\n- Use the Articles tool for \"why/how\" questions and the Datapoint tool for \"what is the current value\" questions.","name":"morningstar-usage","description":"How to use Morningstar tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Query Morningstar''s independent investment research, ratings, and datapoints for stocks and funds from your AI assistant.","category":"analytics","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.morningstar.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"morningstar","oauth":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Morningstar''s official remote MCP server connects assistants to institutional-grade investment data and editorial research. It exposes a Datapoint tool for factual metrics (market cap, ratings, fair value, total return, economic moat, NAV, sector, and more) and an Articles tool for Morningstar''s editorial answers on investing, portfolio management, and retirement. Authentication is browser-based OAuth and requires a Morningstar license."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.036132812,0.026763916,0.012863159,-0.0020065308,-0.0073623657,0.0068244934,0.013671875,0.024368286,0.07269287,0.014884949,0.004699707,-0.04373169,-0.008140564,-0.035827637,0.0126571655,0.028503418,-0.04156494,-0.0039367676,-0.029037476,0.06762695,0.027893066,0.049987793,-0.015556335,0.022888184,-0.00038719177,0.020126343,-0.043762207,-0.0039100647,0.029693604,-0.032714844,0.031097412,-0.025924683,-0.033996582,0.028656006,0.0022525787,0.02784729,-0.038330078,0.019638062,0.017929077,-0.0039138794,-0.017791748,0.047424316,0.024673462,0.010658264,-0.012619019,-0.055358887,0.004875183,-0.043762207,0.029846191,0.018798828,-0.054779053,-0.0056266785,-0.008277893,0.017105103,-0.0008716583,0.044769287,-0.00843811,0.030776978,0.0067977905,-0.006149292,-0.011856079,-0.025299072,-0.016143799,0.022613525,-0.049102783,-0.046661377,-0.0066108704,0.0262146,-0.008033752,0.0021533966,-0.021835327,-1.4901161e-06,0.021316528,-0.0059280396,-0.03326416,-0.027893066,-0.019134521,0.028533936,-0.0050201416,0.02381897,0.009162903,0.010131836,-0.04949951,-0.009422302,-0.020523071,0.021392822,-0.03387451,-0.0058784485,-0.0491333,0.0006251335,-0.033599854,0.00982666,0.012763977,-0.0011119843,0.06112671,0.025024414,-0.022781372,0.019470215,-0.024719238,0.052825928,-0.027770996,-0.034698486,-0.019302368,0.008285522,0.002702713,-0.018081665,0.05218506,-0.0131073,0.009407043,0.021484375,-0.12182617,-0.022338867,-0.03982544,0.029830933,0.013458252,0.008262634,0.0071640015,0.036712646,-0.012130737,-0.04244995,-0.052856445,0.0011386871,0.047332764,-0.0011892319,0.0135269165,0.014427185,-0.042236328,-0.0067749023,-0.021453857,-0.048797607,0.009117126,-0.009284973,0.06854248,-0.016677856,0.0046844482,-0.013763428,-0.00033926964,-0.0284729,-0.025970459,-0.013618469,0.0071868896,-0.018936157,0.004146576,0.016952515,-0.03048706,-