('motion', 'Motion', 'productivity', 'Generate finished motion-design videos from a prompt.', '/services/motion.png', '{"name":"Motion","slug":"motion","skills":[{"body":"# Motion\n\nMotion renders motion-design videos from a written brief. Video generation is asynchronous.\n\n## Generating a video\n\n1. Call `create_video` with the brief. Describe the story, not just the subject: what happens on screen, the tone, the audience. Set aspect ratio and duration when the destination is known (9:16 for social, 16:9 for a landing page or a demo).\n2. `create_video` returns a session, not a file. Poll `get_session_status` until the job completes, then read `output.download_url`.\n3. To refine an existing video, use `create_followup` on its session rather than regenerating from scratch: it keeps the established design.\n4. Attach a local file (logo, footage, screenshot) with `upload_asset` first, then reference the returned URL in the brief.\n\n## Credits\n\nRendering consumes credits. Read the balance with `get_credit_balance` before launching a batch. `show_plans_and_credits`, `purchase_credits`, `subscribe_to_plan` and `set_auto_topup` handle billing — never buy credits or change a plan without the user asking for it explicitly.\n\n## Account\n\n`whoami` and `get_settings` report the connected account. `list_api_keys` / `create_api_key` / `revoke_api_key` manage credentials — do not create or revoke keys on your own initiative.","name":"motion-usage","description":"How to generate videos with Motion"}],"summary":"Generate finished motion-design videos from a prompt.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Motion","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.motion.so/mcp","args":[],"name":"motion","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"Motion API key","inputs":[{"key":"MOTION_API_KEY","help":"Create it in Motion → Settings → API keys. It is shown only once.","type":"password","label":"Motion API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"motion_…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.motion.so/mcp","args":[],"name":"motion","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.MOTION_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Motion (by Mosaic AI Labs) turns a written brief into a finished motion-graphics video: storyboard, design, animation, voiceover and music. Jobs run asynchronously; the agent creates a session, polls it, then reads the download URL. Rendering consumes Motion credits."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.029815674,0.049438477,-0.028533936,-0.022781372,-0.025939941,-0.030426025,0.028961182,0.048583984,0.047424316,-0.025619507,0.046447754,-0.0034618378,-0.040893555,-0.036743164,-0.0085372925,0.013999939,-0.041748047,-0.032073975,-0.0031414032,-0.0011320114,0.029937744,0.028182983,-0.040618896,0.031982422,0.015731812,0.011810303,-0.09313965,0.011024475,0.028259277,-0.008613586,-0.007888794,-0.03540039,0.017196655,-0.042419434,0.009880066,-0.021820068,-0.029830933,0.012016296,0.009994507,-0.03753662,-0.034179688,-0.0054397583,0.021148682,0.017242432,-0.0050811768,0.022979736,0.0046844482,0.006477356,0.0017547607,0.04269409,-0.015037537,0.030563354,0.014968872,0.038024902,-0.012107849,0.0018482208,0.01586914,-0.02583313,-0.031555176,-0.017227173,0.006629944,-0.033081055,0.032836914,0.011268616,0.007484436,-0.001367569,-0.055999756,0.032440186,-0.0029830933,-0.035888672,0.027542114,-0.0011234283,0.017318726,-0.016174316,-0.022598267,-0.015464783,-0.00049495697,-0.0059928894,0.024383545,-0.009429932,0.009750366,-0.024291992,-0.0051078796,-0.015106201,-0.06781006,-0.013793945,0.020645142,-0.029296875,-0.06939697,-0.023880005,-0.007820129,0.03225708,-0.035308838,0.047973633,0.038024902,0.0340271,0.009613037,0.04437256,0.013259888,0.06817627,0.009971619,-0.06222534,-0.052520752,0.001991272,0.023010254,-0.00096559525,-0.0068969727,0.0017309189,-0.01770