('notch', 'Notch', 'marketing', 'Brief an AI growth marketer that creates and launches Meta and TikTok video ads.', '/services/notch.png?tone=dark', '{"name":"Notch","slug":"notch","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Notch\n\nNotch is an AI growth marketer for Meta (Facebook/Instagram) and TikTok ads. Use the Notch tools to turn a short brief into a finished ad: script, avatar, scenes, voiceover, captions and final render.\n\n## Flow\n\n1. Start from a one-line brief: the product, the audience and the angle. Notch pulls the brand context from the connected Notch account, so do not restate what the brand already knows about itself.\n2. Ask Notch for concepts first, then render only the concept the user picked.\n3. Rendering is asynchronous. Poll for the result instead of assuming the ad is ready, and hand back the returned URL.\n4. Launching to Meta or TikTok touches live ad spend. Always confirm the campaign, budget and audience with the user before launching, never launch on your own initiative.\n\n## Credits\n\nEvery ad generated over MCP spends the same monthly credits as one created in the Notch app, and the plan is paid. Never batch-generate variations to explore: produce one ad, show it, and iterate only on request.\n","name":"notch-usage","description":"How to brief Notch and produce ads without burning the account credits"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Brief an AI growth marketer that creates and launches Meta and TikTok video ads.","category":"marketing","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://app.usenotch.ai/mcp","args":[],"name":"notch","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Notch is an agentic ad platform: from a one-line brief it writes the script, generates the avatar, scenes, voiceover and captions, and renders the finished ad. It can also launch approved ads to Meta and TikTok through the official Ads APIs. Connects to Notch''s hosted MCP server; you sign in with your Notch account, there is no key to paste."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.0