('okx', 'OKX', 'other', 'Trade and manage your OKX crypto exchange account (spot, swap, futures, options, earn, and bots) directly from an AI agent.', '/services/okx.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"OKX","slug":"okx","inputs":[{"key":"OKX_API_KEY","help":"OKX web app > profile menu > API > ''Create V5 API key''. Copy the API key shown after creation. See https://www.okx.com/account/my-api","type":"password","label":"OKX API Key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx"},{"key":"OKX_SECRET_KEY","help":"Shown once immediately after you create the API key at https://www.okx.com/account/my-api (same screen as the API key). It is not retrievable later, so save it when creating the key.","type":"password","label":"OKX Secret Key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"Secret key"},{"key":"OKX_PASSPHRASE","help":"The passphrase you set yourself while creating the API key at https://www.okx.com/account/my-api (this is the API passphrase, not your login password).","type":"password","label":"OKX API Passphrase","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"Passphrase"}],"skills":[{"body":"# OKX Agent Trade Kit\n\nOfficial OKX MCP server (`@okx_ai/okx-trade-mcp`) connecting agents to the OKX crypto exchange. It runs locally over stdio; credentials are read from the `OKX_API_KEY`, `OKX_SECRET_KEY`, and `OKX_PASSPHRASE` environment variables and never leave the machine.\n\n## Modules and tools\n- `market`: tickers, order books, candles, funding/mark price, open interest, 70+ technical indicators (no auth required).\n- `spot`, `swap`, `futures`, `option`: place / cancel / amend orders, batch orders, positions, leverage, algo orders (conditional, OCO TP/SL, trailing stop).\n- `account`: balances, bills, positions, fee rates, config, max withdrawal / avail size.\n- `earn`, `bot`, `event`, `news`, `smartmoney`: savings/staking, grid & DCA bots, event contracts, crypto news, smart-money analytics.\n\nTool names use underscores (e.g. `swap_place_order`, `market_ticker`, `account_balance`).\n\n## Auth\n- Market tools work with no credentials.\n- All other modules need Read permission; write/trading operations additionally need Trade permission on the OKX API key. All three of API key, secret key, and passphrase must be set together.\n\n## Safety\n- These tools execute against a live account by default and can move real funds. Prefer OKX demo (paper-trading) API keys while testing.\n- Add `--read-only` to the server args to expose query tools only and block any order placement.\n- Confirm instrument id, side, size, and order type with the user before placing or cancelling orders.","name":"okx-usage","description":"How to use the OKX Agent Trade Kit MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Trade and manage your OKX crypto exchange account (spot, swap, futures, options, earn, and bots) directly from an AI agent.","category":"other","mcpServers":[{"env":{"OKX_API_KEY":"${input.OKX_API_KEY}","OKX_PASSPHRASE":"${input.OKX_PASSPHRASE}","OKX_SECRET_KEY":"${input.OKX_SECRET_KEY}"},"args":["-y","@okx_ai/okx-trade-mcp","--modules","all"],"name":"okx","command":"npx","headers":{},"transport":"stdio"}],"description":"OKX Agent Trade Kit is the official Model Context Protocol server for the OKX exchange, exposing 160+ tools across market data, spot/swap/futures/options trading, algo orders, account management, earn, and trading bots. It runs locally as a stdio process, and your API credentials never leave your machine. Market-data tools work without auth; trading and account tools require your OKX API key."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.029647827,0.03213501,0.00032687187,0.0038928986,0.013290405,-0.016052246,0.011360168,0.05130005,0.03744507,-0.0051612854,0.046936035,-0.066711426,-0.0026397705,0.010688782,0.025970459,0.016571045,-0.03491211,0.015609741,-0.055541992,0.020812988,-0.006111145,-0.012863159,0.009483337,0.02734375,-0.015037537,-0.017807007,-0.039398193,-0.0085372925,0.011543274,-0.00012993813,0.016815186,-0.0271759