('onedrive', 'OneDrive', 'productivity', 'Search, read, upload and share files in OneDrive.', '/services/onedrive.png', '{"name":"OneDrive","slug":"onedrive","skills":[{"body":"# OneDrive\n\nONE_DRIVE_SEARCH_ITEMS is the main entry point: it matches file names, metadata and content and returns item ids. Browse with ONE_DRIVE_GET_ROOT and ONE_DRIVE_LIST_FOLDER_CHILDREN, or jump to a known path with ONE_DRIVE_GET_ITEM_BY_PATH. ONE_DRIVE_GET_ITEM confirms the type, size and parent of an id before you act on it. A link pasted by the user resolves with ONE_DRIVE_GET_DRIVE_ITEM_BY_SHARING_URL, and ONE_DRIVE_LIST_ONEDRIVE_SHARED_ITEMS lists what colleagues shared with the account.\n\nRead raw bytes with ONE_DRIVE_DOWNLOAD_FILE. To read a Word, PowerPoint or Excel file as text, convert it first with ONE_DRIVE_DOWNLOAD_ITEM_AS_FORMAT (`pdf` or `html`). ONE_DRIVE_GET_DOCUMENT_COMMENTS pulls the review comments out of a .docx. For cell-level work on a workbook, use the Excel service instead.\n\nCreate with ONE_DRIVE_ONEDRIVE_CREATE_FOLDER, ONE_DRIVE_ONEDRIVE_CREATE_TEXT_FILE and ONE_DRIVE_ONEDRIVE_UPLOAD_FILE. ONE_DRIVE_UPDATE_FILE_CONTENT overwrites a file (ONE_DRIVE_GET_ITEM_VERSIONS keeps the previous ones), ONE_DRIVE_UPDATE_DRIVE_ITEM_METADATA renames, ONE_DRIVE_MOVE_ITEM and ONE_DRIVE_COPY_ITEM reorganize. ONE_DRIVE_DELETE_ITEM sends the item to the recycle bin and ONE_DRIVE_RESTORE_DRIVE_ITEM brings it back; there is no permanent delete on purpose. Confirm the target with the user before overwriting or deleting.\n\nSharing: ONE_DRIVE_CREATE_LINK makes a view or edit link, ONE_DRIVE_INVITE_USER_TO_ITEM shares with named people, ONE_DRIVE_GET_ITEM_PERMISSIONS and ONE_DRIVE_DELETE_ITEM_PERMISSION audit and revoke. Never create an `anonymous` link unless the user asked for a public one.","name":"onedrive-usage","description":"How to use OneDrive tools"}],"summary":"Search, read, upload and share files in OneDrive.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","k