('outlook', 'Outlook', 'productivity', 'Read, search, send and organize email, calendar and contacts in Outlook.', '/services/outlook.png', '{"name":"Outlook","slug":"outlook","skills":[{"body":"# Outlook\n\nSearch the mailbox with OUTLOOK_SEARCH_MESSAGES, which takes KQL (`from:alice subject:invoice received>=2026-08-01`), or OUTLOOK_QUERY_EMAILS for OData filters inside a single folder. OUTLOOK_LIST_MESSAGES browses one folder, OUTLOOK_LIST_SENT_ITEMS_MESSAGES the sent mail, and OUTLOOK_GET_MESSAGE opens one message in full.\n\nSend with OUTLOOK_SEND_EMAIL, answer inside a conversation with OUTLOOK_REPLY_EMAIL (never invent a new subject, the thread carries it), and pass a message along with OUTLOOK_FORWARD_MESSAGE. When the user should review before anything leaves, write a draft with OUTLOOK_CREATE_DRAFT or OUTLOOK_CREATE_DRAFT_REPLY and send it with OUTLOOK_SEND_DRAFT. Always confirm recipients before sending.\n\nMark read, flag or recategorize with OUTLOOK_UPDATE_EMAIL, or up to 20 messages at once with OUTLOOK_BATCH_UPDATE_MESSAGES. File mail with OUTLOOK_MOVE_MESSAGE and OUTLOOK_BATCH_MOVE_MESSAGES into a folder listed by OUTLOOK_LIST_MAIL_FOLDERS or created with OUTLOOK_CREATE_MAIL_FOLDER. There is no delete tool on purpose: move the message to the `deleteditems` folder, which stays recoverable. Attachments come from OUTLOOK_LIST_OUTLOOK_ATTACHMENTS and OUTLOOK_DOWNLOAD_OUTLOOK_ATTACHMENT, and OUTLOOK_ADD_MAIL_ATTACHMENT attaches a file to a draft.\n\nFor the calendar, OUTLOOK_GET_CALENDAR_VIEW answers \"what is on my plate this week\" because it includes events that span the window, while OUTLOOK_LIST_EVENTS, OUTLOOK_SEARCH_EVENTS and OUTLOOK_GET_EVENT handle lookups and OUTLOOK_LIST_EVENT_INSTANCES expands a recurring series. Check availability with OUTLOOK_FIND_MEETING_TIMES or OUTLOOK_GET_SCHEDULE before booking with OUTLOOK_CALENDAR_CREATE_EVENT, then adjust with OUTLOOK_UPDATE_CALENDAR_EVENT. OUTLOOK_CANCEL_EVENT notifies the attendees, OUTLOOK_DELETE_CALENDAR_EVENT removes it silently. Reply to invites with OUTLOOK_ACCEPT_EVENT or OUTLOOK_DECLINE_EVENT.\n\nContacts live behind OUTLOOK_LIST_USER_CONTACTS, OUTLOOK_CREATE_CONTACT and OUTLOOK_UPDATE_CONTACT, and OUTLOOK_GET_PROFILE returns the signed-in account.\n\nMicrosoft To Do is not available on this connection: the granted scopes cover mail, calendar and contacts only.","name":"outlook-usage","description":"How to use Outlook tools"}],"summary":"Read, search, send and organize email, calendar and contacts in Outlook.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Microsoft","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"outlook","allowedTools":["OUTLOOK_LIST_MESSAGES","OUTLOOK_SEARCH_MESSAGES","OUTLOOK_QUERY_EMAILS","OUTLOOK_GET_MESSAGE","OUTLOOK_LIST_SENT_ITEMS_MESSAGES","OUTLOOK_SEND_EMAIL","OUTLOOK_REPLY_EMAIL","OUTLOOK_FORWARD_MESSAGE","OUTLOOK_CREATE_DRAFT","OUTLOOK_CREATE_DRAFT_REPLY","OUTLOOK_SEND_DRAFT","OUTLOOK_UPDATE_EMAIL","OUTLOOK_BATCH_UPDATE_MESSAGES","OUTLOOK_LIST_MAIL_FOLDERS","OUTLOOK_CREATE_MAIL_FOLDER","OUTLOOK_MOVE_MESSAGE","OUTLOOK_BATCH_MOVE_MESSAGES","OUTLOOK_LIST_OUTLOOK_ATTACHMENTS","OUTLOOK_DOWNLOAD_OUTLOOK_ATTACHMENT","OUTLOOK_ADD_MAIL_ATTACHMENT","OUTLOOK_LIST_CALENDARS","OUTLOOK_LIST_EVENTS","OUTLOOK_GET_CALENDAR_VIEW","OUTLOOK_SEARCH_EVENTS","OUTLOOK_GET_EVENT","OUTLOOK_LIST_EVENT_INSTANCES","OUTLOOK_CALENDAR_CREATE_EVENT","OUTLOOK_UPDATE_CALENDAR_EVENT","OUTLOOK_DELETE_CALENDAR_EVENT","OUTLOOK_CANCEL_EVENT","OUTLOOK_ACCEPT_EVENT","OUTLOOK_DECLINE_EVENT","OUTLOOK_FIND_MEETING_TIMES","OUTLOOK_GET_SCHEDULE","OUTLOOK_LIST_USER_CONTACTS","OUTLOOK_CREATE_CONTACT","OUTLOOK_UPDATE_CONTACT","OUTLOOK_GET_PROFILE"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/outlook","args":[],"name":"outlook","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"Outlook in o