('outreach', 'Outreach', 'crm', 'Connect to the Outreach sales engagement platform to access accounts, prospects, and outreach activity through its official MCP server.', '/services/outreach.png', '{"name":"Outreach","slug":"outreach","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Outreach MCP\n\nThe Outreach MCP server exposes read/insight tools over the Outreach sales engagement platform. Use it to look up accounts, prospects, sequences, and outreach activity, and to prepare communications informed by pipeline context.\n\n## Auth\n\nAuthentication is standard OAuth 2.0 (Authorization Code with dynamic discovery). On first use you will be redirected to sign in to your Outreach account and grant access. You must have an active, licensed Outreach seat with the Amplify add-on package enabled.\n\n## Typical usage\n\n- Retrieve account and prospect context to understand pipeline activity.\n- Pull recent outreach activity to prepare or improve communications.\n- Ground sales workflows in live Outreach data instead of stale exports.\n\nServer URL: https://api.outreach.io/mcp/","name":"outreach-usage","description":"How to use the Outreach MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Connect to the Outreach sales engagement platform to access accounts, prospects, and outreach activity through its official MCP server.","category":"crm","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.outreach.io/mcp/","args":[],"name":"outreach","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Outreach is a sales execution and engagement platform. Its official MCP server gives AI agents account, prospect, and outreach context for understanding pipeline activity, preparing communications, and improving sales execution. Access requires an active licensed Outreach seat with the Amplify add-on enabled."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.0008635521,-0.006576538,0.057006836,0.04486084,-0.02027893,-0.002500534,0.004425049,0.03353882,0.0023727417,0.010017395,0.072143555,-0.04449463,0.004180908,0.005947113,0.010719299,0.0