('pandadoc', 'PandaDoc', 'productivity', 'Create, send, and track documents, proposals, and e-signatures through PandaDoc''s official hosted MCP server.', '/services/pandadoc.png?tone=light', '{"name":"PandaDoc","slug":"pandadoc","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# PandaDoc\n\nThe PandaDoc MCP server connects AI assistants to your PandaDoc account for document automation.\n\n## Connecting\n\nOn first use you will be sent to PandaDoc in the browser to sign in and authorize access (OAuth). No API key is required.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- Browse and use document templates, including their fields, roles, and field mappings.\n- Create documents from templates and prefill fields.\n- Send documents for signature and check real-time document status.\n- Track document and recipient state through PandaDoc''s document workflows.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Reference a template by name or id when creating a document.\n- Verify recipient roles and required fields before sending, since missing required fields can block sending.","name":"pandadoc-usage","description":"How to use the PandaDoc MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Create, send, and track documents, proposals, and e-signatures through PandaDoc''s official hosted MCP server.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.pandadoc.com/v1/mcp","args":[],"name":"pandadoc","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"PandaDoc is a document automation platform for proposals, contracts, and e-signatures. Its official hosted MCP server lets AI assistants work with document templates, field mappings, roles, and real-time document state, and drive PandaDoc''s document workflows. Connection is authorized in the browser via OAuth, so no API key needs to be pasted."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.014045715,0.0056152344,0.038360596,0.022521973,-0.01398468,-0.027618408,0.007888794,0.094055176,0.0066337585,-0.029541016,0.017089844,-0.015914917,-0.01096344,-0.024719238,-0.00016438961,0.05783081,-0.026519775,-0.049