('paypal', 'PayPal', 'payments', 'Manage PayPal payments, invoices, orders, subscriptions, and transactions through PayPal''s official remote MCP server.', '/services/paypal.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"PayPal","slug":"paypal","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# PayPal MCP\n\nPayPal''s official remote MCP server for agentic commerce. Authenticate via the browser OAuth flow (sign in to your PayPal account and authorize the client). No API key is pasted.\n\n## Common tasks\n- Create and capture orders/checkouts\n- Create, send, and list invoices\n- Manage subscriptions and billing plans\n- Process refunds and inspect transactions/disputes\n\n## Notes\n- Production endpoint: https://mcp.paypal.com/mcp\n- The account you authorize determines which merchant data the tools can access.\n","name":"paypal-usage","description":"How to use PayPal MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Manage PayPal payments, invoices, orders, subscriptions, and transactions through PayPal''s official remote MCP server.","category":"payments","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.paypal.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"paypal","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"PayPal''s official hosted MCP server exposes agentic commerce tools for creating and capturing orders, issuing invoices, managing subscriptions, processing refunds, and querying transactions. Connect once through PayPal''s browser sign-in and authorize the client. No API key needs to be pasted."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.013580322,-0.0039520264,0.01727295,0.0068130493,-0.023284912,-0.010604858,-0.0026454926,0.04043579,0.010887146,-0.008583069,0.03829956,-0.031066895,0.0074653625,-0.0021400452,0.014579773,0.031311035,-0.01626587,0.020080566,-0.022354126,0.033355713,0.02911377,0.046173096,-0.0134887695,-0.014595032,-0.035064697,-0.03665161,-0.06506348,-0.0040016174,-0.0099105835,0.004776001,0.057769775,-0.0115737915,-0.056671143,0.028884888,-0.003063202,0.0057792664,-0.02255249,0.08581543,0.018539429,0.006023407,-0.0407409