('perplexity', 'Perplexity', 'productivity', 'Real-time web search, reasoning, and deep research powered by Perplexity''s Sonar models via the official MCP server.', '/services/perplexity.svg', '{"name":"Perplexity","slug":"perplexity","inputs":[{"key":"PERPLEXITY_API_KEY","help":"Generate an API key in the Perplexity API Portal at https://console.perplexity.ai (Settings > API).","type":"password","label":"Perplexity API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"pplx-..."}],"skills":[{"body":"# Perplexity\n\nThe Perplexity MCP server provides live web search and research through Sonar models.\n\n## Tools\n- `perplexity_search`: direct web search returning ranked results with metadata.\n- `perplexity_ask`: conversational answer with real-time web search (sonar-pro).\n- `perplexity_research`: deep, comprehensive research with citations (sonar-deep-research).\n- `perplexity_reason`: step-by-step reasoning over retrieved context.\n\n## Tips\n- Prefer `perplexity_search` for quick lookups and `perplexity_research` for thorough, cited investigations.\n- Ask focused questions; include constraints (dates, sources) to sharpen results.\n","name":"perplexity-usage","description":"How to use Perplexity MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Real-time web search, reasoning, and deep research powered by Perplexity''s Sonar models via the official MCP server.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{"PERPLEXITY_API_KEY":"${input.PERPLEXITY_API_KEY}"},"args":["-y","@perplexity-ai/mcp-server"],"name":"perplexity","command":"npx","headers":{},"transport":"stdio"}],"description":"Perplexity is an AI answer engine that performs live web search and cited research. This connector runs Perplexity''s official MCP server locally over stdio, exposing search, ask, research, and reasoning tools backed by the Sonar models. It authenticates with a single Perplexity API key."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.0013818741,-0.004650116,0.025390625,0.03289795,0.005168915,-0.018707275,0.0132904