('pika', 'Pika', 'productivity', 'Generate and edit video, image, music and voice with Pika.', '/services/pika.png?tone=dark', '{"name":"Pika","slug":"pika","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Pika\n\nUse the Pika tools to generate and edit media: video (text-to-video, image-to-video, extend, lip-sync), image (text-to-image, edit, upscale, inpaint, background removal), audio (music, text-to-speech, voice cloning, transcription) and finishing (captions, trim, stitch, transitions).\n\nGeneration is asynchronous and billed to the connected Pika account: state the model and duration you intend to use before launching a render, and reuse an existing asset instead of regenerating it when the prompt has not changed.","name":"pika-usage","description":"How to use Pika tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Generate and edit video, image, music and voice with Pika.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://experiment-mcp.pika.art/api/mcp","args":[],"name":"pika","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects Pika''s hosted MCP server. You sign in with your Pika account, no key to paste. Gives the agent text-to-video, image-to-video, image editing, music, text-to-speech and finishing tools (captions, trim, stitch). Generations are billed to your Pika account."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.025924683,0.012817383,0.010002136,-0.028640747,-0.008331299,-0.02949524,0.035949707,0.082092285,0.0032043457,-0.060516357,0.037628174,-0.00074243546,-0.042419434,-0.048583984,0.004825592,0.0073432922,-0.06591797,-0.04458618,-0.01939392,0.04623413,-0.010375977,0.008972168,-0.0138549805,0.033966064,0.024642944,0.038909912,-0.05758667,0.01826477,0.009391785,-0.030792236,-0.010353088,-0.02154541,-0.033416748,-0.04135132,0.015380859,-0.007572174,-0.035095215,-0.0066490173,-0.0069122314,0.021957397,-0.043060303,-0.033996582,-0.0053482056,0.0006713867,0.0012226105,0.032592773,-0.029022217,-0.009353638,0.007671356,0.034942627,-0.022354126,0.061645508,-0.0044288635,