('posthog', 'PostHog', 'analytics', 'Query product analytics, feature flags, insights and errors from PostHog.', '/services/posthog.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"PostHog","slug":"posthog","skills":[{"body":"# PostHog\n\nUse the PostHog tools to explore product analytics. You can list and read insights, dashboards, feature flags and experiments, inspect error tracking, and run HogQL/SQL queries to answer questions about events and users. Always confirm which project you are querying before drawing conclusions, and prefer existing insights over ad-hoc queries when one already answers the question.\n\nWhen calling the PostHog REST API directly (from shell or HTTP, outside the MCP tools), always use the host in the environment variable $LUMVIKA_SVC_POSTHOG_HOST, e.g. https://$LUMVIKA_SVC_POSTHOG_HOST/api/projects/<project_id>/query. Never hardcode us.posthog.com or eu.posthog.com.","name":"posthog-usage","description":"How to use PostHog tools"}],"summary":"Query product analytics, feature flags, insights and errors from PostHog.","category":"analytics","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with PostHog","inputs":[{"key":"region","help":"The PostHog cloud your project lives on, shown in your app URL (eu.posthog.com or us.posthog.com).","type":"select","label":"Data region","secret":false,"options":[{"label":"Europe (EU)","value":"eu.posthog.com"},{"label":"United States (US)","value":"us.posthog.com"}],"required":true}],"envKeys":[{"key":"LUMVIKA_SVC_POSTHOG_HOST","fromInput":"region"}],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.posthog.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"posthog","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"Personal API key","inputs":[{"key":"region","help":"The PostHog cloud your project lives on, shown in your app URL (eu.posthog.com or us.posthog.com).","type":"select","label":"Data region","secret":false,"options":[{"label":"Europe (EU)","value":"eu.posthog.com"},{"label":"United States (US)","value":"us.posthog.com"}],"required":true},{"key":"POSTHOG_PERSONAL_API_KEY","help":"Create one in PostHog → avatar (bottom left) → Settings → Personal API keys → Create personal API key (use the MCP Server preset). Copy it immediately, it is shown only once.","type":"password","label":"PostHog personal API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"phx_…"}],"envKeys":[{"key":"LUMVIKA_SVC_POSTHOG_HOST","fromInput":"region"}],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.posthog.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"posthog","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.POSTHOG_PERSONAL_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}]}],"description":"Connects PostHog''s hosted MCP server. Sign in with your PostHog account (browser OAuth) or paste a personal API key. Lets the agent explore insights, dashboards, feature flags, experiments and error tracking, and run HogQL queries across your project.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, true, '[-0.046142578,-0.006542206,0.016571045,0.018035889,-0.023803711,-0.06829834,-0.04220581,0.027893066,0.0262146,-0.0068244934,0.027755737,-0.006713867,-0.046813965,0.001077652,-0.026855469,0.016494751,-0.043182373,-0.00667572,-0.04095459,0.05581665,0.03086853,-0.002840042,-0.0385437,0.023391724,-0.009216309,0.038391113,-0.04159546,0.010887146,0.029418945,-0.023910522,0.008216858,-0.047607422,-0.012962341,0.034698486,0.033447266,0.010040283,-0.034851074,0.019714355,0.030181885,0.05154419,-0.019683838,-0.011695862,-0.008758545,0.027786255,-0.00970459,0.025436401,-0.014968872,-0.058776855,0.019714355,0.016525269,-0.00831604,-0.019424438,-0.0071525574,0.055145264,0.014122009,0.023849487,0.029281616,0.03982544,-0.003850937,-0.0072898865,-0.015014648,-0.04815674,0.029205322,0.0021648407,-0.008171082,0.007320404,-0.03778076,0.0149002075,-0.045440674,-0.017700195,0.020935059,0.004589081,-0.023651123,0.009933472,-0.0019950867,-0.012466431,-0.046325684,0.068481445,-0.015960693,-0.034606934,-0.02909851,0.011253357,-0.03010559,-0.03967285,0.008621216,-0.0