('prospeo', 'Prospeo', 'crm', 'Find and enrich B2B contacts: verified work emails, mobile numbers and company data.', '/services/prospeo.png', '{"name":"Prospeo","slug":"prospeo","skills":[{"body":"# Prospeo\n\nB2B contact data. Tools:\n- `search_person` / `search_company`: find prospects with filters (job title, seniority, location, headcount, industry, tech stack, revenue). 1 credit per page.\n- `search_suggestions`: resolve a filter value (e.g. an industry or location label) before searching. Free, use it instead of guessing filter values.\n- `enrich_person`: get a verified work email and mobile from a name + company, a LinkedIn URL, or an email.\n- `enrich_company`: full company profile (headcount, industry, revenue, tech stack, funding, socials).\n- `bulk_enrich_person` / `bulk_enrich_company`: up to 25 records per call, always prefer these over looping single enrichments.\n- `get_account_info`: remaining credits and plan. Free.\n\nCalls consume credits, so check `get_account_info` before a large batch and never re-enrich a contact you already resolved.","name":"prospeo-usage","description":"How to use Prospeo tools"}],"summary":"Find and enrich B2B contacts: verified work emails, mobile numbers and company data.","category":"crm","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Prospeo","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.prospeo.io","args":[],"name":"prospeo","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"API key","inputs":[{"key":"PROSPEO_API_KEY","help":"Find it in your Prospeo dashboard, under API.","type":"password","label":"Prospeo API key","secret":true,"required":true}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.prospeo.io","args":[],"name":"prospeo","headers":{"X-KEY":"${input.PROSPEO_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects Prospeo''s hosted MCP server. Search 200M+ professionals and companies with filters, enrich people from a name, LinkedIn URL or email, and pull full company profiles. Sign in with Prospeo, or paste an API key."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.002576828,-0.02017212,0.04925537,0.010620117,-0.014724731,-0.030670166,-0.060302734,0.05307007,0.0124435425,-0.0011768341,0.01687622,-0.047576904,0.004627228,-0.011856079,0.006866455,0.05770874,-0.017791748,-0.0017375946,-0.024627686,0.016525269,0.052825928,0.031707764,0.01828003,0.019134521,-0.004333496,0.027923584,-0.06298828,0.023620605,0.0385437,-0.0259552,0.022460938,-0.021942139,-0.03491211,0.03491211,-0.0052108765,-0.019500732,-0.027557373,0.038391113,0.0029640198,0.007221222,0.018737793,0.007286072,0.028564453,0.01939392,-0.002521515,-0.03189087,-0.06591797,-0.013511658,0.09088135,0.017852783,0.005710602,-0.0053977966,-0.0016803741,0.04321289,-0.04257202,-0.02519226,0.018173218,-0.019622803,-0.03010559,0.06341553,-0.011116028,-0.03717041,-0.00078868866,-0.0021324158,-0.026824951,0.03012085,0.00019443035,0.02407837,0.021270752,0.015960693,-0.012290955,0.016220093,0.021575928,0.018157959,-0.01687622,-0.03704834,0.030548096,0.06274414,-0.030883789,-0.06573486,0.0020198822,-0.026901245,-0.018447876,-0.0058670044,-0.047180176,-0.04498291,0.0042495728,0.012901306,-0.045288086,0.023651123,-0.022140503,-0.035827637,0.040527344,0.013473511,0.100097656,0.002910614,-0.016937256,-0.046966553,0.028762817,0.07434082,-0.009361267,0.0027713776,-0.035583496,-0.038848877,0.0040016174,0.023284912,0.059631348,-0.05645752,0.013877869,0.014419556,-0.08166504,0.0034828186,-0.012184143,0.021530151,0.02897644,0.0051345825,-0.0032291412,-0.02961731,-0.015686035,-0.024810791,-0.019088745,0.02267456,0.0146102905,0.006793976,0.024795532,0.021850586,-0.037902832,-0.036621094,0.011550903,-0.058776855,-0.016326904,-0.04083252,0.07702637,0.017425537,-0.050842285,0.005680084,-0.042755127,0.0012512207,0.021011353,-0.011390686,0.007408142,-0.05053711,0.0018873215,0.0016756058,-0.08270264,-0.04385376,-0.050964355,-0.014907837,-0.0110