('pushrank', 'PushRank', 'seo', 'Track Google and AI search visibility, find SEO opportunities and generate articles with PushRank.', '/services/pushrank.png', '{"name":"PushRank","slug":"pushrank","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# PushRank\n\nPushRank tracks a site''s rankings on Google and its visibility in AI answers (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Gemini), built on the user''s Search Console data.\n\n- Start by listing the user''s projects and pick the right site before any other call.\n- Use the read tools to answer questions like which pages lost positions, which keywords dropped, and which actions PushRank recommends.\n- Article generation, keyword edits and publishing change the user''s live site: confirm with the user before publishing or writing anything.\n- Quote concrete numbers (position, clicks, impressions, date range) when reporting results.","name":"pushrank-usage","description":"How to use PushRank tools for SEO and AI visibility"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Track Google and AI search visibility, find SEO opportunities and generate articles with PushRank.","category":"seo","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://ai.pushrank.io/mcp","args":[],"name":"pushrank","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects PushRank''s hosted MCP server so your agent can read rankings, Search Console data and recommended actions, and draft or publish SEO articles. You sign in with PushRank; no key to paste."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.0058898926,0.03579712,0.007827759,-0.012702942,0.025878906,-0.024307251,-0.011169434,0.02998352,-0.008659363,-0.031951904,0.034484863,0.001458168,-0.038269043,-0.025527954,0.014572144,-0.0345459,-0.053771973,-0.026138306,-0.02456665,0.041229248,-0.0030174255,-0.0013113022,0.030731201,0.04324341,-0.018203735,0.0045318604,-0.018478394,0.0030460358,0.029724121,0.012771606,0.015327454,-0.024658203,-0.019226074,0.03314209,0.013931274,-0.0049552917,-0.035949707,0.001411438,0.02218628,0.033325195,0.017868042,0.05267334,0.03015