('razorpay', 'Razorpay', 'payments', 'Manage Razorpay payments, orders, refunds, and payment links through Razorpay''s official hosted MCP server.', '/services/razorpay.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Razorpay","slug":"razorpay","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Razorpay\n\nRazorpay''s official remote MCP server provides tools to work with payments, orders, refunds, settlements, and payment links on your Razorpay account.\n\n## Connecting\n\nAuthentication uses OAuth 2.0. On first use you are redirected to Razorpay to sign in and authorize access; no API key needs to be pasted. Access is scoped to your merchant account and the permissions you grant.\n\n## Common tasks\n\n- Fetch payments and inspect their status, method, and captured amount.\n- Create and fetch orders.\n- Issue and fetch refunds for a payment.\n- Create payment links and send them via SMS or email.\n- Review settlements.\n\nAsk in natural language, for example: \"List my recent captured payments\", \"Create a payment link for 500 INR\", or \"Refund payment pay_XXXX\". The model selects the matching Razorpay tool and fills in the parameters.","name":"razorpay-usage","description":"How to use Razorpay MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Manage Razorpay payments, orders, refunds, and payment links through Razorpay''s official hosted MCP server.","category":"payments","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.razorpay.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"razorpay","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Razorpay is a payments platform for accepting, processing, and disbursing payments. Its official remote MCP server exposes 35+ tools covering payments, orders, refunds, settlements, and payment links. Connect via browser-based OAuth to let AI agents query and manage your Razorpay account."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.026245117,0.015029907,-0.0072669983,0.004508972,0.008041382,-0.042999268,-0.027633667,0.059143066,0.02609253,0.011856079,0.011672974,-0.06201172,-0.014533997,-0.0289917,0.03955078,0.016