('remote', 'Remote', 'productivity', 'Connect AI tools to Remote''s global HR platform to query employees, payroll, PTO, and headcount data.', '/services/remote.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Remote","slug":"remote","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Remote\n\nRemote''s MCP server connects AI tools to your global HR data on https://remote.com.\n\n## Auth\n\nBrowser-based OAuth (OAuth 2.0 with PKCE and dynamic client registration). When you connect, sign in with your Remote account the same way you log into the dashboard. There are no API keys to paste. Available tools are scoped to your existing Remote role (employee vs employer/admin).\n\n## Examples\n\n- Employees: \"How many PTO days do I have left this year?\"\n- Employers/admins: \"How many employees do we have, and which countries are they in?\", \"Show upcoming payroll for this cycle.\"\n\nTool availability depends on your permissions in Remote.","name":"remote-usage","description":"How to use Remote HR tools via MCP"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Connect AI tools to Remote''s global HR platform to query employees, payroll, PTO, and headcount data.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.remote.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"remote","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Remote is a global employment platform for hiring, paying, and managing international teams and contractors. Its hosted MCP server exposes HR data such as employees, headcount by country, time off, and payroll, scoped automatically to the signed-in user''s Remote role. Authentication is browser-based OAuth, so no API keys or secrets are provisioned."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.0112838745,0.04736328,0.058166504,0.04727173,0.0128479,-0.02394104,0.03149414,0.07965088,0.016342163,0.013870239,0.008911133,-0.0026836395,0.017044067,0.0051078796,-0.0040512085,0.013519287,-0.038513184,-0.0024738312,-0.033447266,0.056640625,0.002910614,0.058166504,0.019226074,0.002817154,-0.00655365,0.032958984,-0.06945801,0.018600