('render', 'Render', 'dev', 'Manage and deploy your Render cloud services, databases, and deployments through the official Render MCP server.', '/services/render.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Render","slug":"render","inputs":[{"key":"RENDER_API_KEY","help":"Create an API key from your Render Account Settings page at https://dashboard.render.com/u/settings#api-keys. Render API keys are broadly scoped and grant access to all workspaces and services your account can access.","type":"password","label":"Render API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"rnd_..."}],"skills":[{"body":"# Render\n\nThe Render MCP server connects to your Render account to manage cloud infrastructure.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Create an API key from your Render Account Settings: https://dashboard.render.com/u/settings#api-keys\n2. Paste it as `RENDER_API_KEY`. The key is sent as an `Authorization: Bearer` header to `https://mcp.render.com/mcp`.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- List and inspect your workspaces and services (web services, static sites, cron jobs)\n- Create and manage deploys, and read deploy status and logs\n- Query and manage Render Postgres databases and key-value stores\n\n## Notes\n\nRender API keys are broadly scoped and grant access to all workspaces and services your account can access, so only connect if you are comfortable granting the AI app this level of access.","name":"render-usage","description":"How to use the Render MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Manage and deploy your Render cloud services, databases, and deployments through the official Render MCP server.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.render.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"render","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.RENDER_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Render is a cloud application platform for deploying web services, static sites, cron jobs, and managed databases. This connector uses Render''s official hosted MCP server to let AI apps query and manage your workspaces, services, deploys, and logs. Authentication uses a Render API key."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.02798462,0.002696991,0.05734253,-0.011672974,0.005279541,-0.050476074,0.015403748,0.04949951,-0.0013561249,0.010055542,-0.012489319,-0.0004684925,0.0021018982,-0.029891968,-0.017089844,0.0390625,-0.028915405,-0.007751465,0.012260437,0.04348755,0.01876831,0.00818634,0.04626465,-0.00077819824,-0.051361084,0.03552246,-0.06939697,0.020568848,0.019607544,-0.01927185,-0.011856079,-0.030166626,-0.004825592,-0.010543823,0.047851562,0.0029907227,-0.039031982,0.019195557,-0.019989014,0.020248413,-0.015548706,0.020187378,-0.037078857,0.021835327,0.017944336,0.0046691895,-0.017990112,-0.022491455,0.07635498,0.02583313,-0.01675415,0.020202637,0.00037789345,0.027389526,-0.024475098,0.0017719269,0.010955811,0.0021018982,0.0140686035,-0.02281189,0.025436401,-0.048339844,0.008201599,0.035095215,-0.052490234,0.0036144257,-0.0067596436,0.027542114,-0.013137817,-0.020935059,-0.025299072,-0.0077438354,0.018875122,-0.03491211,-0.018875122,-0.021835327,-0.017623901,0.017562866,-0.0044059753,-0.0010519028,-0.028671265,-0.0129470825,-0.03933716,-0.051849365,0.005874634,-0.029067993,-0.038970947,-0.0010375977,-0.040649414,0.023483276,-0.011375427,0.024459839,-0.021377563,0.04547119,0.03894043,0.015090942,-0.0087509155,0.022750854,-0.00036168098,0.050872803,-0.0064926147,-0.021469116,-0.040100098,-0.009094238,0.043273926,0.0012550354,0.04156494,0.00459671,-0.015930176,0.00067710876,-0.099243164,0.008354187,-0.014785767,0.009536743,-0.00085258484,-0.0079193115,0.0423584,-0.0118255615,-0.025726318,-0.01966858,-0.0463562,0.042877197,0.030578613,-0.019134521,0.005306244,-0.0012044907,-0.010314941,-0.009140015,-0.034332275,-0.0066490173,0.020584106,-0.031463623,0.06298828,-0.09100342,-0.007896423,-0.0046844482,-0.012199402,0.010810852,-0.02720642,0.024658203,-0.0020065308,-0.022537231,0.032592773,-0.00472641,-0.08758545,-0.036956787,-0.11022949,-0.03982544,0.0052452087,-0.03930664,-0.042907715,0.00