('replicate', 'Replicate', 'dev', 'Run and manage AI models on Replicate directly from your agent through its official hosted MCP server.', '/services/replicate.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Replicate","slug":"replicate","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Replicate\n\nReplicate runs AI models (image, video, audio, language) via a hosted API. Use the Replicate MCP tools to:\n\n- Search and browse models and collections to find the right model.\n- Get details about a model, its versions, and input schema before running it.\n- Create a prediction to run a model with specific inputs.\n- Track a prediction''s status and fetch its output; cancel a running prediction if needed.\n- View or manage generated images.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Always inspect a model''s input schema before creating a prediction so you pass valid parameters.\n- Predictions are asynchronous: create the prediction, then poll its status until it succeeds or fails before reading the output.\n- Authentication is handled through browser sign-in; the server uses your Replicate account token on your behalf, so you never paste a key.\n","name":"replicate-usage","description":"How to use Replicate MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Run and manage AI models on Replicate directly from your agent through its official hosted MCP server.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.replicate.com/sse","args":[],"name":"replicate","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"sse"}],"description":"Replicate lets you run thousands of open-source and commercial AI models via a simple API. Its official remote MCP server exposes tools to search models and collections, create and track predictions, and view generated outputs. Connect via browser sign-in; no API key needs to be pasted."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.008918762,0.01991272,0.045288086,-0.0067443848,-0.03050232,-9.995699e-05,0.04260254,0.013435364,-0.011634827,0.015274048,0.0021839142,-0.055664062,0.010871887,-0.017318726,-0.05218506,-0.040161133,-0.026550293,-0.019