('resend', 'Resend', 'marketing', 'Send transactional and marketing emails and manage templates, broadcasts, contacts, and domains through Resend''s hosted MCP server.', '/services/resend.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Resend","slug":"resend","skills":[{"body":"# Resend\n\nResend''s hosted MCP server (https://mcp.resend.com/mcp) exposes the Resend email platform to your agent.\n\nYou can either sign in through your browser with your Resend account (OAuth), or authenticate with a Resend API key passed as a Bearer token (useful for headless/CI use).\n\n## What you can do\n- Send transactional and marketing emails\n- Manage email templates\n- Create and send broadcasts\n- Manage contacts and audiences\n- Manage sending domains\n- Inspect delivery logs and webhooks\n\n## Tips\n- Sending requires a verified domain in your Resend account; verify a domain before sending from a custom address.\n- Use templates and broadcasts for repeatable campaigns; use direct send for one-off transactional mail.\n","name":"resend-usage","description":"How to use the Resend MCP tools"}],"summary":"Send transactional and marketing emails and manage templates, broadcasts, contacts, and domains through Resend''s hosted MCP server.","category":"marketing","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Resend","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.resend.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"resend","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"API key","inputs":[{"key":"RESEND_API_KEY","help":"Create it in Resend -> API Keys (resend.com/api-keys).","type":"password","label":"Resend API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"re_xxxxxxxxxxxx"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.resend.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"resend","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.RESEND_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Resend is a developer-first email platform for sending transactional and marketing email. Its official hosted MCP server gives an AI agent native access to emails, templates, broadcasts, contacts, domains, logs, and webhooks. Connect over HTTP with browser-based OAuth sign-in, or with a Resend API key."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.01751709,0.024505615,0.018234253,0.025497437,0.018112183,0.0006246567,-0.019805908,0.040100098,-0.00242424,0.0036373138,-0.011116028,0.02041626,-0.0025196075,0.020339966,-0.006591797,0.019302368,-0.021713257,-0.014289856,-0.00010615587,0.049804688,0.025375366,0.035339355,-0.0110321045,0.030807495,-0.05657959,0.028900146,-0.070129395,0.01889038,0.029418945,-0.014907837,0.031921387,-0.03100586,-0.054595947,0.0062217712,0.0063667297,0.009979248,-0.03366089,0.033721924,-0.015220642,0.040374756,-0.021530151,0.0051078796,-0.016403198,-0.002494812,-0.009246826,0.06225586,-0.070739746,-0.045043945,0.06048584,0.05770874,-0.012359619,-0.008216858,-0.005836487,0.055725098,-0.03515625,-0.019638062,0.029449463,-0.025665283,-0.018157959,-0.002998352,0.008911133,-0.046691895,-0.018569946,0.0051078796,-0.01991272,0.02507019,-0.020248413,0.034851074,0.0040016174,0.024612427,-0.01789856,0.005710602,0.01751709,-0.046966553,0.0047569275,-0.0077819824,0.040802002,0.07196045,-0.02357483,-0.036712646,-0.00077295303,-0.02645874,-0.015487671,-0.02796936,-0.035308838,-0.0065612793,0.011062622,0.022064209,-0.0069732666,-0.028259277,-0.034423828,0.022369385,-0.0067253113,0.039886475,0.00032138824,-0.013389587,-0.043182373,-0.017211914,0.02319336,0.093566895,0.021408081,-0.049041748,-0.054748535,-0.024612427,-0.020935059,-0.051879883,0.020690918,0.0368042,0.037078857,0.0003437996,-0.074035645,-0.031707764,-0.009056091,-0.017318726,0.011810303,-0.014930725,-0.0058288574,-0.052734375,-0.041259766,-0.018112183,-0.032470703,0.07598877,0.024353027,-0.012626648,-0.03744507,-0.021209717,-0.0056266785,0.0039863586,0.002040863,-0.0012054443,0.060821533,0.0003004074,0.026763916,-0.056243896,-0.026931763,0.031982422,-