('sanity', 'Sanity', 'dev', 'Manage Sanity content and schemas through the hosted Sanity MCP server.', '/services/sanity.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Sanity","slug":"sanity","skills":[{"body":"# Sanity\n\nThe Sanity MCP server connects to your Sanity content platform (Content Lake) over the hosted endpoint at https://mcp.sanity.io.\n\n## Auth\n\nSign in through your browser with your Sanity account (OAuth), or provide a Sanity API token via the Authorization header. Edits are attributed to the signed-in user (OAuth) or scoped to the token''s role.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- Browse projects and datasets\n- Query documents with GROQ\n- Create, update, and patch documents\n- Inspect and work with content schemas\n\n## Tips\n\n- Specify the target project and dataset when a request is ambiguous.\n- Prefer reading/querying to confirm document shape before mutating content.","name":"sanity-usage","description":"How to use Sanity MCP tools"}],"summary":"Manage Sanity content and schemas through the hosted Sanity MCP server.","category":"dev","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Sanity","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.sanity.io","args":[],"name":"sanity","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-token","kind":"key","label":"API token","inputs":[{"key":"SANITY_API_TOKEN","help":"Create a token in sanity.io/manage -> your project -> API -> Tokens.","type":"password","label":"Sanity API token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"sk..."}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.sanity.io","args":[],"name":"sanity","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.SANITY_API_TOKEN}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Sanity is a headless content platform (Content Lake) for structured content and schemas. This connects to Sanity''s hosted remote MCP server so agents can query, create, and update documents and inspect schemas. Authenticate via browser OAuth sign-in with your Sanity account, or with a Sanity API token."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.026367188,0.025161743,0.030563354,0.021102905,0.0023612976,0.0034103394,-0.0010166168,0.026519775,0.020584106,-0.0076942444,0.032287598,-0.020492554,-0.0541687,0.020431519,-0.004673004,0.014442444,-0.024230957,0.018569946,0.0036506653,0.048858643,0.054260254,0.066467285,0.02784729,0.0112838745,0.013076782,-0.012069702,-0.049316406,0.036834717,0.023254395,-0.054748535,0.01600647,-0.003921509,-0.0045700073,0.072631836,0.030654907,0.05368042,-0.0011663437,0.022918701,-0.012634277,-0.036315918,-0.061553955,-0.02078247,-0.020019531,0.019470215,0.04171753,-0.013061523,0.00022697449,0.010635376,0.052734375,-0.020401001,0.008628845,-5.4895878e-05,0.007881165,0.036468506,0.001953125,0.012718201,-0.011795044,0.034729004,-0.03503418,-0.013786316,0.0115356445,-0.029037476,-0.031799316,0.039886475,-0.030883789,-0.024536133,-0.014945984,-0.01687622,-0.018203735,0.01424408,0.016525269,0.030319214,-0.00085926056,-0.020614624,-0.040527344,-0.024917603,0.027770996,0.025848389,-0.043914795,-0.025909424,-0.024276733,-0.004081726,-0.029968262,-0.033843994,-0.045440674,0.019378662,-0.024276733,0.010681152,-0.036132812,0.04058838,0.027328491,0.06414795,-0.03491211,0.023132324,0.04763794,-0.028076172,-0.025650024,0.04055786,0.030761719,0.044647217,0.017456055,-0.046661377,-0.011940002,-0.076660156,0.036956787,0.048583984,0.021896362,-0.004573822,-0.022857666,-0.027114868,-0.115112305,-0.04473877,-0.013801575,0.042388916,-0.012138367,-0.031311035,-0.0019226074,-0.011001587,0.042053223,-0.003376007,-0.045135498,0.0418396,-0.014701843,-0.03100586,-0.022354126,-0.02796936,-0.0053749084,0.0022773743,-0.03375244,0.00024223328,0.05041504,-0.032287598,0.020263672,-0.046051025,-0.019973755,0.028442383,-0.030563354,-0.038116455,-0.042755127,0.0023460388,0.0105896,0.016174316,0.052001953,-0.0053901672,-0.027755737,-0.030059814,-0.054260254,-0.0029277802,-0.030853271,-0.012428284,-0.011253357,-0.0170