('screensdesign', 'ScreensDesign', 'productivity', 'Research how top iOS apps design their onboarding, paywalls and screens.', '/services/screensdesign.png', '{"name":"ScreensDesign","slug":"screensdesign","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# ScreensDesign\n\nUI/UX research on 1,500+ top iOS apps: recorded screens, onboarding flows,\npaywalls, plus revenue and install data.\n\n## Start here\nCall `describe_screensdesign_mcp` once to see what the connected account can\nreach. Call `get_screensdesign_skill` to pull ScreensDesign''s own companion\nguide before a deep research session; it documents the filters in detail.\n\n## Picking the right tool\n- Apps: `search_apps` (use `smart_search` for capabilities and product\n  mechanics; for ranked lists such as highest-revenue or most-downloaded, leave\n  it empty and use explicit filters plus sort), `similar_apps`, `app_detail`,\n  `search_developers`.\n- Screens: `search_screens` for a visible UI concept, `app_screens` to browse an\n  app''s latest replay, `screen_detail` for images and adjacent screens,\n  `find_similar_screens` from a reference screen or image.\n- Flows: `search_flows` for a journey such as onboarding or a paywall.\n- Store pages: `search_store_screens` covers App Store promo screenshots, which\n  are not in-app captures.\n- Saved work: `list_collections`, `get_collection`.\n\n## Reporting\nCite the app name and the figures the tools return (revenue, installs,\nonboarding step count, paywall type). Revenue values are USD.\n","name":"screensdesign-research","description":"How to research apps, screens and flows with ScreensDesign"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Research how top iOS apps design their onboarding, paywalls and screens.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.screensdesign.com/v1/mcp","args":[],"name":"screensdesign","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"ScreensDesign is a UI/UX intelligence library covering 1,500+ top iOS apps, pairing screen-by-screen captures with revenue and install data. Connects the hosted ScreensDesign MCP: you sign in with your ScreensDesign account, nothing to paste."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.004924774,0.039733887,0.012702942,0.027008057,-0.00116539,-0.045135498,0.00022661686,0.020019531,-0.00092840195,0.009033203,-0.024734497,-0.059417725,-0.02458191,0.015823364,0.023162842,0.030075073,-0.025146484,-0.023544312,-0.05102539,0.04547119,0.049041748,9.274483e-05,0.0020313263,0.0014238358,0.03552246,-0.0016422272,-0.05065918,-0.011291504,-0.015312195,0.0013227463,0.04046631,-0.015037537,-0.027694702,0.0053710938,0.033050537,-0.019805908,-0.0345459,0.022506714,0.01398468,-0.02532959,-0.001964569,0.019042969,-0.010543823,0.0005030632,0.014472961,-0.026504517,0.018600464,-0.009300232,-0.03805542,0.04135132,-0.05380249,0.010772705,-0.035247803,-0.018737793,-0.038635254,-0.005302429,-0.011230469,-0.021087646,-0.019638062,0.030853271,0.011993408,0.012466431,0.037200928,0.004688263,-0.01651001,-0.021255493,-0.044128418,0.02394104,0.019729614,-0.029937744,0.07788086,-0.030654907,0.01398468,-0.0016880035,0.022232056,-0.017974854,0.01058197,0.021759033,0.039398193,-0.0049476624,0.039489746,-0.0119018555,-0.019729614,-0.009788513,-0.058563232,-0.022720337,0.0058555603,-0.011375427,-0.051116943,-0.01727295,-0.068237305,0.03717041,-0.021347046,-0.0178833,0.02859497,0.03353882,0.016159058,0.033691406,0.0062561035,0.055603027,0.029663086,-0.031982422,-0.05230713,0.023132324,0.026031494,-0.002374649,-0.009216309,0.0020503998,-0.022003174,0.0056648254,-0.06817627,0.0053100586,-0.0062332153,-0.0029582977,0.05429077,0.0015630722,0.0075645447,-0.021606445,-0.017150879,-0.011787415,-0.04208374,0.0362854,0.019470215,0.013839722,0.015007019,-0.015991211,-0.03982544,-0.037994385,-0.021759033,-0.027618408,0.01285553,-0.023345947,0.022018433,-0.05697632,0.0289917,0.0072402954,-0.034820557,0.015731812,-0.055358887,-0.012901306,0.027770996,0.0014839172,0.008110046,-0.022705078,-0.06161499,-0.030944824,-0.0040092