('segment', 'Segment', 'analytics', 'Audit and manage your Segment sources, destinations, warehouses and tracking plans.', '/services/segment.png', '{"name":"Segment","slug":"segment","inputs":[{"key":"SEGMENT_PUBLIC_API_TOKEN","help":"Create it in Segment - Settings - Access Management - Tokens - + Create Token (Public API token). Requires Workspace Owner.","type":"password","label":"Segment Public API token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"Your Segment Public API token"},{"key":"SEGMENT_API_BASE_URL","help":"US workspaces use api.segmentapis.com; EU workspaces use eu1.api.segmentapis.com.","type":"select","label":"API region base URL","secret":false,"options":["https://api.segmentapis.com","https://eu1.api.segmentapis.com"],"required":true}],"skills":[{"body":"# Segment Public API\n\nUse the Segment Public API to audit and manage the workspace CDP setup.\n\n- Base URL: read `$SEGMENT_API_BASE_URL` (US `https://api.segmentapis.com`, EU `https://eu1.api.segmentapis.com`).\n- Auth: every request needs the header `Authorization: Bearer $SEGMENT_PUBLIC_API_TOKEN`. Never print or log the token.\n\n## Common endpoints\n- `GET /sources` - list data sources; `GET /sources/{id}` for one.\n- `GET /sources/{id}/connected-destinations` - destinations wired to a source.\n- `GET /warehouses` - connected data warehouses.\n- `GET /tracking-plans` and `GET /tracking-plans/{id}` - event schemas.\n- `GET /` - workspace metadata.\n\n## Example\n```bash\ncurl -sS \"$SEGMENT_API_BASE_URL/sources\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $SEGMENT_PUBLIC_API_TOKEN\"\n```\n\nDefault to read-only (list/get) for audits. For any write or delete, confirm the exact resource with the user first and never act without explicit go-ahead.","name":"segment-usage","description":"How to use the Segment Public API"}],"envKeys":[{"key":"SEGMENT_PUBLIC_API_TOKEN","fromInput":"SEGMENT_PUBLIC_API_TOKEN"},{"key":"SEGMENT_API_BASE_URL","fromInput":"SEGMENT_API_BASE_URL"}],"summary":"Audit and manage your Segment sources, destinations, warehouses and tracking plans.","category":"analytics","mcpServers":[],"description":"Connects to Segment''s Public API with a workspace API token. Lets the agent inspect your CDP setup - list sources/destinations/warehouses and read tracking plans - and manage workspace resources via the documented REST endpoints."}'::jsonb, true, true, '[0.0027217865,0.013534546,0.050750732,-0.04171753,-0.008125305,0.005455017,-0.01625061,0.047851562,0.046203613,-0.023834229,0.03930664,-0.0051498413,-0.022232056,-0.027816772,0.00242424,0.022232056,-0.0015182495,-0.011756897,-0.029769897,0.031066895,0.030410767,0.09472656,-0.027160645,0.035705566,-0.0021018982,0.002866745,-0.022338867,0.011619568,-0.047607422,-0.034240723,0.022232056,-0.032104492,-0.03274536,0.03253174,0.07366943,0.04171753,-0.04360962,0.025863647,-0.027648926,0.037322998,-0.023071289,0.0446167,0.0027561188,0.05291748,0.037841797,0.008094788,-0.0385437,-0.01689148,0.008140564,-0.00089740753,-0.0021076202,0.03451538,-0.013298035,-0.01335907,0.0049476624,0.01675415,0.0065307617,0.01625061,0.015365601,-0.025238037,0.009140015,-0.016555786,-0.011123657,0.022491455,-0.021759033,0.043029785,-0.009635925,0.017532349,-0.009506226,-0.0546875,0.040527344,0.02998352,-0.02619934,-0.036712646,0.012077332,0.01574707,-0.018722534,0.06829834,-0.04119873,0.010643005,-0.025909424,-0.024276733,-0.039611816,0.0045204163,-0.025299072,-0.021011353,-0.010803223,-0.039886475,0.006248474,0.032836914,-0.014381409,-0.014038086,-0.014404297,0.00024354458,0.0435791,-0.021102905,-0.017318726,-0.021652222,-0.00069856644,0.036895752,-0.0102005005,-0.00504303,-0.032470703,-0.026947021,0.041015625,-0.03955078,0.034698486,0.03475952,0.019607544,-0.00843811,-0.082214355,0.00843811,0.0055732727,-0.0021419525,0.033447266,0.0017652512,-0.008728027,-0.00060892105,0.04763794,0.0054359436,-0.03274536,-0.017318726,0.015899658,-0.022979736,-0.02798462,-0.028152466,-0.004135132,-0.028152466,-0.011436462,-0.0031394958,0.0031375