('sentry', 'Sentry', 'dev', 'Inspect and triage application errors, issues, and performance data from your Sentry projects.', '/services/sentry.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Sentry","slug":"sentry","skills":[{"body":"# Sentry\n\nUse the sentry_* tools to work with your Sentry organization, projects, and issues.\n\n- List your organizations, teams, and projects to find the right context.\n- Search and read issues and errors, including stack traces and event details, to triage bugs.\n- Create or look up projects and DSNs when setting up new services.\n- Invoke Sentry''s Seer agent to generate a root-cause analysis and suggested fix for an issue.\n\nAuth: sign in with Sentry (OAuth), or pass a Sentry User Auth Token via the `Sentry-Bearer` header. If a token call fails with an authorization error, verify the token has the scopes org:read, project:read, project:write, team:read, team:write, and event:write. The hosted server targets Sentry SaaS (sentry.io).","name":"sentry-usage","description":"How to inspect and triage errors and issues with the Sentry MCP tools."}],"summary":"Inspect and triage application errors, issues, and performance data from your Sentry projects.","category":"dev","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Sentry","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.sentry.dev/mcp","args":[],"name":"sentry","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-token","kind":"key","label":"User Auth Token","inputs":[{"key":"SENTRY_ACCESS_TOKEN","help":"Create a User Auth Token in Sentry at Settings > Account > User Auth Tokens (https://sentry.io/settings/account/api/auth-tokens/). Grant scopes: org:read, project:read, project:write, team:read, team:write, event:write.","type":"password","label":"Sentry User Auth Token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"sntryu_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.sentry.dev/mcp","args":[],"name":"sentry","