('sharepoint', 'SharePoint', 'productivity', 'Search SharePoint sites, read and update lists, and manage documents in libraries.', '/services/sharepoint.png', '{"name":"SharePoint","slug":"sharepoint","skills":[{"body":"# SharePoint\n\nThe connection points at one tenant (the `contoso` in contoso.sharepoint.com) and, optionally, one default site. Most tools take a `site_name` to work on another site of the same tenant; SHARE_POINT_LIST_SITES with a `search` term finds it first.\n\nTo answer a question from the intranet, start with SHARE_POINT_SEARCH_QUERY: it takes KQL (`budget 2026 filetype:docx`, `author:\"Alice Martin\"`) across documents, pages and list items, and can be narrowed to a site path. SHARE_POINT_SEARCH_FILES does the same for files only. SHARE_POINT_GET_SITE_PAGE_CONTENT reads a modern site page, SHARE_POINT_GET_WEB_INFO describes a site.\n\nLists are the business data of SharePoint (requests, inventories, trackers). SHARE_POINT_LIST_ALL_LISTS discovers them, SHARE_POINT_LIST_LIST_COLUMNS gives the internal column names you must use in writes and OData filters, SHARE_POINT_GET_LIST_ITEMS reads with `filter`, `orderby` and `top`. Create with SHARE_POINT_SHAREPOINT_CREATE_LIST_ITEM, edit with SHARE_POINT_UPDATE_LIST_ITEM, remove with SHARE_POINT_RECYCLE_LIST_ITEM (recoverable from the recycle bin).\n\nDocuments live in libraries: SHARE_POINT_LIST_SITE_DRIVES, then SHARE_POINT_LIST_FILES_IN_FOLDER and SHARE_POINT_LIST_SUBFOLDERS_IN_FOLDER with server-relative URLs (`/sites/marketing/Shared Documents/Briefs`). Download with SHARE_POINT_DOWNLOAD_FILE_BY_SERVER_RELATIVE_URL, add files with SHARE_POINT_UPLOAD_FILE or SHARE_POINT_UPLOAD_FROM_URL, folders with SHARE_POINT_SHAREPOINT_CREATE_FOLDER, and send a file to the recycle bin with SHARE_POINT_RECYCLE_FILE. A link pasted by the user resolves with SHARE_POINT_RESOLVE_SHARING_LINK.\n\nSharePoint content is shared with the whole team. Confirm with the user before overwriting a file, editing list items you did not create or creating a sharing link.","name":"sharepoint-usage","description":"How to use SharePoint tools"}],"summary":"Search SharePoint sites, read and update lists, and manage documents in libraries.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with Microsoft","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"share_point","allowedTools":["SHARE_POINT_LIST_SITES","SHARE_POINT_SEARCH_QUERY","SHARE_POINT_SEARCH_FILES","SHARE_POINT_GET_WEB_INFO","SHARE_POINT_GET_SITE_PAGE_CONTENT","SHARE_POINT_LIST_ALL_LISTS","SHARE_POINT_GET_LIST_BY_TITLE","SHARE_POINT_LIST_LIST_COLUMNS","SHARE_POINT_GET_LIST_ITEMS","SHARE_POINT_GET_LIST_ITEM_BY_ID","SHARE_POINT_SHAREPOINT_CREATE_LIST","SHARE_POINT_SHAREPOINT_CREATE_LIST_ITEM","SHARE_POINT_UPDATE_LIST_ITEM","SHARE_POINT_RECYCLE_LIST_ITEM","SHARE_POINT_LIST_SITE_DRIVES","SHARE_POINT_LIST_FILES_IN_FOLDER","SHARE_POINT_LIST_SUBFOLDERS_IN_FOLDER","SHARE_POINT_GET_SITE_DRIVE_ITEM_BY_PATH","SHARE_POINT_DOWNLOAD_FILE_BY_SERVER_RELATIVE_URL","SHARE_POINT_SHAREPOINT_CREATE_FOLDER","SHARE_POINT_UPLOAD_FILE","SHARE_POINT_UPLOAD_FROM_URL","SHARE_POINT_RECYCLE_FILE","SHARE_POINT_RESOLVE_SHARING_LINK","SHARE_POINT_CREATE_DRIVE_ITEM_SHARING_LINK","SHARE_POINT_SHAREPOINT_FIND_USER","SHARE_POINT_GET_CURRENT_USER"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/sharepoint","args":[],"name":"sharepoint","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"SharePoint in one click: sign in with Microsoft, enter your tenant name, and your agent can search the intranet, read pages, work with lists and manage files in document libraries. The connection is brokered by Composio, so there is no Azure app registration and no token to paste."}'::jsonb, false, false, '[-0.03164673,-0.012161255,-0.0007429123,0.020217896,0.028015137,-0.046966553,0.037750244,0.05114746,-0.004096985,0.01