('similarweb', 'Similarweb', 'analytics', 'Access Similarweb''s digital intelligence data (web traffic, audience, keyword, app and ecommerce insights) through its official MCP server.', '/services/similarweb.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Similarweb","slug":"similarweb","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Similarweb MCP\n\nThe Similarweb MCP server exposes digital intelligence data over the official remote endpoint at https://mcp.similarweb.com.\n\n## Auth\nOn first connect, your MCP client opens a browser window to sign in and authorize access to your Similarweb account (OAuth). Credentials are reused for later sessions. API access depends on your Similarweb plan and entitlements.\n\n## What you can ask\n- Website traffic trends, engagement and audience insights for any domain\n- Keyword intelligence and search traffic\n- App download estimates, engagement and category rankings (iOS/Android)\n- Ecommerce and marketplace dynamics (e.g. Amazon seller/product trends)\n\n## Tips\n- Provide an exact domain (e.g. example.com) when asking for traffic or competitive metrics.\n- Specify a time range and country when relevant for more precise results.","name":"similarweb-usage","description":"How to use Similarweb tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Access Similarweb''s digital intelligence data (web traffic, audience, keyword, app and ecommerce insights) through its official MCP server.","category":"analytics","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.similarweb.com","args":[],"name":"similarweb","oauth":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Similarweb provides competitive digital intelligence including website traffic trends, audience insights, keyword intelligence, app performance and ecommerce marketplace analytics. Its official remote MCP server lets AI agents query any domain''s traffic and competitive metrics via natural language. Authentication uses a browser OAuth sign-in to your Similarweb account."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.007408142,-0.0036296844,0.017791748,0.006912231