('smartsheet', 'Smartsheet', 'productivity', 'Connect AI tools to Smartsheet to read and manage sheets, rows, columns, and project data through the official hosted MCP server.', '/services/smartsheet.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Smartsheet","slug":"smartsheet","skills":[{"body":"# Smartsheet\n\nThe Smartsheet MCP server connects to your Smartsheet workspace through the official hosted endpoint at https://mcp.smartsheet.com. Depending on your client you either sign in with Smartsheet OAuth or connect with a Smartsheet API access token.\n\n## What you can do\n\n- List and search sheets, workspaces, and folders you have access to.\n- Read sheet contents: rows, columns, cells, cell history, and comments.\n- Create, update, and delete rows and columns.\n- Inspect column types, row relationships, and metadata to understand a sheet''s structure.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Actions respect your Smartsheet permissions; you can only see and change what your account is allowed to.\n- Start by listing sheets to find the sheet ID you want to work with, then read or modify its rows.\n- EU and AU customers should use the region-specific endpoint (https://mcp.smartsheet.eu or https://mcp.smartsheet.au).","name":"smartsheet-usage","description":"How to use the Smartsheet MCP tools"}],"summary":"Connect AI tools to Smartsheet to read and manage sheets, rows, columns, and project data through the official hosted MCP server.","category":"productivity","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Smartsheet","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.smartsheet.com","args":[],"name":"smartsheet","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-token","kind":"key","label":"API access token","inputs":[{"key":"SMARTSHEET_API_TOKEN","help":"Generate an API access token in Smartsheet under Account > Personal Settings > API Access.","type":"password","label":"Smartsheet API access token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"Smartsheet API token"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.smartsheet.com","args":[],"name":"smartsheet","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.SMARTSHEET_API_TOKEN}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Smartsheet is a work and project management platform built around collaborative online sheets, grids, and dashboards. Its official hosted MCP server at mcp.smartsheet.com routes requests through the Smartsheet REST API, exposing structured data such as row relationships, column types, cell history, and comments while respecting the authenticated user''s permissions. Clients that support Smartsheet OAuth sign in through the browser with no key to paste; other clients pass a Smartsheet API access token as a Bearer Authorization header."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.014602661,0.013435364,0.020706177,0.017181396,0.00019061565,-0.03289795,-0.020645142,0.025161743,0.00029802322,-0.01878357,-0.0135269165,-0.022735596,-0.01209259,0.021728516,-0.0135650635,0.041992188,-0.0028152466,-0.039916992,-0.030593872,0.014328003,0.028396606,0.06939697,0.0019893646,0.043060303,-0.0064353943,0.008155823,-0.0496521,0.005832672,0.005844116,0.00579834,-0.01725769,-0.017791748,-0.04196167,0.028152466,-0.0023937225,-0.005607605,-0.013977051,0.050598145,-0.00504303,-0.011932373,-0.02166748,0.040374756,-0.022583008,0.029174805,-0.008651733,-1.6868114e-05,-0.0028095245,-0.05343628,0.035705566,0.010284424,-0.024353027,0.0018587112,-0.02142334,0.026947021,0.0012750626,0.04446411,0.004348755,-0.00022244453,-0.036010742,0.028839111,-0.02885437,-0.028900146,0.022994995,0.045928955,-0.043151855,-0.016204834,-0.003156662,0.049835205,0.023956299,-0.0032024384,-0.0010929108,0.022735596,0.039611816,-0.0038032532,-0.0035438538,-0.057434082,-0.027404785,0.068359375,0.018295288,-0.023529053,0.0028820038,-0.021347046,-0.041046143,-0.049468994,-0.04071045,-0.010177612,-0.028747559,-0.018844604,-0.014625549,0.012893677,-0.043426514,0.03289795,-0.07836914,-0.0033798218