('solana', 'Solana', 'dev', 'Official Solana Foundation MCP server that gives AI agents up-to-date Solana documentation, semantic search, and Rust program checks.', '/services/solana.svg', '{"name":"Solana","slug":"solana","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Solana Developer MCP\n\nThe official Solana Foundation MCP server exposes up-to-date Solana documentation and developer tooling. No authentication is required.\n\n## Tools\n\n- **list_sections** — Discover indexed Solana documentation sources and their section tags.\n- **get_documentation** — Retrieve canonical docs by source, section, or a list of IDs.\n- **Solana_Documentation_Search** — Semantic search across Solana documentation.\n- **Solana_Expert__Ask_For_Help** — Get answers to how-to and debugging questions with retrieved context.\n- **program_autofixer** — Analyze Anchor and Pinocchio Rust programs for security patterns and suggested fixes.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Start with `list_sections` to see what documentation is indexed, then use `Solana_Documentation_Search` or `get_documentation` to pull specifics.\n- Use `Solana_Expert__Ask_For_Help` for open-ended debugging or how-to questions.\n- Feed Rust program source to `program_autofixer` to catch common Anchor/Pinocchio security issues.","name":"solana-usage","description":"How to use the Solana developer MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Official Solana Foundation MCP server that gives AI agents up-to-date Solana documentation, semantic search, and Rust program checks.","category":"dev","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.solana.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"solana","headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects to the Solana Foundation''s hosted developer MCP for live access to Solana documentation, canonical spec retrieval, and semantic search. Also includes a program autofixer that analyzes Anchor and Pinocchio Rust programs for security patterns. No API key is required."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.023284912,-0.04083252,0.07556152,0.03204345