('sourcegraph', 'Sourcegraph', 'dev', 'Cross-repository code search and code intelligence for AI agents via Sourcegraph''s hosted MCP server.', '/services/sourcegraph.png', '{"name":"Sourcegraph","slug":"sourcegraph","skills":[{"body":"# Sourcegraph\n\nSourcegraph''s MCP server gives you cross-repository code intelligence.\n\n## Connecting\n\nThe server is hosted at `https://sourcegraph.com/.api/mcp`. You can authenticate with browser-based OAuth (Dynamic Client Registration) - sign in with your Sourcegraph account when prompted - or with a Sourcegraph access token scoped to `mcp`.\n\n## Common tools\n\n- `keyword_search` / `nls_search` - search code by keyword or natural language across repositories.\n- `read_file` / `list_files` - read file contents and browse directories.\n- `list_repos` - discover available repositories.\n- `go_to_definition` / `find_references` - navigate symbols precisely.\n- `commit_search` / `diff_search` / `compare_revisions` - explore history and changes.\n- `deepsearch_read` - use the Deep Search subagent for deeper investigations.\n\n## Tips\n\n- Prefer `nls_search` when you have a fuzzy, conceptual query and `keyword_search` for exact identifiers.\n- Use `go_to_definition` and `find_references` to trace how a symbol is defined and used across the whole codebase, not just one repo.\n","name":"sourcegraph-usage","description":"How to use Sourcegraph MCP tools for code search and navigation"}],"summary":"Cross-repository code search and code intelligence for AI agents via Sourcegraph''s hosted MCP server.","category":"dev","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Sourcegraph","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://sourcegraph.com/.api/mcp","args":[],"name":"sourcegraph","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"access-token","kind":"key","label":"Access token","inputs":[{"key":"SOURCEGRAPH_ACCESS_TOKEN","help":"Create an access token in Sourcegraph under Settings > Access tokens; the mcp scope restricts it to MCP endpoints.","type":"password","label":"Sourcegraph access token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"sgp_…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://sourcegraph.com/.api/mcp","args":[],"name":"sourcegraph","headers":{"Authorization":"token ${input.SOURCEGRAPH_ACCESS_TOKEN}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Sourcegraph provides precise, cross-repository code intelligence through the Model Context Protocol. The hosted MCP server exposes tools for keyword and natural-language code search, file reading, symbol navigation (go-to-definition, find-references), commit and diff search, and Deep Search. It authenticates via browser OAuth with Dynamic Client Registration, or with a Sourcegraph access token (mcp scope) passed in the Authorization header."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.013664246,0.024627686,0.019180298,-0.005214691,-0.027130127,-0.01965332,-0.00097322464,0.02027893,-0.020339966,0.0067634583,0.034698486,-0.009239197,-0.0027637482,-0.005455017,-0.007068634,0.013221741,-0.007320404,-0.024856567,-0.034118652,0.027313232,0.021087646,0.029907227,0.020874023,0.05657959,0.0016498566,-0.0040359497,-0.053649902,0.016113281,0.011528015,0.00198555,-0.0019025803,-0.009857178,-0.03616333,0.03036499,0.033996582,0.007003784,0.017196655,0.00970459,-0.004611969,0.018753052,-0.0057868958,-0.0019454956,-0.023529053,0.034606934,-0.022872925,-0.04437256,-0.038513184,-0.027893066,0.008934021,0.056427002,-0.04421997,-0.036193848,-0.011917114,0.04486084,-0.059051514,0.00970459,-0.0015716553,0.014022827,-0.01373291,0.047424316,0.0032520294,-0.021942139,-0.016113281,0.028167725,-0.013946533,0.016601562,0.009590149,0.021514893,-0.0005979538,-0.00060606,0.010169983,0.068847656,0.021591187,-0.055480957,-0.01802063,-0.027389526,-0.009346008,0.10882568,0.0010719299,-0.023651123,0.032714844,-0.006187439,-0.042236328,-0.032073975,-0.033996582,-0.06173706,-0.020828247,-0.008598328,-0.0501709,-0.008