('square', 'Square', 'payments', 'Connect AI tools to the Square platform to manage payments, orders, catalog, customers, and inventory.', '/services/square.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Square","slug":"square","skills":[{"body":"# Square\n\nThe Square MCP server gives you programmatic access to the Square platform via natural language.\n\n## Auth\nUse the hosted remote server with browser OAuth (recommended): sign in with your Square account and grant only the scopes you need (payments, orders, catalog, customers, inventory, bookings, loyalty). Alternatively run the local stdio server authenticated with a Square access token.\n\n## Common tasks\n- List and search customers, create or update customer profiles\n- Create and manage orders and payments\n- Browse and edit catalog items, variations, and pricing\n- Check and adjust inventory counts\n- Manage bookings, appointments, gift cards, and loyalty programs\n\n## Tips\n- Confirm you are operating in the intended environment (production vs sandbox) before making changes.\n- Scope requests narrowly; only the permissions you approved during sign-in are available.","name":"square-usage","description":"How to use the Square MCP tools"}],"summary":"Connect AI tools to the Square platform to manage payments, orders, catalog, customers, and inventory.","category":"payments","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Square","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.squareup.com/sse","args":[],"name":"square","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"sse"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"access-token","kind":"stdio","label":"Access token (local server)","inputs":[{"key":"SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN","help":"Find your access token in the Square Developer Dashboard under your application''s Credentials. Use a production token for live data.","type":"password","label":"Square access token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"EAAA…"}],"envKeys":[{"key":"ACCESS_TOKEN","fromInput":"SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN"}],"mcpServers":[{"env":{"ACCESS_TOKEN":"${input.SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN}"},"args":["square-mcp-server","start"],"name":"square","command":"npx","headers":{},"transport":"stdio"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Square''s hosted remote MCP server exposes the full Square API surface to AI agents, including payments, orders, catalog items, customers, bookings, loyalty, and inventory. The recommended path is browser-based OAuth, where users sign in with their Square account and grant granular scopes with no token to manage. Square also ships a local stdio MCP server that authenticates with a Square access token."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.033203125,-0.018325806,0.020965576,0.012329102,-0.01927185,-0.04537964,-0.017059326,0.025024414,0.00982666,-0.01966858,0.04397583,-0.023376465,-0.031402588,0.015960693,-0.023071289,0.040405273,-0.025909424,0.016357422,0.014976501,0.01876831,0.012786865,0.047790527,0.028961182,0.005405426,-0.017837524,0.020401001,-0.049743652,-0.0062675476,0.0129776,0.00044751167,0.023117065,-0.028121948,-0.057434082,0.02255249,0.01663208,-0.004096985,-0.034088135,0.06964111,0.014968872,-0.0014705658,-0.022521973,0.023101807,0.004798889,0.0013036728,-0.00028967857,-0.028274536,-0.010238647,-0.021469116,-0.00040245056,0.012832642,0.021865845,0.028717041,-0.008918762,0.0013446808,-0.03665161,-0.004020691,0.024642944,-0.001783371,0.036834717,0.03302002,-0.0181427,-0.04751587,-0.008514404,0.039733887,-0.035980225,0.023651123,-0.040100098,0.0027942657,-0.040130615,-0.01524353,-0.010124207,-0.0035171509,0.04949951,0.020721436,0.017868042,-0.04852295,-0.0035743713,0.11993408,0.014823914,-0.007522583,0.007293701,-0.03982544,-0.05770874,-0.02571106,-0.012329102,-0.03692627,-0.03616333,-0.01133728,-0.06048584,0.020858765,-0.020935059,0.023025513,-0.015174866,-0.011817932,0.03366089,0.00076007843,0.001244545,-0.001033783,0.00038051605,0.04446411,-0.006565094,-0.044067383,-0.0625,-0.038238525,0.038330078,0.038757324,0.06329346,0.008094788,0.0027122498,