('surveymonkey', 'SurveyMonkey', 'marketing', 'Design surveys, collect responses, and analyze results in SurveyMonkey through its official hosted MCP server.', '/services/surveymonkey.svg', '{"name":"SurveyMonkey","slug":"surveymonkey","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# SurveyMonkey\n\nThe SurveyMonkey MCP server lets you design surveys, manage collectors, gather responses, and analyze results.\n\n## Connecting\n\nOn first use your MCP client opens a browser window to sign in to SurveyMonkey and authorize access. Credentials are reused for later sessions, so there is no API key to paste.\n\n## Typical tasks\n\n- Create and edit surveys\n- Create collectors to distribute a survey\n- Read survey responses (summary and detailed)\n- Analyze results and pull user/account info\n\nGranted scopes include surveys_read, surveys_write, collectors_write, responses_read, responses_read_detail, and users_read.","name":"surveymonkey-usage","description":"How to use SurveyMonkey MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Design surveys, collect responses, and analyze results in SurveyMonkey through its official hosted MCP server.","category":"marketing","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.surveymonkey.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"surveymonkey","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"SurveyMonkey is a survey and customer-feedback platform for building questionnaires, distributing them via collectors, and analyzing responses. This connector uses SurveyMonkey''s official remote MCP server, which authenticates through browser-based OAuth so no API key needs to be pasted."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.008049011,0.012580872,0.007911682,-0.00021791458,-0.016693115,-0.027786255,-0.016220093,0.048950195,0.028259277,0.012008667,0.018173218,-0.036132812,-0.002948761,0.014755249,-0.001244545,0.021972656,-0.049041748,-0.0155181885,-0.006702423,0.027130127,0.034179688,0.07183838,0.012580872,0.0033912659,-0.017303467,-0.017822266,-0.07531738,0.026657104,0.0047416687,-0.034729004,0.