('tokportal', 'TokPortal', 'marketing', 'Publish to managed TikTok, Instagram and YouTube accounts in 20+ countries and read their analytics.', '/services/tokportal.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"TokPortal","slug":"tokportal","skills":[{"body":"# TokPortal\n\nTokPortal runs real TikTok, Instagram and YouTube accounts operated by humans in 20+ countries.\n\n## Publishing\n\nA publication goes through a bundle:\n\n1. Create a bundle, choosing the countries and the number of accounts.\n2. Add video slots and configure each one (media, caption, hashtags, schedule). A CSV import exists for large batches.\n3. Publish the bundle. Operators post natively from the target country.\n\nCheck the credit balance and the credit costs before creating a bundle: publishing is metered, and a bundle that exceeds the balance will not go out.\n\n## Accounts\n\nList the delivered accounts to see which handles are live, in which country, and in which niche. Accounts are warmed on a niche before they post, so pick the niche that matches the content instead of publishing to whatever is available.\n\n## Analytics\n\nRead the analytics dashboard for aggregate performance, then drill into per-account and per-post metrics. Export the video-level analytics when the user asks for a report rather than pasting long tables into chat.\n\n## Comments and webhooks\n\nComment tasks are created then approved before an operator posts them. Webhook endpoints fire on account readiness, publication and analytics updates: use them instead of polling when the user wants to be notified.\n\nAlways report back the account handles and post URLs that were actually published, never a summary alone.","name":"tokportal-usage","description":"How to publish and measure with TokPortal"}],"summary":"Publish to managed TikTok, Instagram and YouTube accounts in 20+ countries and read their analytics.","category":"marketing","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with TokPortal","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://app.tokportal.com/api/ext/mcp","args":[],"name":"tokportal","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"API key","inputs":[{"key":"TOKPORTAL_API_KEY","help":"Generate it at app.tokportal.com → Developer → API keys. It starts with sk_ and is shown only once.","type":"password","label":"TokPortal API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"sk_…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://app.tokportal.com/api/ext/mcp","args":[],"name":"tokportal","headers":{"X-API-Key":"${input.TOKPORTAL_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}]}],"description":"TokPortal runs real social accounts operated by humans in 20+ countries: it creates and warms them, posts your videos and carousels natively, and reports per-account and per-post performance. Connect it to publish at scale without owning a device farm or getting an app reviewed."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.002374649,0.016021729,-0.016906738,0.0023593903,0.03378296,-0.03086853,-0.009643555,0.018371582,-0.0032463074,0.005378723,0.0008120537,0.0028133392,0.01285553,-0.040283203,0.013282776,0.0007457733,0.0036392212,0.010482788,-0.0055122375,0.05291748,0.0024871826,-0.0010900497,0.0035743713,0.034973145,-0.008361816,0.023834229,-0.055877686,-0.006793976,-0.028778076,-0.019821167,0.035980225,-0.042999268,-0.039215088,0.0021896362,0.04058838,-0.019134521,0.008346558,0.008331299,0.026153564,0.015823364,-0.026535034,0.0069770813,0.014297485,0.042816162,0.021743774,0.029052734,-0.027267456,-0.048980713,0.021942139,0.016281128,-0.00013065338,0.017730713,-0.039031982,-0.00077819824,-0.033813477,0.00083065033,0.0011339188,0.013687134,0.0014190674,0.037902832,-0.019973755,-0.018997192,0.04815674,0.016235352,0.016204834,-0.014007568,-0.059783936,-0.004676819,-0.0118637085,0.015205383,0.009468079,0.015975952,0.012916565,-0.0026435852,-0.039367676,-0.029647827,-0.043670654,0.038116455,0.04269409,-0.09197998,-0.005519867,0.011398315,-0.0645