('treg', 'Treg', 'seo', 'Call 3,900+ paid data and tool endpoints (SEO, backlinks, enrichment, ads, scraping) with one account, pay per call.', '/services/treg.svg', '{"name":"Treg","slug":"treg","skills":[{"body":"# Treg\n\nTreg is a pay-per-call gateway to external data and tools. Reach for it whenever a task needs live external data (SEO and SERP, backlinks, social and trends, people and company enrichment, ads, scraping) or media generation.\n\n1. Describe the job to `catalog_search` (the task, not the vendor). Read its `verdict`: `strong` means these do the job, `closest` means check `catalog_get` first, `none` means file `catalog_request` instead of rephrasing.\n2. Use `catalog_get` on the chosen endpoint to read its parameters and price before calling.\n3. Run it with `call` (endpoint id + params). Pass an `idempotency_key` when retrying a call whose answer was lost, so it is not billed twice.\n4. Check `balance` before a batch of costly calls, and tell the user what a run cost (`cost_usd` in each result).\n5. `my_tools` lists the tools the team registered with its own keys; those calls are not metered.","name":"treg-usage","description":"How to use Treg tools"}],"summary":"Call 3,900+ paid data and tool endpoints (SEO, backlinks, enrichment, ads, scraping) with one account, pay per call.","category":"seo","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Treg","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://treg.to/mcp/","args":[],"name":"treg","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"key","kind":"key","label":"Team API key","inputs":[{"key":"TREG_TOKEN","help":"Starts with `trg_live_`. Created in the [Treg dashboard](https://treg.to/) under **Team → API Keys**.","type":"password","guide":"1. Sign in to the [Treg dashboard](https://treg.to/).\n2. Open **Team → API Keys**.\n3. Type a name such as `lumvika` in **New key name**, then click **Create key**.\n4. Copy the key starting with `trg_live_` now, it is shown only once.","label":"Treg API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"trg_live_…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://treg.to/mcp/","args":[],"name":"treg","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.TREG_TOKEN}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects Treg''s hosted MCP server, a single gateway to 3,900+ endpoints across 111 providers: keyword and SERP data, backlinks, people and company enrichment, social and trends, ads, scraping and media generation. Calls are billed per call against your Treg team balance; sign in with Treg or paste a team API key."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.018798828,0.018173218,0.05407715,-0.0041999817,-0.01864624,-0.042938232,-0.016967773,0.05444336,0.015609741,-0.002166748,0.04006958,-0.04272461,-0.010307312,-0.014831543,0.018753052,-0.00762558,-0.020095825,-0.017623901,-0.042388916,0.06512451,0.009483337,0.030715942,-0.016616821,0.026138306,-0.010498047,0.024536133,-0.027160645,0.0099487305,0.0103302,-0.05758667,0.037261963,-0.04107666,0.009178162,0.037017822,0.027359009,0.013626099,-0.0050735474,0.014732361,0.012916565,0.015357971,-0.017364502,0.020477295,0.025161743,0.04135132,-0.019210815,-0.0524292,-0.07977295,-0.016403198,0.036987305,-0.0024738312,-0.023757935,-0.04171753,-0.024230957,0.054595947,-0.06970215,0.013473511,-0.04550171,0.0284729,0.020568848,0.006942749,-0.048065186,-0.03375244,0.010154724,-0.016021729,-0.020980835,0.044677734,-0.011505127,0.02331543,-0.05407715,-0.008255005,-0.025817871,-0.015289307,0.022979736,-0.029708862,-0.005176544,0.016433716,0.010398865,0.08068848,0.022918701,-0.06866455,0.026062012,-0.0289917,-0.036010742,0.0034542084,-0.013717651,-0.04156494,-0.023849487,-0.033203125,-0.022521973,0.064819336,-0.029937744,0.0045700073,-0.00015211105,0.006511688,0.05368042,0.00065517426,-0.023010254,-0.01576233,0.005306244,0.072143555,0.025177002,-0.044189453,-0.017333984,-0.03387451,0.003074646,0.025238037,0.028045654,-0.033966064,0.020050049