('trendtrack', 'TrendTrack', 'ecommerce', 'Research winning Shopify stores, ads and email campaigns with TrendTrack.', '/services/trendtrack.png', '{"name":"TrendTrack","slug":"trendtrack","skills":[{"body":"# TrendTrack\n\nEcommerce intelligence: Shopify stores, Meta and TikTok ads, email campaigns, brand tracking.\n\n## Credits\n\nEvery returned row costs one credit (10,000/month per workspace). Before a broad sweep, check the balance with the usage tool, and keep `limit` small on the first call: widen only once the filters are proven. Metered responses carry `X-Credits-Remaining`. The identity, workspace and usage tools are free.\n\n## Working the data\n\n- `search_shops` filters stores by niche, country, traffic and growth. It carries additive TikTok presence fields, but linked advertisers and the ad endpoints stay Meta/Facebook only.\n- `search_tiktok_library` is the separate door for TikTok creatives (ads and organic).\n- For \"top ads of the last 7 days\", filter on the 7-day scaling fields (`reachDelta7d`, `last7d`, `minReach`), not on a first-seen date.\n- `list_favorites` returns saved items: ad ids are numeric, shop and email ids are UUIDs.\n\n## Writes\n\nBrandtracker and favorites writes exist (`add_to_brandtracker`, `create_brandtracker_folder`, `move_tracked_brands`, `create_favorite_folder`, `add_favorite_item`, share links). Destructive tools require `confirm: true`; never pass it without the user asking for the deletion. On `delete_brandtracker_folder`, `action: \"move_to_default\"` is the safe default, `\"delete_tracked_brands\"` deactivates the trackers.\n","name":"trendtrack-usage","description":"How to use TrendTrack tools"}],"summary":"Research winning Shopify stores, ads and email campaigns with TrendTrack.","category":"ecommerce","authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with TrendTrack","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.trendtrack.io/v1/mcp","args":[],"name":"trendtrack","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"Workspace API key","inputs":[{"key":"TRENDTRACK_API_KEY","help":"Create a workspace-scoped key in TrendTrack, Workspace settings, API (app.trendtrack.io/workspace/settings/api). Public API access must be enabled on the workspace.","type":"password","label":"TrendTrack API key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"tt_…"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.trendtrack.io/v1/mcp","args":[],"name":"trendtrack","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.TRENDTRACK_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects TrendTrack''s hosted MCP server. Search 5M+ Shopify stores and 250M+ Meta and TikTok ads, dig into a shop''s traffic, products and email flows, and track competitors. Sign in with TrendTrack, or paste a workspace API key."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.015640259,0.018005371,-0.017913818,-0.018753052,0.033325195,-0.027923584,-0.010658264,0.03137207,-0.013511658,0.03579712,0.024154663,-0.013473511,-0.008621216,-0.04815674,0.007896423,0.03503418,-0.024383545,-0.027648926,-0.037261963,0.046844482,0.0020370483,0.02229309,-0.00894928,0.014518738,-0.005207062,0.032073975,-0.058288574,0.029006958,0.012710571,0.00034976006,0.008331299,-0.03387451,-0.03540039,0.020553589,0.06201172,0.0027103424,-0.025726318,0.019577026,0.0088272095,0.00083351135,-0.022949219,0.052246094,0.041931152,0.072143555,-0.00868988,-0.06402588,-0.041107178,-0.05206299,0.0026283264,0.022094727,-0.013023376,0.020706177,-0.06640625,-0.002407074,-0.08087158,0.01473999,-0.020462036,-0.012161255,0.016860962,0.0044937134,0.021438599,0.004173279,0.006614685,-0.017181396,0.01525116,0.029678345,-0.052520752,0.017929077,-0.018325806,0.00014853477,0.009239197,0.0012264252,0.020523071,-0.0015392303,0.019058228,-0.01739502,-0.031585693,0.052246094,0.021377563,-0.04660034,0.0071525574,-0.021713257,-0.06506348,0.015602112,-0.024917603,-0.06628418,-0.010482788,-0.041656494,-0.0