('trivago', 'trivago', 'ecommerce', 'Search trivago for available hotels and accommodations by destination, dates, and guest count, returning a shortlist with prices, ratings, and booking links.', '/services/trivago.svg', '{"name":"trivago","slug":"trivago","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# trivago\n\ntrivago''s hosted MCP server (https://mcp.trivago.com/mcp) searches for hotels and accommodations. No authentication is required to search.\n\n## Searching\n\nAsk in natural language and provide:\n- Destination (city, country, coordinates, or a point of interest)\n- Check-in and check-out dates\n- Number of guests (and rooms if relevant)\n- Optional filters (price range, star rating, amenities)\n\nThe server returns a shortlist of matching accommodations with prices, ratings, and links back to trivago.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Only the search parameters (destination, dates, guest count, filters) are sent to trivago; your chat history is not shared.\n- Completing a booking happens on trivago''s website, where you may be asked to sign in.","name":"trivago-usage","description":"How to search hotels with the trivago MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Search trivago for available hotels and accommodations by destination, dates, and guest count, returning a shortlist with prices, ratings, and booking links.","category":"ecommerce","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.trivago.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"trivago","headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"trivago''s official hosted MCP server lets AI assistants search for hotels and accommodations across trivago''s inventory. Provide a destination, travel dates, guest count, and filters to get back a ranked shortlist of stays with prices, ratings, and links. No credentials are required to search; only search parameters are sent to trivago."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.039367676,0.013191223,0.04800415,-0.046875,-0.04220581,-0.033447266,-0.023773193,0.0390625,0.023757935,0.034606934,-0.005256653,-0.004131317,-0.013168335,-0.