('uber', 'Uber', 'productivity', 'Get Uber ride price and time estimates and request rides directly from your AI assistant.', '/services/uber.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Uber","slug":"uber","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Uber\n\nThe Uber MCP server connects over HTTP and signs you in through Uber''s browser OAuth flow (no API key needed).\n\n## What you can do\n- Get price estimates for a trip between two locations across Uber ride options.\n- Get time/ETA estimates for pickup and ride duration.\n- Request an Uber ride and check or manage its status.\n\n## Tips\n- Provide clear pickup and drop-off locations (addresses or coordinates).\n- Confirm the ride option and estimated price with the user before requesting a ride.\n","name":"uber-usage","description":"How to use the Uber MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Get Uber ride price and time estimates and request rides directly from your AI assistant.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.uber.com/claude/rides-3p/mcp","args":[],"name":"uber","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Uber''s official remote MCP server lets agents fetch price and time estimates for any Uber ride option and request rides. It connects over streamable HTTP and authenticates through Uber''s browser-based OAuth sign-in, so no API key needs to be pasted."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.01651001,-0.022720337,0.020706177,-0.010688782,-0.016586304,-0.058013916,0.047210693,0.107299805,0.048736572,-0.0029411316,-0.0015230179,-0.04220581,-0.018051147,0.0022182465,-0.023803711,0.007827759,-0.031402588,-0.0022888184,-0.04272461,0.033599854,0.0070343018,0.03540039,-0.0017900467,0.0006160736,0.009918213,-0.016586304,-0.018630981,-0.009590149,-0.020004272,-0.042022705,-0.009971619,-0.0025310516,-0.02067566,-0.014251709,0.014305115,0.0047416687,-0.021408081,0.046722412,0.03829956,-0.015388489,-0.011558533,-0.01084137,0.057434082,0.00018644333,-0.0087509155,0.0055160522,-0.015960693,-0.007785797,0.007141113