('unipile', 'Unipile', 'crm', 'Send and read messages across LinkedIn, WhatsApp, email and calendars through one unified API.', '/services/unipile.png', '{"name":"Unipile","slug":"unipile","inputs":[{"key":"UNIPILE_API_KEY","help":"Unipile dashboard -> Access Tokens -> create a token, then copy it.","type":"password","label":"Unipile access token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"Your Unipile access token"},{"key":"UNIPILE_DSN","help":"The host:port shown next to your access token in the Unipile dashboard. Every API call is routed through it.","type":"text","label":"Unipile DSN","secret":false,"required":true,"placeholder":"api8.unipile.com:13887"}],"skills":[{"body":"# Unipile\n\nUnipile is one REST API over LinkedIn, WhatsApp, Instagram, Telegram, Gmail/Outlook/IMAP mailboxes and Google/Outlook calendars. Every call acts on behalf of an account the owner connected in their Unipile dashboard.\n\nWork in three steps: `search-endpoints` (or `list-endpoints`) to find the endpoint, `get-endpoint` to read its parameters and body schema, then `execute-request` to call it. Your access token is already attached to every request.\n\nBase URL: `https://${input.UNIPILE_DSN}/api/v1`. Ignore the host returned by `get-server-variables`: its `api1.unipile.com:13111` default is a placeholder that answers `no_client_session`.\n\nStart with `GET /api/v1/accounts` to list the connected accounts and pick the `account_id` to pass along. Main families: `/chats` and `/messages` for WhatsApp, LinkedIn, Instagram and Telegram conversations; `/emails` and `/drafts` for Gmail, Outlook and IMAP mailboxes; `/calendars` for events; `/linkedin/*`, `/users/*` and `/posts` for LinkedIn search, profiles, invitations, posts and job postings.\n\nSending a message, an invitation or a post acts publicly as the connected account and cannot be undone. Confirm the recipient and the exact wording with the account owner first.","name":"unipile-usage","description":"How to use Unipile tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Send and read messages across LinkedIn, WhatsApp, email and calendars through one unified API.","category":"crm","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://developer.unipile.com/mcp?branch=v1.0","args":[],"name":"unipile","headers":{"X-API-KEY":"${input.UNIPILE_API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects Unipile''s hosted MCP server with your API key. One REST API over LinkedIn, WhatsApp, Instagram, Telegram, Gmail/Outlook/IMAP mailboxes and Google/Outlook calendars, acting on behalf of the accounts connected in your Unipile dashboard."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.008285522,-0.008842468,0.03677368,0.040863037,0.005214691,-0.060546875,-0.026062012,0.043060303,0.026565552,-0.013404846,0.0076293945,-0.023101807,-0.042175293,0.009597778,0.034820557,-0.004585266,0.0005021095,0.022476196,-0.04714966,0.050689697,0.044952393,0.02748108,0.008293152,0.036865234,0.0048294067,0.016952515,-0.014625549,0.031585693,-0.045196533,-0.024551392,0.0345459,-0.024093628,0.005065918,0.042266846,0.012535095,0.028289795,-0.030776978,0.09185791,-0.013916016,0.024551392,-0.022506714,-0.006954193,0.0027427673,-0.0024852753,-0.01826477,0.018844604,-0.068847656,0.03451538,0.05102539,0.0259552,-0.015007019,0.021057129,-0.013420105,0.02255249,-0.050231934,-0.0072402954,0.03286743,0.017150879,-0.009803772,0.010772705,-0.026657104,-0.037994385,0.015991211,-0.013153076,-0.034973145,-0.006378174,-0.011398315,0.037139893,-0.0021648407,0.012763977,-0.012138367,0.02168274,0.019638062,-0.009521484,0.007972717,-0.033599854,0.000579834,0.06689453,-0.0067710876,-0.02116394,0.018188477,-0.01159668,-0.02859497,-0.019439697,-0.026885986,-0.036834717,-0.007896423,0.0028915405,-0.040161133,0.01713562,-0.027236938,-0.018829346,-0.05657959,-0.0009889603,0.04925537,-0.04095459,-0.005504608,-0.007896423,-0.005584717,0.06604004,0.024673462,-0.023406982,-0.056518555,-0.03451538,-0.0026988983,-0.013870239,0.04888916,-0.032196045,0.00970459,0.02633667,-0.12670898,-0.011604309,-0.018829346,-0