('viator', 'Viator', 'ecommerce', 'Discover and book travel experiences, tours, and attractions through Viator''s official MCP server.', '/services/viator.png?tone=light', '{"name":"Viator","slug":"viator","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Viator\n\nViator exposes an official remote MCP server for discovering and booking travel experiences, tours, and attractions.\n\n## Connecting\n\nThe server is hosted at `https://exp-app-mcp.prod.ep.viator.com/mcp` (Streamable HTTP). On first connection your MCP client opens a browser window to sign in and authorize access via OAuth; credentials are reused for later sessions. There is no API key to paste.\n\n## Usage\n\nUse the available tools to search and narrow travel experiences by:\n\n- Destination (city, region, or attraction)\n- Travel dates\n- Price range\n- Category (tours, activities, tickets, etc.)\n- Practical trip details\n\nCall the tool listing after connecting to see the exact tools and parameters the server supports, then query for experiences that match the traveler''s request.","name":"viator-usage","description":"How to use Viator MCP tools to find travel experiences"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Discover and book travel experiences, tours, and attractions through Viator''s official MCP server.","category":"ecommerce","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://exp-app-mcp.prod.ep.viator.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"viator","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Viator is a Tripadvisor company operating a global marketplace for tours, activities, and attraction tickets. Its official remote MCP server lets AI assistants search and browse travel experiences by destination, dates, price range, and category. Connect via browser OAuth sign-in; no API key needs to be pasted."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.015151978,-0.0058937073,0.0024108887,0.0028476715,-0.019592285,-0.022964478,-0.027954102,0.037872314,0.014633179,0.02180481,0.012161255,0.0022411346,-0.010467529,-0.008026123,-0.0035133362,0.04257202,-0.056