('webex', 'Webex', 'productivity', 'Connect AI agents to Cisco Webex messaging to send, edit, and search messages and manage spaces and memberships.', '/services/webex.svg?tone=dark', '{"name":"Webex","slug":"webex","inputs":[{"key":"WEBEX_TOKEN","help":"Generate a token at https://developer.webex.com/agentic-token (issued with the spark:mcp scope). Your Webex org admin must first enable the MCP server in Control Hub under Apps > Agentic Apps.","type":"password","label":"Webex agentic token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"M2Y..."}],"skills":[{"body":"# Webex Messaging\n\nThe Webex Messaging MCP server lets you work with Cisco Webex spaces (rooms) and messages.\n\n## Common tasks\n- Send, edit, delete, and retrieve messages in 1:1 and group spaces.\n- Create and manage spaces (rooms) and their memberships.\n- Search messages, files, and spaces.\n\n## Auth\nRequests are authenticated with a Webex agentic (WCIT) token sent as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Generate one at https://developer.webex.com/agentic-token. The base token carries the `spark:mcp` scope; individual tools may prompt for additional scopes at runtime via MCP elicitation.\n\n## Prerequisite\nA Webex Control Hub org admin must enable the MCP server (Apps > Agentic Apps, set Access to Allowed) before it can be used.","name":"webex-usage","description":"How to use the Webex Messaging MCP tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Connect AI agents to Cisco Webex messaging to send, edit, and search messages and manage spaces and memberships.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.webexapis.com/mcp/webex-messaging","args":[],"name":"webex-messaging","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.WEBEX_TOKEN}"},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Webex is Cisco''s team collaboration platform for messaging, meetings, and calling. This connector uses the official Cisco-hosted Webex Messaging MCP server, giving agents tools to create, edit, delete, and retrieve messages in 1:1 and group spaces, manage spaces and memberships, and search messages, files, and spaces. Authentication uses a Webex agentic (WCIT) token passed as a bearer credential."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.017227173,-0.0026226044,0.07556152,0.005203247,-0.023895264,-0.0309906,0.040100098,0.082336426,0.047180176,-0.0072364807,0.011924744,-0.023239136,-0.017791748,-0.0059814453,-0.02520752,0.018692017,-0.027252197,0.007183075,-0.0062065125,-0.017242432,-0.010414124,0.08514404,0.014183044,0.04626465,-0.035736084,0.016952515,-0.057678223,0.046722412,0.019104004,-0.0178833,0.023422241,-0.021453857,0.008773804,0.008613586,-0.019760132,0.038024902,-0.0010242462,0.06982422,0.0011501312,0.0023841858,-0.028656006,0.058746338,-0.0035190582,0.005290985,0.0042304993,-0.0087509155,-0.051483154,0.0054893494,0.019195557,-0.0023078918,0.004333496,0.034851074,0.020202637,0.0044288635,-0.04901123,-0.017410278,0.019607544,0.02178955,-0.025894165,-0.020736694,-0.008262634,-0.049194336,-0.0033664703,0.019241333,-0.024749756,0.007133484,0.012161255,-0.017181396,-0.030151367,-0.021621704,-0.00031161308,0.045074463,-0.03338623,0.031341553,-0.022155762,-0.018936157,-0.014198303,0.026824951,-0.03439331,-0.004901886,0.003982544,-0.012229919,-0.07122803,-0.003129959,-0.033935547,0.0036945343,0.004096985,-0.04156494,-0.030456543,0.0070266724,-0.027633667,0.005821228,-0.030822754,-0.015182495,0.0368042,0.057739258,-0.023757935,-0.019241333,-0.021408081,0.025268555,0.026489258,-0.064208984,-0.06744385,0.017669678,0.034606934,-0.0038909912,0.044647217,-0.024002075,-0.06390381,0.008865356,-0.09539795,-0.043792725,-0.04135132,0.008422852,0.019332886,-0.043670654,0.029800415,-0.017623901,-0.008796692,0.017715454,-0.026779175,0.04763794,0.0035438538,-0.07733154,0.013885498,-0.00035190582,-0.046722412,-0.016143799,-0.0045547485,-0.03265381,0.019760132,-0.010864258,0.08239746,-0.03314209,-0.052246094,-0.020858765,-0.002981186,0.029708862,-0.028564453,-0.012710571,0.05114746,-0.0024986267,0.03353882,-0.008369446,