('windsor', 'Windsor.ai', 'marketing', 'Query and analyze live marketing, advertising, analytics, CRM and warehouse data from 350+ sources in natural language.', '/services/windsor.png', '{"name":"Windsor.ai","slug":"windsor","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# Windsor.ai\n\nUse the windsor_* tools to query live business data that a user has connected in their Windsor.ai account, spanning 350+ marketing, advertising, analytics, e-commerce, CRM and database sources (Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok Ads, GA4, HubSpot, Salesforce, Shopify, Stripe, BigQuery, and more).\n\n## What you can do\n- Ask natural-language questions about performance: spend, ROAS, conversions, revenue by channel, campaign, or date range.\n- Break down and compare metrics across sources and time periods.\n- Where supported, take write actions: manage campaigns, ad sets/groups, ads, budgets, and bidding on Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok Ads, LinkedIn Ads, and Microsoft Ads.\n\n## Tips\n- Only data sources the user has already integrated in Windsor.ai are available; if a source is missing, ask them to connect it at https://onboard.windsor.ai.\n- Be explicit about date ranges and the metric/dimension you want so the tool returns the right slice.\n- Confirm before performing any write action that changes campaigns, budgets, or bidding.","name":"windsor-usage","description":"How to query and analyze integrated marketing and analytics data with the windsor_* tools."}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Query and analyze live marketing, advertising, analytics, CRM and warehouse data from 350+ sources in natural language.","category":"marketing","mcpServers":[],"authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Windsor.ai (OAuth)","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.windsor.ai/","args":[],"name":"windsor","oauth":{},"headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"api-key","kind":"key","label":"Windsor.ai API key","inputs":[{"key":"API_KEY","help":"Get it from the Windsor.ai onboard portal at https://onboard.windsor.ai (API access) after creating an account and connecting at least one data source.","type":"password","label":"Windsor.ai API Key","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"your-windsor-api-key"}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://mcp.windsor.ai/","args":[],"name":"windsor","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.API_KEY}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Connects the hosted Windsor.ai MCP server so agents can explore integrated marketing and analytics data (Meta Ads, Google Ads, GA4, HubSpot, Shopify, and more) and act on campaigns. Authenticate by signing in with Windsor.ai (OAuth) or by pasting a Windsor.ai API key as a Bearer token."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.026290894,0.03970337,0.036743164,0.0040130615,-0.019744873,-0.054382324,-0.033203125,-0.007621765,-0.030334473,0.014503479,0.019607544,0.0030593872,-0.046844482,-0.0345459,0.015205383,0.051940918,-0.015960693,0.033477783,-0.045135498,0.04751587,0.037750244,0.03060913,-0.00065517426,0.0143585205,-0.024139404,0.045715332,-0.067993164,-0.021133423,0.022033691,-0.008682251,0.057250977,-0.029769897,0.0017824173,0.042755127,0.026550293,0.0075416565,-0.0003297329,-0.0023422241,0.0051498413,0.018112183,-0.04611206,0.00566864,0.031433105,0.018112183,0.01965332,-0.003856659,-0.031082153,-0.043273926,0.04434204,0.02999878,-0.048675537,-0.018951416,-0.026916504,0.030075073,-0.018066406,0.016357422,0.030136108,0.0023097992,0.024932861,0.024032593,-0.018997192,-0.042816162,0.03152466,0.03491211,-0.030761719,-0.0033626556,-0.0009379387,0.019226074,-0.021820068,-0.01096344,0.009437561,0.03729248,0.010108948,-0.02758789,-0.02758789,0.0017967224,-0.032165527,0.06274414,-0.074035645,-0.024719238,-0.016693115,-0.0017337799,-0.03274536,-0.016296387,-0.02281189,-0.0236969,0.008399963,0.027069092,-0.012268066,0.043670654,-0.042236328,0.036132812,-0.014656067,0.008590698,0.039642334,0.02822876,0.008277893,0.011817932,0.034057617