('youtube', 'YouTube', 'marketing', 'Search YouTube, read channel and video stats, publish and moderate.', '/services/youtube.svg', '{"name":"YouTube","slug":"youtube","skills":[{"body":"# YouTube\n\nYOUTUBE_SEARCH_YOU_TUBE searches videos, channels and playlists. It is quota-expensive, so when the user gives an @handle resolve it with YOUTUBE_GET_CHANNEL_ID_BY_HANDLE instead of searching for it.\n\nResearch: YOUTUBE_LIST_CHANNELS for channel details, YOUTUBE_GET_CHANNEL_STATISTICS for subscriber and view counts, YOUTUBE_LIST_CHANNEL_VIDEOS to walk a channel''s uploads, YOUTUBE_GET_CHANNEL_ACTIVITIES for what happened recently and YOUTUBE_GET_VIDEO_DETAILS_BATCH to read many videos in one call. For the content of a video, list its tracks with YOUTUBE_LIST_CAPTION_TRACK then download one with YOUTUBE_LOAD_CAPTIONS, which only works on the connected channel''s own videos.\n\nComments: read with YOUTUBE_LIST_COMMENT_THREADS2, answer with YOUTUBE_CREATE_COMMENT_REPLY, start a new one with YOUTUBE_POST_COMMENT. Anything posted is public under the user''s identity, so confirm the wording first.\n\nPlaylists: YOUTUBE_LIST_USER_PLAYLISTS, YOUTUBE_CREATE_PLAYLIST, YOUTUBE_ADD_VIDEO_TO_PLAYLIST, YOUTUBE_LIST_PLAYLIST_ITEMS. Subscriptions: YOUTUBE_LIST_USER_SUBSCRIPTIONS.\n\nPublishing: YOUTUBE_UPLOAD_VIDEO, then YOUTUBE_UPDATE_VIDEO for title, description, tags and privacy, and YOUTUBE_UPDATE_THUMBNAIL for the cover. YOUTUBE_UPDATE_VIDEO replaces the metadata it is given, so read the video first and resend the fields you are not changing. Upload as `private` unless the user explicitly asked to publish.","name":"youtube-usage","description":"How to use YouTube tools"}],"summary":"Search YouTube, read channel and video stats, publish and moderate.","category":"marketing","authMethods":[{"id":"composio","kind":"composio","label":"Connect with YouTube","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"composio":{"toolkit":"youtube","allowedTools":["YOUTUBE_SEARCH_YOU_TUBE","YOUTUBE_LIST_CHANNELS","YOUTUBE_GET_CHANNEL_ID_BY_HANDLE","YOUTUBE_GET_CHANNEL_STATISTICS","YOUTUBE_LIST_CHANNEL_VIDEOS","YOUTUBE_GET_CHANNEL_ACTIVITIES","YOUTUBE_GET_VIDEO_DETAILS_BATCH","YOUTUBE_LIST_CAPTION_TRACK","YOUTUBE_LOAD_CAPTIONS","YOUTUBE_LIST_COMMENT_THREADS2","YOUTUBE_POST_COMMENT","YOUTUBE_CREATE_COMMENT_REPLY","YOUTUBE_LIST_USER_PLAYLISTS","YOUTUBE_CREATE_PLAYLIST","YOUTUBE_ADD_VIDEO_TO_PLAYLIST","YOUTUBE_LIST_PLAYLIST_ITEMS","YOUTUBE_UPDATE_VIDEO","YOUTUBE_UPDATE_THUMBNAIL","YOUTUBE_UPLOAD_VIDEO","YOUTUBE_LIST_USER_SUBSCRIPTIONS"],"authConfigId":""},"mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"${LUMVIKA_HUB_BASE_URL}/api/mcp/composio/youtube","args":[],"name":"youtube","headers":{"x-lumvika-key":"${LUMVIKA_API_KEY}","x-lumvika-agent":"${agent.id}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true}],"description":"YouTube in one click: sign in with Google and your agent can search the platform, pull channel and video statistics, read captions and comments, and publish or update videos on the connected channel. The connection is brokered by Composio, whose Google app is verified, so no Google Cloud setup is needed.","multiInstance":true}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.010284424,0.03387451,-0.04699707,0.005367279,0.004047394,-0.020263672,0.006011963,-0.0116119385,-0.0077819824,0.008476257,0.05404663,-0.008903503,-0.004634857,0.0018501282,0.005634308,-0.010749817,-0.025726318,0.017990112,0.04196167,0.031921387,0.003255844,0.010040283,-0.011756897,0.06317139,-0.0037879944,-0.020141602,-0.0368042,0.016433716,-0.018997192,-0.04055786,-0.004558563,-0.02168274,-0.032958984,0.010131836,0.03326416,-0.02986145,0.008224487,-0.026489258,0.011650085,0.020507812,0.008628845,0.04232788,0.038482666,-0.0015478134,0.017654419,0.028045654,-0.040649414,0.002576828,0.015853882,-0.008232117,-0.008552551,0.047790527,-0.0231781,-0.026000977,-0.019042969,-0.008506775,0.010406494,-0.0029697418,-0.033691406,0.011306763,-0.06561279,-0.039733887,-0.025054932,0.01826477,-0.020126343,-0.01878357,-0.049438477,0.013084412,-0.04626465,-0.016