('zapier', 'Zapier', 'productivity', 'Let an agent take actions across 9,000+ apps (Gmail, Slack, Salesforce, and more) through Zapier''s hosted MCP server.', '/services/zapier.svg', '{"name":"Zapier","slug":"zapier","inputs":[],"skills":[],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Let an agent take actions across 9,000+ apps (Gmail, Slack, Salesforce, and more) through Zapier''s hosted MCP server.","category":"productivity","mcpServers":[],"authMethods":[{"id":"oauth","kind":"oauth","label":"Sign in with Zapier (OAuth)","inputs":[],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"url":"https://mcp.zapier.com/api/v1/connect","name":"zapier","oauth":{},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":true},{"id":"connection-token","kind":"key","label":"Connection token (API key)","inputs":[{"key":"ZAPIER_MCP_TOKEN","help":"Create a server at https://mcp.zapier.com, open its Connect tab, and click Generate token. Copy it immediately — it is shown only once.","type":"password","label":"Zapier MCP connection token","secret":true,"required":true,"placeholder":"zapier_mcp_key_..."}],"envKeys":[],"mcpServers":[{"url":"https://mcp.zapier.com/api/v1/connect","name":"zapier","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer ${input.ZAPIER_MCP_TOKEN}"},"transport":"http"}],"recommended":false}],"description":"Zapier MCP exposes your Zapier account''s connected apps as MCP tools over a single hosted streamable-HTTP endpoint. Agents can trigger actions across 9,000+ integrations using your existing Zapier app connections. Connect via standard OAuth (recommended, supports OAuth 2.1 and Dynamic Client Registration) or with a personal connection token as a Bearer header. Available actions depend on which apps and actions you enable on your MCP server at mcp.zapier.com."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[0.003610611,0.022720337,0.013641357,0.031463623,-0.019592285,-0.03213501,0.040161133,0.084106445,-0.0022563934,-0.008010864,0.0055274963,0.004627228,-0.036621094,0.014518738,0.0006632805,0.027435303,-0.012229919,-0.030883789,-0.0435791,0.049957275,0.0243682