('ziprecruiter', 'ZipRecruiter', 'other', 'Search live ZipRecruiter job listings across the US and Canada from your AI assistant.', '/services/ziprecruiter.png', '{"name":"ZipRecruiter","slug":"ziprecruiter","inputs":[],"skills":[{"body":"# ZipRecruiter Job Search\n\nThe ZipRecruiter MCP server exposes a single read-only tool, `search_jobs`, for finding live job listings in the United States and Canada.\n\n## search_jobs\nSearch parameters (all optional unless noted):\n- `job_role`: specific role, e.g. `software engineer`. Omit for broad searches.\n- `skills`: array of relevant skills, e.g. `[\"SQL\"]`.\n- `location`: concrete city, state, zip, or address (e.g. `Montreal, Quebec`). Ask the user for a location before searching unless they want remote jobs; without a location the search defaults to a US-wide search and warns.\n- `radius_miles`: search radius from the location.\n- `country_admin_code`: ISO-3166-1 alpha-2 country code, only when a concrete location makes the country known.\n- `max_posted_minutes_ago`: minimum 1440 (jobs posted within N minutes).\n- `salary_min` / `salary_max`: annual salary filters (0–300000).\n- `location_types`: PHYSICAL, REMOTE, HYBRID.\n- `employment_types`: FULL_TIME, PART_TIME, CONTRACT, CONTRACT_TO_HIRE, TEMPORARY, AS_NEEDED, INTERNSHIP, OTHER.\n- `seniority_classes`: NO_EXPERIENCE, JUNIOR, MID, SENIOR.\n- `offset`: pagination offset.\n\n## Tips\n- Only provide fields the user explicitly stated.\n- To search multiple distinct roles, call the tool once per role for cleaner results.\n- Results include a `job_redirect_url` that opens the listing on ZipRecruiter to view details or apply.\n","name":"ziprecruiter-usage","description":"How to use ZipRecruiter tools"}],"envKeys":[],"summary":"Search live ZipRecruiter job listings across the US and Canada from your AI assistant.","category":"other","mcpServers":[{"env":{},"url":"https://api.ziprecruiter.com/mcp","args":[],"name":"ziprecruiter","headers":{},"transport":"http"}],"description":"Connects to ZipRecruiter''s official job-seeker MCP server to search real-time job openings by role, skills, location, salary, work style, employment type, seniority, and posting date. Returns structured job results with company, salary range, location, and a link to view or apply on ZipRecruiter. Read-only, no credentials required."}'::jsonb, true, false, '[-0.033691406,0.03970337,0.019515991,0.03717041,-0.012878418,-0.050476074,-0.0039100647,0.024353027,-0.0014925003,-0.008468628,0.0040893555,-0.003145218,0.012397766,0.02267456,-0.014335632,0.026031494,-1.5437603e-05,0.017181396,-0.04171753,0.020965576,0.024749756,0.023376465,-0.025497437,-0.007091522,0.023223877,0.008087158,-0.046813965,0.05706787,-0.012992859,-0.052001953,-0.0018339157,-0.027923584,-0.043273926,0.027877808,0.0015172958,0.004096985,-0.010231018,0.005607605,0.032348633,0.0019273758,0.021759033,0.0770874,0.022094727,0.006980896,-0.013519287,0.034454346,-0.060668945,-0.013290405,0.03778076,0.017456055,-0.039855957,0.006778717,-0.06713867,0.004611969,-0.03466797,0.00044822693,0.0206604,-0.02998352,0.01876831,0.032440186,0.027114868,-0.05078125,0.0076904297,0.0317688,-0.034301758,0.011894226,-0.005962372,0.022918701,-0.028381348,-0.018127441,-0.007297516,-0.02053833,0.0036754608,-0.00111866,0.013343811,-0.030334473,0.011894226,0.07128906,-0.039398193,-0.032714844,0.013885498,0.030838013,-0.0047721863,-0.076171875,-0.04043579,-0.0047302246,-0.0002989769,-0.032287598,-0.020019531,0.0071792603,-0.04458618,0.026733398,0.003604889,0.015975952,0.039123535,0.012275696,0.013961792,-0.015991211,0.0018453598,0.093688965,-0.052520752,-0.025894165,-0.013191223,-0.014419556,0.028076172,0.0012512207,-0.018066406,-0.027801514,0.025604248,-0.0033359528,-0.117614746,0.033081055,-0.03488159,0.0022182465,0.0082092285,-0.0038528442,0.013938904,-0.060516357,-0.026229858,-0.0026874542,-0.028030396,0.012512207,-0.011161804,-0.055145264,-0.009689331,-0.03225708,-0.028152466,-0.009666443,-0.06335449,-0.031585693,-0.020309